msgstr "ຊື່ໂດເມນ"

#: src/usr/local/www/services_dhcpv6.php:751 src/usr/local/www/services_dhcp_edit.php:606
msgid "The default is to use the domain name of this system as the default domain name provided by DHCP. An alternate domain name may be specified here. "
msgstr "ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນຈະໃຊ້ຊື່ໂດເມນຂອງລະບົບນີ້ ເປັນຊື່ໂດເມນເລີ່ມຕົ້ນທີ່ສະໜອງໃຫ້ໂດຍ DHCP. ສາມາດລະບຸຊື່ໂດເມນອື່ນໄດ້ທີ່ນີ້. "

