#: src/usr/local/www/services_dhcpv6.php:758 src/usr/local/www/services_dhcp.php:1215 src/usr/local/www/services_dhcp_edit.php:613
msgid "The DHCP server can optionally provide a domain search list. Use the semicolon character as separator."
msgstr "ເຊີເວີ DHCP ສາມາດເລືອກໃຫ້ລາຍການຄົ້ນຫາໂດເມນໄດ້. ໃຊ້ເຄື່ອງໝາຍຈຸດຈ້ຳ (semicolon) ເພື່ອແຍກລາຍການ."

