msgid "Default lease time"
msgstr "ເວລາເຊົ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ"

#: src/usr/local/www/services_dhcpv6.php:765
#, php-format
msgid "Lease time in seconds. Used for clients that do not ask for a specific expiration time. %1$sThe default is 7200 seconds."
msgstr "ເວລາເຊົ່າເປັນວິນາທີ. ໃຊ້ສຳລັບລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ຮ້ອງຂໍເວລາໝົດອາຍຸສະເພາະ. %1$sຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນ 7200 ວິນາທີ."

#: src/usr/local/www/services_dhcpv6.php:770
msgid "Max lease time"
msgstr "ເວລາເຊົ່າສູງສຸດ"

#: src/usr/local/www/services_dhcpv6.php:773
#, php-format
msgid "Maximum lease time for clients that ask for a specific expiration time. %1$sThe default is 86400 seconds."
msgstr "ເວລາເຊົ່າສູງສຸດສຳລັບລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ຮ້ອງຂໍເວລາໝົດອາຍຸສະເພາະ. %1$sຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນ 86400 ວິນາທີ."

#: src/usr/local/www/services_dhcpv6.php:778
msgid "Time Format Change"
msgstr "ປ່ຽນຮູບແບບເວລາ"

#: src/usr/local/www/services_dhcpv6.php:781
msgid "By default DHCPv6 leases are displayed in UTC time. By checking this box DHCPv6 lease time will be displayed in local time and set to time zone selected. This will be used for all DHCPv6 interfaces lease time."
msgstr "ໂດຍປົກກະຕິ ເວລາເຊົ່າ DHCPv6 ຈະສະແດງເປັນເວລາ UTC. ຫາກໝາຍຫ້ອງນີ້ ເວລາເຊົ່າ DHCPv6 ຈະສະແດງເປັນເວລາທ້ອງຖິ່ນຕາມເຂດເວລາທີ່ເລືອກ. ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະມີຜົນກັບເວລາເຊົ່າຂອງທຸກອິນເຕີເຟສ DHCPv6."

