#: src/usr/local/www/interfaces_lagg_edit.php:281
msgid "In a <b>Slow</b> timeout, PDUs are sent every 30 seconds and in a <b>Fast</b> timeout, PDUs are sent every second. LACP timeout occurs when 3 consecutive PDUs are missed. If LACP timeout is a slow timeout, the time taken when 3 consecutive PDUs are missed is 90 seconds (3x30 seconds). If LACP timeout is a fast timeout, the time taken is 3 seconds (3x1 second)."
msgstr "ໃນ <b>Slow</b> timeout, PDU ຈະຖືກສົ່ງທຸກໆ 30 ວິນາທີ ແລະ ໃນ <b>Fast</b> timeout, PDU ຈະຖືກສົ່ງທຸກໆວິນາທີ. LACP timeout ຈະເກີດຂຶ້ນເມື່ອຂາດ PDU ຕິດຕໍ່ກັນ 3 ຄັ້ງ. ຫາກເປັນ slow timeout ຈະໃຊ້ເວລາ 90 ວິນາທີ, ຫາກເປັນ fast timeout ຈະໃຊ້ເວລາ 3 ວິນາທີ."

