#: src/usr/local/www/services_unbound_acls.php:154
#, php-format
msgid "%1$sDeny:%2$s Stops queries from hosts within the netblock defined below.%3$s"
msgstr "%1$sDeny:%2$s ຢຸດການຖາມຂໍ້ມູນ (queries) ຈາກໂຮສພາຍໃນບລັອກເຄືອຂ່າຍທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້ລຸ່ມນີ້.%3$s"

#: src/usr/local/www/services_unbound_acls.php:155
#, php-format
msgid "%1$sRefuse:%2$s Stops queries from hosts within the netblock defined below, but sends a DNS rcode REFUSED error message back to the client.%3$s"
msgstr "%1$sRefuse:%2$s ຢຸດການຖາມຂໍ້ມູນຈາກໂຮສພາຍໃນບລັອກເຄືອຂ່າຍທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້ລຸ່ມນີ້, ແຕ່ຈະສົ່ງຂໍ້ຄວາມຜິດພາດ DNS rcode REFUSED ກັບຄືນໄປຫາລູກຂ່າຍ.%3$s"

#: src/usr/local/www/services_unbound_acls.php:156
#, php-format
msgid "%1$sAllow:%2$s Allow queries from hosts within the netblock defined below.%3$s"
msgstr "%1$sAllow:%2$s ອະນຸຍາດການຖາມຂໍ້ມູນຈາກໂຮສພາຍໃນບລັອກເຄືອຂ່າຍທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້ລຸ່ມນີ້.%3$s"

#: src/usr/local/www/services_unbound_acls.php:157
#, php-format
msgid "%1$sAllow Snoop:%2$s Allow recursive and nonrecursive access from hosts within the netblock defined below. Used for cache snooping and ideally should only be configured for the administrative host.%3$s"
msgstr "%1$sAllow Snoop:%2$s ອະນຸຍາດການເຂົ້າເຖິງແບບ recursive ແລະ nonrecursive ຈາກໂຮສພາຍໃນບລັອກເຄືອຂ່າຍທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້ລຸ່ມນີ້. ໃຊ້ສຳລັບ cache snooping ແລະ ຄວນຕັ້ງຄ່າໃຫ້ສະເພາະໂຮສຂອງຜູ້ດູແລລະບົບເທົ່ານັ້ນ.%3$s"

#: src/usr/local/www/services_unbound_acls.php:158
#, php-format
msgid "%1$sDeny Nonlocal:%2$s Allow only authoritative local-data queries from hosts within the netblock defined below. Messages that are disallowed are dropped.%3$s"
msgstr "%1$sDeny Nonlocal:%2$s ອະນຸຍາດສະເພາະການຖາມຂໍ້ມູນ local-data ແບບ authoritative ຈາກໂຮສພາຍໃນບລັອກເຄືອຂ່າຍທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້ລຸ່ມນີ້. ຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ຮັບອະນຸຍາດຈະຖືກຖິ້ມ (dropped).%3$s"

#: src/usr/local/www/services_unbound_acls.php:159
#, php-format
msgid "%1$sRefuse Nonlocal:%2$s Allow only authoritative local-data queries from hosts within the netblock defined below. Sends a DNS rcode REFUSED error message back to the client for messages that are disallowed."
msgstr "%1$sRefuse Nonlocal:%2$s ອະນຸຍາດສະເພາະການຖາມຂໍ້ມູນ local-data ແບບ authoritative ຈາກໂຮສພາຍໃນບລັອກເຄືອຂ່າຍທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້ລຸ່ມນີ້. ຈະສົ່ງຂໍ້ຄວາມຜິດພາດ DNS rcode REFUSED ກັບຄືນໄປຫາລູກຂ່າຍສຳລັບຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ຮັບອະນຸຍາດ."

