msgstr "ການຕັ້ງຄ່າການເຂົ້າລະຫັດລັບ"

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_openvpn_client.php:738 src/usr/local/www/vpn_openvpn_server.php:894
msgid "TLS Configuration"
msgstr "ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ TLS"

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_openvpn_client.php:741 src/usr/local/www/vpn_openvpn_server.php:897
msgid "A TLS key enhances security of an OpenVPN connection by requiring both parties to have a common key before a peer can perform a TLS handshake. This layer of HMAC authentication allows control channel packets without the proper key to be dropped, protecting the peers from attack or unauthorized connections.The TLS Key does not have any effect on tunnel data."
msgstr "ຄີ TLS ຊ່ວຍເພີ່ມຄວາມປອດໄພໃຫ້ກັບການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ OpenVPN ໂດຍການກຳນົດໃຫ້ທັງສອງຝ່າຍຕ້ອງມີຄີດຽວກັນກ່ອນທີ່ຈະເຮັດ TLS handshake. ການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນແບບ HMAC ນີ້ຈະຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ແພັກເກັດໃນຊ່ອງທາງຄວບຄຸມ (control channel) ທີ່ບໍ່ມີຄີທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງຖືກຖິ້ມໄປ, ເພື່ອປ້ອງກັນການໂຈມຕີ ຫຼື ການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ຮັບອະນຸຍາດ. ຄີ TLS ນີ້ບໍ່ມີຜົນຕໍ່ຂໍ້ມູນພາຍໃນ tunnel."

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_openvpn_client.php:756 src/usr/local/www/vpn_openvpn_server.php:912
msgid "*TLS Key"
msgstr "*ຄີ TLS"

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_openvpn_client.php:758 src/usr/local/www/vpn_openvpn_server.php:914
#, php-format
msgid "Paste the TLS key here.%1$sThis key is used to sign control channel packets with an HMAC signature for authentication when establishing the tunnel. "
msgstr "ວາງຄີ TLS ໃສ່ບ່ອນນີ້.%1$sຄີນີ້ແມ່ນໃຊ້ເພື່ອເຊັນແພັກເກັດຊ່ອງທາງຄວບຄຸມດ້ວຍລາຍເຊັນ HMAC ເພື່ອຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນໃນເວລາສ້າງອຸໂມງ (tunnel). "

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_openvpn_client.php:763 src/usr/local/www/vpn_openvpn_server.php:920
msgid "*TLS Key Usage Mode"
msgstr "*ໂໝດການໃຊ້ງານຄີ TLS"

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_openvpn_client.php:766 src/usr/local/www/vpn_openvpn_server.php:923
#, php-format
msgid "In Authentication mode the TLS key is used only as HMAC authentication for the control channel, protecting the peers from unauthorized connections. %1$sEncryption and Authentication mode also encrypts control channel communication, providing more privacy and traffic control channel obfuscation."
msgstr "ໃນໂໝດຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນ (Authentication mode), ຄີ TLS ຈະຖືກໃຊ້ພຽງແຕ່ເປັນ HMAC authentication ສຳລັບຊ່ອງທາງຄວບຄຸມ ເພື່ອປ້ອງກັນການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ຮັບອະນຸຍາດ. %1$sໂໝດການເຂົ້າລະຫັດ ແລະ ຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນ ຈະເຂົ້າລະຫັດການສື່ສານໃນຊ່ອງທາງຄວບຄຸມນຳ, ເຊິ່ງຊ່ວຍເພີ່ມຄວາມເປັນສ່ວນຕົວ ແລະ ອຳພາງທຣາຟຟິກຂອງຊ່ອງທາງຄວບຄຸມ."

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_openvpn_client.php:774 src/usr/local/www/vpn_openvpn_server.php:932
msgid "*TLS keydir direction"
msgstr "*ທິດທາງ TLS keydir"

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_openvpn_client.php:777 src/usr/local/www/vpn_openvpn_server.php:935
msgid "The TLS Key Direction must be set to complementary values on the client and server. For example, if the server is set to 0, the client must be set to 1. Both may be set to omit the direction, in which case the TLS Key will be used bidirectionally."
msgstr "ທິດທາງຂອງຄີ TLS ຕ້ອງຖືກກຳນົດໃຫ້ເປັນຄ່າທີ່ກົງກັນຂ້າມກັນລະຫວ່າງລູກຂ່າຍ ແລະ ເຊີເວີ. ຕົວຢ່າງ: ຖ້າເຊີເວີຕັ້ງເປັນ 0, ລູກຂ່າຍຕ້ອງຕັ້ງເປັນ 1. ທັງສອງຝ່າຍສາມາດຕັ້ງໃຫ້ບໍ່ລະບຸທິດທາງກໍໄດ້, ເຊິ່ງໃນກໍລະນີນັ້ນຄີ TLS ຈະຖືກໃຊ້ງານທັງສອງທິດທາງ."

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_openvpn_client.php:784 src/usr/local/www/vpn_openvpn_client.php:790 src/usr/local/www/vpn_ipsec_phase1.php:919 src/usr/local/www/vpn_openvpn_server.php:942 src/usr/local/www/vpn_openvpn_server.php:948
