msgstr "ວາງຄີທີ່ໃຊ້ຮ່ວມກັນຢູ່ບ່ອນນີ້"

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_openvpn_client.php:826
msgid "Client Certificate"
msgstr "ໃບຢັ້ງຢືນລູກຂ່າຍ"

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_openvpn_client.php:833 src/usr/local/www/vpn_openvpn_server.php:1049
msgid "Data Encryption Negotiation"
msgstr "ການເຈລະຈາການເຂົ້າລະຫັດຂໍ້ມູນ (Data Encryption Negotiation)"

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_openvpn_client.php:836 src/usr/local/www/vpn_openvpn_server.php:1052
msgid "This option allows OpenVPN clients and servers to negotiate a compatible set of acceptable cryptographic data encryption algorithms from those selected in the Data Encryption Algorithms list below. Disabling this feature is deprecated."
msgstr "ຕົວເລືອກນີ້ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ລູກຂ່າຍ ແລະ ເຊີເວີ OpenVPN ເຈລະຈາເພື່ອເລືອກໃຊ້ອັນກໍຣິທຶມການເຂົ້າລະຫັດຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ເຂົ້າກັນໄດ້ ຈາກລາຍການທີ່ເລືອກໄວ້ຂ້າງລຸ່ມ. ການປິດໃຊ້ງານຟີເຈີນີ້ແມ່ນບໍ່ແນະນຳແລ້ວ."

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_openvpn_client.php:843 src/usr/local/www/vpn_openvpn_server.php:1056
msgid "Data Encryption Algorithms"
msgstr "ອັນກໍຣິທຶມການເຂົ້າລະຫັດຂໍ້ມູນ"

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_openvpn_client.php:852 src/usr/local/www/vpn_openvpn_server.php:1065
#, php-format
msgid "Available Data Encryption Algorithms%1$sClick to add or remove an algorithm from the list"
msgstr "ອັນກໍຣິທຶມການເຂົ້າລະຫັດຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ມີໃຫ້ %1$sຄລິກເພື່ອເພີ່ມ ຫຼື ລຶບອັນກໍຣິທຶມອອກຈາກລາຍການ"

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_openvpn_client.php:862 src/usr/local/www/vpn_openvpn_server.php:1075
msgid "Allowed Data Encryption Algorithms. Click an algorithm name to remove it from the list"
msgstr "ອັນກໍຣິທຶມການເຂົ້າລະຫັດຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ອະນຸຍາດ. ຄລິກທີ່ຊື່ເພື່ອລຶບອອກຈາກລາຍການ"

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_openvpn_client.php:867 src/usr/local/www/vpn_openvpn_server.php:1080
msgid "For backward compatibility, when an older peer connects that does not support dynamic negotiation, OpenVPN will use the Fallback Data Encryption Algorithm requested by the peer so long as it is selected in this list or chosen as the Fallback Data Encryption Algorithm."
msgstr "ເພື່ອຮອງຮັບລຸ້ນເກົ່າ, ເມື່ອມີການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຈາກຝ່າຍທີ່ບໍ່ຮອງຮັບການເຈລະຈາແບບໄດນາມິກ, OpenVPN ຈະໃຊ້ອັນກໍຣິທຶມການເຂົ້າລະຫັດຂໍ້ມູນແບບສຳຮອງ (Fallback) ຕາມທີ່ຝ່າຍນັ້ນຮ້ອງຂໍ ຕາບໃດທີ່ອັນກໍຣິທຶມນັ້ນຖືກເລືອກໄວ້ໃນລາຍການນີ້ ຫຼື ຖືກຕັ້ງເປັນຄ່າສຳຮອງ."

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_openvpn_client.php:864 src/usr/local/www/vpn_openvpn_server.php:1077
#, php-format
msgid "The order of the selected Data Encryption Algorithms is respected by OpenVPN.%1$s%2$s%3$s"
msgstr "OpenVPN ຈະໃຫ້ຄວາມສຳຄັນຕາມລຳດັບຂອງອັນກໍຣິທຶມການເຂົ້າລະຫັດຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ເລືອກ. %1$s%2$s%3$s"

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_openvpn_client.php:875 src/usr/local/www/vpn_openvpn_server.php:1088
msgid "Fallback Data Encryption Algorithm"
msgstr "ອັນກໍຣິທຶມການເຂົ້າລະຫັດຂໍ້ມູນແບບສຳຮອງ (Fallback)"

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_openvpn_client.php:878 src/usr/local/www/vpn_openvpn_server.php:1091
msgid "The Fallback Data Encryption Algorithm used for data channel packets when communicating with clients that do not support data encryption algorithm negotiation. This algorithm is automatically included in the Data Encryption Algorithms list."
msgstr "ອັນກໍຣິທຶມການເຂົ້າລະຫັດຂໍ້ມູນແບບສຳຮອງທີ່ໃຊ້ສຳລັບແພັກເກັດໃນຊ່ອງທາງຂໍ້ມູນ ເມື່ອສື່ສານກັບລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ບໍ່ຮອງຮັບການເຈລະຈາອັນກໍຣິທຶມ. ອັນກໍຣິທຶມນີ້ຈະຖືກລວມເຂົ້າໃນລາຍການອັນກໍຣິທຶມການເຂົ້າລະຫັດຂໍ້ມູນໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ."

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_openvpn_client.php:884 src/usr/local/www/vpn_openvpn_server.php:1097
msgid "*Auth digest algorithm"
msgstr "*ອັນກໍຣິທຶມ Auth digest"

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_openvpn_client.php:887
#, php-format
msgid "The algorithm used to authenticate data channel packets, and control channel packets if a TLS Key is present.%1$sWhen an AEAD Encryption Algorithm mode is used, such as AES-GCM, this digest is used for the control channel only, not the data channel.%1$sSet this to the same value as the server. While SHA1 is the default for OpenVPN, this algorithm is insecure. "
msgstr "ອັນກໍຣິທຶມທີ່ໃຊ້ເພື່ອຢືນຢັນຄວາມຖືກຕ້ອງຂອງແພັກເກັດໃນຊ່ອງທາງຂໍ້ມູນ, ແລະ ຊ່ອງທາງຄວບຄຸມຫາກມີຄີ TLS.%1$sເມື່ອມີການໃຊ້ໂໝດອັນກໍຣິທຶມການເຂົ້າລະຫັດ AEAD ເຊັ່ນ AES-GCM, ຄ່າ digest ນີ້ຈະຖືກໃຊ້ສຳລັບຊ່ອງທາງຄວບຄຸມເທົ່ານັ້ນ, ບໍ່ແມ່ນຊ່ອງທາງຂໍ້ມູນ.%1$sກຳນົດຄ່ານີ້ໃຫ້ເປັນຄ່າດຽວກັນກັບເຊີເວີ. ເຖິງວ່າ SHA1 ຈະເປັນຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນສຳລັບ OpenVPN, ແຕ່ອັນກໍຣິທຶມນີ້ແມ່ນບໍ່ປອດໄພ. "

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_openvpn_client.php:893 src/usr/local/www/vpn_openvpn_server.php:1107 src/usr/local/www/widgets/widgets/system_information.widget.php:42
msgid "Hardware Crypto"
msgstr "ການເຂົ້າລະຫັດດ້ວຍຮາດແວ (Hardware Crypto)"

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_openvpn_client.php:900 src/usr/local/www/vpn_openvpn_csc.php:384 src/usr/local/www/vpn_openvpn_server.php:1129
msgid "Tunnel Settings"
msgstr "ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ Tunnel"

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_openvpn_client.php:904 src/usr/local/www/vpn_openvpn_csc.php:388 src/usr/local/www/vpn_openvpn_server.php:1133
msgid "IPv4 Tunnel Network"
msgstr "ເຄືອຂ່າຍ IPv4 Tunnel"

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_openvpn_client.php:907
msgid "This is the IPv4 virtual network used for private communications between this client and the server expressed using CIDR notation (e.g. 10.0.8.0/24). The second usable address in the network will be assigned to the client virtual interface. Leave blank if the server is capable of providing addresses to clients."
msgstr "ນີ້ແມ່ນເຄືອຂ່າຍສະເໝືອນ IPv4 ທີ່ໃຊ້ສຳລັບການສື່ສານສ່ວນຕົວລະຫວ່າງລູກຂ່າຍນີ້ ແລະ ເຊີເວີ ໂດຍໃຊ້ຮູບແບບ CIDR (ເຊັ່ນ: 10.0.8.0/24). ທີ່ຢູ່ທີສອງທີ່ໃຊ້ໄດ້ໃນເຄືອຂ່າຍຈະຖືກກຳນົດໃຫ້ກັບອິນເຕີເຟສສະເໝືອນຂອງລູກຂ່າຍ. ປ່ອຍຫວ່າງໄວ້ຫາກເຊີເວີສາມາດແຈກຈ່າຍທີ່ຢູ່ໃຫ້ລູກຂ່າຍໄດ້ເອງ."

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_openvpn_client.php:913 src/usr/local/www/vpn_openvpn_csc.php:398 src/usr/local/www/vpn_openvpn_server.php:1143
msgid "IPv6 Tunnel Network"
msgstr "ເຄືອຂ່າຍ IPv6 Tunnel"

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_openvpn_client.php:916
msgid "This is the IPv6 virtual network used for private communications between this client and the server expressed using CIDR notation (e.g. fe80::/64). When set static using this field, the ::2 address in the network will be assigned to the client virtual interface. Leave blank if the server is capable of providing addresses to clients."
msgstr "ນີ້ແມ່ນເຄືອຂ່າຍສະເໝືອນ IPv6 ທີ່ໃຊ້ສຳລັບການສື່ສານສ່ວນຕົວລະຫວ່າງລູກຂ່າຍນີ້ ແລະ ເຊີເວີ ໂດຍໃຊ້ຮູບແບບ CIDR (ເຊັ່ນ: fe80::/64). ເມື່ອຕັ້ງຄ່າແບບຄົງທີ່ໃນຊ່ອງນີ້, ທີ່ຢູ່ ::2 ໃນເຄືອຂ່າຍຈະຖືກກຳນົດໃຫ້ກັບອິນເຕີເຟສສະເໝືອນຂອງລູກຂ່າຍ. ປ່ອຍຫວ່າງໄວ້ຫາກເຊີເວີສາມາດແຈກຈ່າຍທີ່ຢູ່ໃຫ້ລູກຂ່າຍໄດ້ເອງ."

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_openvpn_client.php:923 src/usr/local/www/vpn_openvpn_server.php:1226
msgid "IPv4 Remote network(s)"
msgstr "ເຄືອຂ່າຍ IPv4 ປາຍທາງ"

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_openvpn_client.php:926 src/usr/local/www/vpn_openvpn_server.php:1229
msgid "IPv4 networks that will be routed through the tunnel, so that a site-to-site VPN can be established without manually changing the routing tables. Expressed as a comma-separated list of one or more CIDR ranges. If this is a site-to-site VPN, enter the remote LAN/s here. May be left blank for non site-to-site VPN."
msgstr "ເຄືອຂ່າຍ IPv4 ທີ່ຈະຖືກສົ່ງຜ່ານ tunnel ເພື່ອສ້າງ site-to-site VPN ໂດຍບໍ່ຕ້ອງປ່ຽນແປງຕາຕະລາງການກຳນົດເສັ້ນທາງເອງ. ລະບຸໃນຮູບແບບ CIDR ຫຼາຍລາຍການໂດຍແຍກດ້ວຍຈຸດ. ຫາກເປັນ site-to-site VPN, ໃຫ້ປ້ອນເຄືອຂ່າຍ LAN ປາຍທາງຢູ່ບ່ອນນີ້. ສາມາດປ່ອຍຫວ່າງໄວ້ໄດ້ຫາກບໍ່ແມ່ນ site-to-site VPN."

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_openvpn_client.php:932 src/usr/local/www/vpn_openvpn_server.php:1235
msgid "IPv6 Remote network(s)"
msgstr "ເຄືອຂ່າຍ IPv6 ປາຍທາງ"

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_openvpn_client.php:935 src/usr/local/www/vpn_openvpn_server.php:1238
msgid "These are the IPv6 networks that will be routed through the tunnel, so that a site-to-site VPN can be established without manually changing the routing tables. Expressed as a comma-separated list of one or more IP/PREFIX. If this is a site-to-site VPN, enter the remote LAN/s here. May be left blank for non site-to-site VPN."
msgstr "ເຄືອຂ່າຍ IPv6 ທີ່ຈະຖືກສົ່ງຜ່ານ tunnel ເພື່ອສ້າງ site-to-site VPN ໂດຍບໍ່ຕ້ອງປ່ຽນແປງຕາຕະລາງການກຳນົດເສັ້ນທາງເອງ. ລະບຸໃນຮູບແບບ IP/PREFIX ຫຼາຍລາຍການໂດຍແຍກດ້ວຍຈຸດ. ຫາກເປັນ site-to-site VPN, ໃຫ້ປ້ອນເຄືອຂ່າຍ LAN ປາຍທາງຢູ່ບ່ອນນີ້. ສາມາດປ່ອຍຫວ່າງໄວ້ໄດ້ຫາກບໍ່ແມ່ນ site-to-site VPN."

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_openvpn_client.php:941
msgid "Limit outgoing bandwidth"
msgstr "ຈຳກັດແບນວິດຂາອອກ"

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_openvpn_client.php:945
msgid "Maximum outgoing bandwidth for this tunnel. Leave empty for no limit. The input value has to be something between 100 bytes/sec and 100 Mbytes/sec (entered as bytes per second). Not compatible with UDP Fast I/O."
msgstr "ແບນວິດຂາອອກສູງສຸດສຳລັບ tunnel ນີ້. ປ່ອຍຫວ່າງໄວ້ເພື່ອບໍ່ຈຳກັດ. ຄ່າທີ່ປ້ອນຕ້ອງຢູ່ລະຫວ່າງ 100 bytes/sec ຫາ 100 Mbytes/sec (ປ້ອນເປັນ bytes ຕໍ່ວິນາທີ). ບໍ່ສາມາດໃຊ້ຮ່ວມກັບ UDP Fast I/O ໄດ້."

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_openvpn_client.php:950 src/usr/local/www/vpn_openvpn_server.php:1251
msgid "Allow Compression"
msgstr "ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ບີບອັດຂໍ້ມູນ (Compression)"

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_openvpn_client.php:953 src/usr/local/www/vpn_openvpn_server.php:1254
#, php-format
msgid "Allow compression to be used with this VPN instance. %1$sCompression can potentially increase throughput but may allow an attacker to extract secrets if they can control compressed plaintext traversing the VPN (e.g. HTTP). Before enabling compression, consult information about the VORACLE, CRIME, TIME, and BREACH attacks against TLS to decide if the use case for this specific VPN is vulnerable to attack. %1$s%1$sAsymmetric compression allows an easier transition when connecting with older peers. %1$s"
msgstr "ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ໃຊ້ການບີບອັດຂໍ້ມູນກັບ VPN instance ນີ້. %1$sການບີບອັດອາດຈະຊ່ວຍເພີ່ມຄວາມໄວໃນການສົ່ງຂໍ້ມູນ ແຕ່ກໍອາດຈະເປີດໂອກາດໃຫ້ຜູ້ໂຈມຕີສາມາດດຶງຂໍ້ມູນລັບໄດ້ ຫາກພວກເຂົາສາມາດຄວບຄຸມຂໍ້ຄວາມທຳມະດາທີ່ຖືກບີບອັດທີ່ສົ່ງຜ່ານ VPN (ເຊັ່ນ HTTP). ກ່ອນທີ່ຈະເປີດໃຊ້ງານ, ກະລຸນາສຶກສາຂໍ້ມູນກ່ຽວກັບການໂຈມຕີ VORACLE, CRIME, TIME, ແລະ BREACH ຕໍ່ TLS ເພື່ອເບິ່ງວ່າ VPN ຂອງທ່ານມີຄວາມສ່ຽງຫຼືບໍ່. %1$s%1$sການບີບອັດແບບ Asymmetric ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບລຸ້ນເກົ່າງ່າຍຂຶ້ນ. %1$s"

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_openvpn_client.php:963 src/usr/local/www/interfaces_ppps_edit.php:827 src/usr/local/www/vpn_openvpn_server.php:1264
msgid "Compression"
msgstr "ການບີບອັດ (Compression)"

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_openvpn_client.php:966 src/usr/local/www/vpn_openvpn_server.php:1267
#, php-format
msgid "Deprecated. Compress tunnel packets using the LZO algorithm. %1$sCompression can potentially dangerous and insecure. See the note on the Allow Compression option above. %1$s%1$sAdaptive compression will dynamically disable compression for a period of time if OpenVPN detects that the data in the packets is not being compressed efficiently."
msgstr "ບໍ່ແນະນຳໃຫ້ໃຊ້ແລ້ວ. ບີບອັດແພັກເກັດ tunnel ໂດຍໃຊ້ອັນກໍຣິທຶມ LZO. %1$sການບີບອັດອາດເປັນອັນຕະລາຍ ແລະ ບໍ່ປອດໄພ. ກະລຸນາເບິ່ງໝາຍເຫດໃນຕົວເລືອກ \"Allow Compression\" ຂ້າງເທິງ. %1$s%1$sAdaptive compression ຈະປິດການບີບອັດຊົ່ວຄາວໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ ຫາກ OpenVPN ກວດພົບວ່າຂໍ້ມູນໃນແພັກເກັດບໍ່ສາມາດບີບອັດໄດ້ຢ່າງມີປະສິດທິພາບ."

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_openvpn_client.php:974 src/usr/local/www/vpn_openvpn_server.php:1318
msgid "Topology"
msgstr "Topology"

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_openvpn_client.php:977
msgid "Specifies the method used to configure a virtual adapter IP address."
msgstr "ລະບຸວິທີການທີ່ໃຊ້ໃນການຕັ້ງຄ່າທີ່ຢູ່ IP ຂອງ virtual adapter."

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_openvpn_client.php:981 src/usr/local/www/vpn_openvpn_server.php:1282
msgid "Type-of-Service"
msgstr "Type-of-Service"

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_openvpn_client.php:988
msgid "Don't pull routes"
msgstr "ບໍ່ຕ້ອງດຶງ (pull) ເສັ້ນທາງ"

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_openvpn_client.php:991
msgid "This option still allows the server to set the TCP/IP properties of the client's TUN/TAP interface. "
msgstr "ຕົວເລືອກນີ້ຍັງຄົງອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ເຊີເວີກຳນົດຄຸນສົມບັດ TCP/IP ຂອງອິນເຕີເຟສ TUN/TAP ຂອງໄຄລເອັນ (client). "

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_openvpn_client.php:995
msgid "Don't add/remove routes"
msgstr "ບໍ່ຕ້ອງເພີ່ມ/ລຶບເສັ້ນທາງ"

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_openvpn_client.php:998
msgid "Do not execute operating system commands to install routes. Instead, pass routes to --route-up script using environmental variables."
msgstr "ບໍ່ຕ້ອງໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງຂອງລະບົບປະຕິບັດການເພື່ອຕິດຕັ້ງເສັ້ນທາງ. ແຕ່ໃຫ້ສົ່ງເສັ້ນທາງໄປຍັງສະຄຣິບ --route-up ໂດຍໃຊ້ຕົວປ່ຽນສະພາບແວດລ້ອມ (environmental variables) ແທນ."

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_openvpn_client.php:1002
msgid "Pull DNS"
msgstr "ດຶງຂໍ້ມູນ DNS"

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_openvpn_client.php:1005
msgid "If this option is set, pfSense will use DNS servers assigned by remote OpenVPN server for its own purposes (including the DNS Forwarder/DNS Resolver)."
msgstr "ຫາກເລືອກຕົວເລືອກນີ້, pfSense ຈະໃຊ້ DNS servers ທີ່ກຳນົດໂດຍ OpenVPN server ປາຍທາງ ສຳລັບການໃຊ້ງານພາຍໃນ (ລວມທັງ DNS Forwarder/DNS Resolver)."

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_openvpn_client.php:1009 src/usr/local/www/vpn_openvpn_server.php:1327
msgid "Ping settings"
msgstr "ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ Ping"

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_openvpn_client.php:1013 src/usr/local/www/vpn_openvpn_server.php:1331
msgid "Inactive"
msgstr "ບໍ່ມີການເຄື່ອນໄຫວ (Inactive)"

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_openvpn_client.php:1017 src/usr/local/www/vpn_openvpn_server.php:1335
#, php-format
msgid "Causes OpenVPN to exit after n seconds of inactivity on the TUN/TAP device.%1$sThe time length of inactivity is measured since the last incoming or outgoing tunnel packet.%1$s0 disables this feature.%1$s"
msgstr "ເຮັດໃຫ້ OpenVPN ຢຸດເຮັດວຽກຫຼັງຈາກບໍ່ມີການເຄື່ອນໄຫວໃນອຸປະກອນ TUN/TAP ເປັນເວລາ n ວິນາທີ. %1$sໄລຍະເວລາທີ່ບໍ່ມີການເຄື່ອນໄຫວຈະເລີ່ມນັບຕັ້ງແຕ່ແພັກເກັດ tunnel ຫຼ້າສຸດທີ່ຮັບ ຫຼື ສົ່ງ. %1$s0 ໝາຍເຖິງການປິດໃຊ້ງານຟີເຈີນີ້. %1$s"

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_openvpn_client.php:1025 src/usr/local/www/vpn_openvpn_server.php:1343
msgid "Ping method"
msgstr "ວິທີການ Ping"

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_openvpn_client.php:1028
#, php-format
msgid "keepalive helper uses interval and timeout parameters to define ping and ping-restart values as follows:%1$sping = interval%1$sping-restart = timeout%1$s"
msgstr "keepalive helper ໃຊ້ພາຣາມິເຕີ interval ແລະ timeout ເພື່ອກຳນົດຄ່າ ping ແລະ ping-restart ດັ່ງນີ້: %1$sping = interval %1$sping-restart = timeout %1$s"

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_openvpn_client.php:1036 src/usr/local/www/vpn_openvpn_server.php:1356
msgid "Interval"
msgstr "ຊ່ວງເວລາ (Interval)"

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_openvpn_client.php:1045 src/usr/local/www/interfaces.php:2253 src/usr/local/www/vpn_openvpn_server.php:1365
msgid "Timeout"
msgstr "ໝົດເວລາ (Timeout)"

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_openvpn_client.php:1058 src/usr/local/www/vpn_openvpn_server.php:1378
#, php-format
msgid "Ping remote over the TCP/UDP control channel if no packets have been sent for at least n seconds.%1$s"
msgstr "Ping ໄປຫາປາຍທາງຜ່ານຊ່ອງທາງຄວບຄຸມ TCP/UDP ຫາກບໍ່ມີການສົ່ງແພັກເກັດເປັນເວລາຢ່າງໜ້ອຍ n ວິນາທີ. %1$s"

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_openvpn_client.php:1064 src/usr/local/www/vpn_openvpn_server.php:1391
msgid "Ping restart or exit"
msgstr "Ping ເພື່ອເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໃໝ່ ຫຼື ອອກ"

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_openvpn_client.php:1067 src/usr/local/www/vpn_openvpn_server.php:1394
#, php-format
msgid "Exit or restart OpenVPN after timeout from remote%1$s"
msgstr "ອອກ ຫຼື ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ OpenVPN ໃໝ່ ຫຼັງຈາກໝົດເວລາການຕອບຮັບຈາກປາຍທາງ. %1$s"

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_openvpn_client.php:1072 src/usr/local/www/vpn_openvpn_server.php:1399
msgid "Ping restart or exit seconds"
msgstr "ວິນາທີສຳລັບການ Ping ເພື່ອເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໃໝ່ ຫຼື ອອກ"

