#: src/usr/local/www/services_unbound.php:326
msgid "Configures the DNS Resolver to act as a DNS over SSL/TLS server which can answer queries from clients which also support DNS over TLS. Activating this option disables automatic interface response routing behavior, thus it works best with specific interface bindings."
msgstr "ກຳນົດຄ່າ DNS Resolver ໃຫ້ເຮັດວຽກເປັນເຊີບເວີ DNS over SSL/TLS ເຊິ່ງສາມາດຕອບຄຳຖາມຈາກ client ທີ່ຮອງຮັບ DNS over TLS ໄດ້. ການເປີດໃຊ້ຕົວເລືອກນີ້ຈະປິດພຶດຕິກຳການກຳນົດເສັ້ນທາງການຕອບສະໜອງອິນເຕີເຟສແບບອັດຕະໂນມັດ, ດັ່ງນັ້ນມັນຈຶ່ງເຮັດວຽກໄດ້ດີທີ່ສຸດກັບການຜູກມັດອິນເຕີເຟສສະເພາະ."

#: src/usr/local/www/services_unbound.php:332 src/usr/local/www/services_unbound.php:338 src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_admin.php:117
msgid "SSL/TLS Certificate"
msgstr "ໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ SSL/TLS"

#: src/usr/local/www/services_unbound.php:335
msgid "The server certificate to use for SSL/TLS service. The CA chain will be determined automatically."
msgstr "ໃບຢັ້ງຢືນເຊີບເວີທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ສຳລັບບໍລິການ SSL/TLS. ສາຍໂສ້ CA ຈະຖືກກຳນົດໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ."

#: src/usr/local/www/services_unbound.php:346
msgid "SSL/TLS Listen Port"
msgstr "ພອດທີ່ລໍຖ້າການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ SSL/TLS"

#: src/usr/local/www/services_unbound.php:350
msgid "The port used for responding to SSL/TLS DNS queries. It should normally be left blank unless another service needs to bind to TCP/UDP port 853."
msgstr "ພອດທີ່ໃຊ້ສຳລັບຕອບສະໜອງຕໍ່ການສອບຖາມ DNS ແບບ SSL/TLS. ປົກກະຕິຄວນປະຫວ່າງໄວ້ ນອກຈາກວ່າມີບໍລິການອື່ນທີ່ຕ້ອງຜູກມັດກັບພອດ TCP/UDP 853."

#: src/usr/local/www/services_unbound.php:356
msgid "*Network Interfaces"
msgstr "*ອິນເຕີເຟສເຄືອຂ່າຍ"

#: src/usr/local/www/services_unbound.php:360
msgid "Interface IPs used by the DNS Resolver for responding to queries from clients. If an interface has both IPv4 and IPv6 IPs, both are used. Queries to other interface IPs not selected below are discarded. The default behavior is to respond to queries on every available IPv4 and IPv6 address."
msgstr "ທີ່ຢູ່ IP ຂອງອິນເຕີເຟສທີ່ DNS Resolver ໃຊ້ສຳລັບຕອບສະໜອງຕໍ່ການສອບຖາມຈາກ client. ຫາກອິນເຕີເຟສມີທັງ IP IPv4 ແລະ IPv6, ຈະຖືກໃຊ້ທັງສອງ. ການສອບຖາມໄປຫາ IP ອິນເຕີເຟສອື່ນທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ເລືອກຂ້າງລຸ່ມນີ້ຈະຖືກຖິ້ມໄປ. ພຶດຕິກຳມາດຕະຖານແມ່ນຕອບສະໜອງຕໍ່ການສອບຖາມໃນທຸກທີ່ຢູ່ IPv4 ແລະ IPv6 ທີ່ມີໃຫ້ໃຊ້."

#: src/usr/local/www/services_unbound.php:367
msgid "*Outgoing Network Interfaces"
msgstr "*ອິນເຕີເຟສເຄືອຂ່າຍຂາອອກ"

#: src/usr/local/www/services_unbound.php:371
msgid "Utilize different network interface(s) that the DNS Resolver will use to send queries to authoritative servers and receive their replies. By default all interfaces are used."
msgstr "ໃຊ້ອິນເຕີເຟສເຄືອຂ່າຍທີ່ຕ່າງກັນ ເພື່ອໃຫ້ DNS Resolver ໃຊ້ໃນການສົ່ງຄຳສອບຖາມໄປຫາເຊີບເວີທີ່ມີສິດອຳນາດ (authoritative servers) ແລະ ຮັບການຕອບກັບ. ໂດຍມາດຕະຖານແລ້ວຈະໃຊ້ທຸກອິນເຕີເຟສ."

#: src/usr/local/www/services_unbound.php:375
msgid "*System Domain Local Zone Type"
msgstr "*ປະເພດໂຊນທ້ອງຖິ່ນຂອງໂດເມນລະບົບ"

#: src/usr/local/www/services_unbound.php:378
#, php-format
msgid "The local-zone type used for the %1$s system domain (System | General Setup | Domain).  Transparent is the default.  Local-Zone type descriptions are available in the unbound.conf(5) manual pages."
msgstr "ປະເພດໂຊນທ້ອງຖິ່ນ (local-zone type) ທີ່ໃຊ້ສຳລັບໂດເມນລະບົບ %1$s (System | General Setup | Domain). Transparent ແມ່ນຄ່າມາດຕະຖານ. ຄຳອະທິບາຍປະເພດ Local-Zone ມີໃຫ້ເບິ່ງໃນໜ້າຄູ່ມື unbound.conf(5)."

