#: src/usr/local/www/services_unbound.php:422 src/usr/local/www/services_dnsmasq.php:289 src/usr/local/www/services_dnsmasq.php:293
msgid "DNS Query Forwarding"
msgstr "ການສົ່ງຕໍ່ຄຳສອບຖາມ DNS"

#: src/usr/local/www/services_unbound.php:425
#, php-format
msgid "If this option is set, DNS queries will be forwarded to the upstream DNS servers defined under %1$sSystem &gt; General Setup%2$s or those obtained via DHCP/PPP on WAN (if DNS Server Override is enabled there)."
msgstr "ຫາກເລືອກຕົວເລືອກນີ້, ຄຳສອບຖາມ DNS ຈະຖືກສົ່ງຕໍ່ໄປຫາເຊີບເວີ DNS ຕົ້ນທາງທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້ໃນ %1$sSystem > General Setup%2$s ຫຼື ເຊີບເວີທີ່ໄດ້ຮັບຜ່ານ DHCP/PPP ໃນ WAN (ຫາກເປີດໃຊ້ DNS Server Override ຢູ່ບ່ອນນັ້ນ)."

#: src/usr/local/www/services_unbound.php:434
msgid "When set in conjunction with DNS Query Forwarding, queries to all upstream forwarding DNS servers will be sent using SSL/TLS on the default port of 853. Note that ALL configured forwarding servers MUST support SSL/TLS queries on port 853."
msgstr "ເມື່ອຕັ້ງຮ່ວມກັບ DNS Query Forwarding, ຄຳສອບຖາມໄປຫາເຊີບເວີ DNS ສົ່ງຕໍ່ຕົ້ນທາງທັງໝົດ ຈະຖືກສົ່ງໂດຍໃຊ້ SSL/TLS ໃນພອດມາດຕະຖານ 853. ໝາຍເຫດ: ເຊີບເວີສົ່ງຕໍ່ທີ່ກຳນົດຄ່າໄວ້ທັງໝົດ ຕ້ອງຮອງຮັບການສອບຖາມແບບ SSL/TLS ໃນພອດ 853."

#: src/usr/local/www/services_unbound.php:441
#, php-format
msgid "If this option is set, then machines that specify their hostname when requesting an IPv4 DHCP lease will be registered in the DNS Resolver so that their name can be resolved. Note that this will cause the Resolver to reload and flush its resolution cache whenever a DHCP lease is issued. The domain in %1$sSystem &gt; General Setup%2$s should also be set to the proper value."
msgstr "ຫາກເລືອກຕົວເລືອກນີ້, ເຄື່ອງຕ່າງໆທີ່ລະບຸຊື່ໂຮສຂອງພວກເຂົາເມື່ອຂໍເຊົ່າໃຊ້ IPv4 DHCP ຈະຖືກລົງທະບຽນໃນ DNS Resolver ເພື່ອໃຫ້ສາມາດແປຊື່ຂອງພວກເຂົາໄດ້. ໝາຍເຫດ: ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ Resolver ໂຫລດໃໝ່ ແລະ ລຶບແຄຊ໌ການແປຊື່ທຸກຄັ້ງທີ່ມີການອອກໃບເຊົ່າ DHCP. ໂດເມນໃນ %1$sSystem > General Setup%2$s ຄວນຖືກຕັ້ງເປັນຄ່າທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງຄືກັນ."

#: src/usr/local/www/services_unbound.php:448 src/usr/local/www/services_dnsmasq.php:270
msgid "Static DHCP"
msgstr "DHCP ແບບຄົງທີ່"

#: src/usr/local/www/services_unbound.php:451
#, php-format
msgid "If this option is set, then DHCP static mappings will be registered in the DNS Resolver, so that their name can be resolved. The domain in %1$sSystem &gt; General Setup%2$s should also be set to the proper value."
msgstr "ຫາກເລືອກຕົວເລືອກນີ້, ການຈັບຄູ່ DHCP ແບບຄົງທີ່ ຈະຖືກລົງທະບຽນໃນ DNS Resolver ເພື່ອໃຫ້ສາມາດແປຊື່ຂອງພວກເຂົາໄດ້. ໂດເມນໃນ %1$sSystem > General Setup%2$s ຄວນຖືກຕັ້ງເປັນຄ່າທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງຄືກັນ."

