#: src/usr/local/www/services_dnsmasq.php:247
msgid "General DNS Forwarder Options"
msgstr "ຕົວເລືອກທົ່ວໄປຂອງ DNS Forwarder"

#: src/usr/local/www/services_dnsmasq.php:261
#, php-format
msgid "If this option is set machines that specify their hostname when requesting a DHCP lease will be registered in the DNS forwarder, so that their name can be resolved. The domain in %1$sSystem: General Setup%2$s should also be set to the proper value."
msgstr "ຫາກເລືອກຕົວເລືອກນີ້, ເຄື່ອງຕ່າງໆທີ່ລະບຸຊື່ໂຮສຂອງພວກເຂົາເມື່ອຂໍເຊົ່າ DHCP ຈະຖືກລົງທະບຽນໃນ DNS forwarder ເພື່ອໃຫ້ສາມາດແປຊື່ຂອງພວກເຂົາໄດ້. ໂດເມນໃນ %1$sSystem: General Setup%2$s ຄວນຖືກຕັ້ງເປັນຄ່າທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງຄືກັນ."

#: src/usr/local/www/services_dnsmasq.php:273
#, php-format
msgid "If this option is set, IPv4 DHCP static mappings will be registered in the DNS forwarder so that their name can be resolved. The domain in %1$sSystem: General Setup%2$s should also be set to the proper value."
msgstr "ຫາກເລືອກຕົວເລືອກນີ້, ການຈັບຄູ່ IPv4 DHCP ແບບຄົງທີ່ ຈະຖືກລົງທະບຽນໃນ DNS forwarder ເພື່ອໃຫ້ສາມາດແປຊື່ຂອງພວກເຂົາໄດ້. ໂດເມນໃນ %1$sSystem: General Setup%2$s ຄວນຖືກຕັ້ງເປັນຄ່າທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງຄືກັນ."

#: src/usr/local/www/services_dnsmasq.php:281
msgid "Prefer DHCP"
msgstr "ໃຫ້ບຸລິມະສິດແກ່ DHCP"

#: src/usr/local/www/services_dnsmasq.php:284
msgid "If this option is set DHCP mappings will be resolved before the manual list of names below. This only affects the name given for a reverse lookup (PTR)."
msgstr "ຫາກເລືອກຕົວເລືອກນີ້, ການຈັບຄູ່ DHCP ຈະຖືກແປຊື່ກ່ອນລາຍຊື່ທີ່ກຳນົດເອງຂ້າງລຸ່ມ. ສິ່ງນີ້ມີຜົນສະເພາະກັບຊື່ທີ່ໃຫ້ໄວ້ສຳລັບການຄົ້ນຫາແບບຍ້ອນກັບ (PTR) ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

#: src/usr/local/www/services_dnsmasq.php:296
#, php-format
msgid "If this option is set %1$s DNS Forwarder (dnsmasq) will query the DNS servers sequentially in the order specified (%2$sSystem - General Setup - DNS Servers%3$s), rather than all at once in parallel. "
msgstr "ຫາກຕົວເລືອກນີ້ຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າ %1$s DNS Forwarder (dnsmasq) ຈະສອບຖາມເຊີເວີ DNS ຕາມລຳດັບທີ່ໄດ້ລະບຸໄວ້ (%2$sSystem - General Setup - DNS Servers%3$s), ແທນທີ່ຈະສອບຖາມພ້ອມກັນທັງໝົດແບບຂະໜານ. "

#: src/usr/local/www/services_dnsmasq.php:305
#, php-format
msgid "If this option is set %s DNS Forwarder (dnsmasq) will not forward A or AAAA queries for plain names, without dots or domain parts, to upstream name servers.\t If the name is not known from /etc/hosts or DHCP then a \"not found\" answer is returned. "
msgstr "ຫາກຕົວເລືອກນີ້ຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າ %s DNS Forwarder (dnsmasq) ຈະບໍ່ສົ່ງຕໍ່ການສອບຖາມ (queries) A ຫຼື AAAA ສຳລັບຊື່ທົ່ວໄປທີ່ບໍ່ມີຈຸດ ຫຼື ສ່ວນຂອງໂດເມນ ໄປຫາເນມເຊີເວີຕົ້ນທາງ (upstream name servers). ຫາກບໍ່ພົບຊື່ນັ້ນໃນ /etc/hosts ຫຼື DHCP, ຈະມີການສົ່ງຄຳຕອບ \"ບໍ່ພົບ (not found)\" ກັບຄືນມາ. "

#: src/usr/local/www/services_dnsmasq.php:314
#, php-format
msgid "If this option is set %s DNS Forwarder (dnsmasq) will not forward reverse DNS lookups (PTR) for private addresses (RFC 1918) to upstream name servers.  Any entries in the Domain Overrides section forwarding private \"n.n.n.in-addr.arpa\" names to a specific server are still forwarded. If the IP to name is not known from /etc/hosts, DHCP or a specific domain override then a \"not found\" answer is immediately returned. "
msgstr "ຫາກຕົວເລືອກນີ້ຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າ %s DNS Forwarder (dnsmasq) ຈະບໍ່ສົ່ງຕໍ່ການຄົ້ນຫາ DNS ແບບຍ້ອນກັບ (PTR) ສຳລັບທີ່ຢູ່ສ່ວນຕົວ (RFC 1918) ໄປຫາເນມເຊີເວີຕົ້ນທາງ. ທຸກລາຍການໃນສ່ວນ Domain Overrides ທີ່ສົ່ງຕໍ່ຊື່ສ່ວນຕົວ \"n.n.n.in-addr.arpa\" ໄປຫາເຊີເວີສະເພາະ ແມ່ນຍັງຈະຖືກສົ່ງຕໍ່ຢູ່. ຫາກການຈັບຄູ່ IP ເປັນຊື່ ບໍ່ມີຢູ່ໃນ /etc/hosts, DHCP ຫຼື ການກຳນົດ domain override ໃດໜຶ່ງ, ຄຳຕອບ \"ບໍ່ພົບ (not found)\" ຈະຖືກສົ່ງຄືນໃນທັນທີ. "

#: src/usr/local/www/services_dnsmasq.php:333 src/usr/local/www/services_captiveportal.php:552
msgid "*Interfaces"
msgstr "*ອິນເຕີເຟສ"

#: src/usr/local/www/services_dnsmasq.php:337
msgid "Interface IPs used by the DNS Forwarder for responding to queries from clients. If an interface has both IPv4 and IPv6 IPs, both are used. Queries to other interface IPs not selected below are discarded. The default behavior is to respond to queries on every available IPv4 and IPv6 address."
msgstr "ທີ່ຢູ່ IP ຂອງອິນເຕີເຟສທີ່ DNS Forwarder ໃຊ້ສຳລັບຕອບສະໜອງຕໍ່ການສອບຖາມຈາກ client. ຫາກອິນເຕີເຟສມີທັງ IP IPv4 ແລະ IPv6, ຈະຖືກໃຊ້ທັງສອງ. ການສອບຖາມໄປຫາ IP ອິນເຕີເຟສອື່ນທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ເລືອກຂ້າງລຸ່ມນີ້ຈະຖືກຖິ້ມໄປ. ພຶດຕິກຳມາດຕະຖານແມ່ນຕອບສະໜອງຕໍ່ການສອບຖາມໃນທຸກທີ່ຢູ່ IPv4 ແລະ IPv6 ທີ່ມີໃຫ້ໃຊ້."

#: src/usr/local/www/services_dnsmasq.php:342
msgid "Strict binding"
msgstr "ການຜູກມັດແບບເຂັ້ມງວດ"

#: src/usr/local/www/services_dnsmasq.php:345
#, php-format
msgid "If this option is set, the DNS forwarder will only bind to the interfaces containing the IP addresses selected above, rather than binding to all interfaces and discarding queries to other addresses.%1$sThis option does NOT work with IPv6. If set, dnsmasq will not bind to IPv6 addresses."
msgstr "ຫາກເລືອກຕົວເລືອກນີ້, DNS forwarder ຈະຜູກມັດສະເພາະກັບອິນເຕີເຟສທີ່ມີທີ່ຢູ່ IP ທີ່ເລືອກໄວ້ຂ້າງເທິງເທົ່ານັ້ນ, ແທນທີ່ຈະຜູກມັດກັບທຸກອິນເຕີເຟສແລ້ວຖິ້ມຄຳສອບຖາມຂອງທີ່ຢູ່ອື່ນ.%1$sຕົວເລືອກນີ້ບໍ່ເຮັດວຽກກັບ IPv6. ຫາກເລືອກ, dnsmasq ຈະບໍ່ຜູກມັດກັບທີ່ຢູ່ IPv6."

#: src/usr/local/www/services_dnsmasq.php:353
msgid "Enter any additional options to add to the dnsmasq configuration here, separated by a space or newline."
msgstr "ປ້ອນຕົວເລືອກເພີ່ມເຕີມເພື່ອເພີ່ມໃສ່ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ dnsmasq ຢູ່ບ່ອນນີ້, ແຍກແຕ່ລະອັນດ້ວຍຊ່ອງວ່າງ ຫຼື ການຂຶ້ນແຖວໃໝ່."

