msgid "IP"
msgstr "IP"

#: src/usr/local/www/services_dnsmasq.php:485
msgid "If the DNS forwarder is enabled, the DHCP service (if enabled) will automatically serve the LAN IP address as a DNS server to DHCP clients so they will use the forwarder."
msgstr "ຫາກເປີດໃຊ້ DNS forwarder, ບໍລິການ DHCP (ຫາກເປີດໃຊ້) ຈະສົ່ງທີ່ຢູ່ IP ຂອງ LAN ໃຫ້ກັບ client DHCP ເປັນເຊີບເວີ DNS ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ ເພື່ອໃຫ້ພວກເຂົາໃຊ້ forwarder."

#: src/usr/local/www/services_dnsmasq.php:487
#, php-format
msgid "The DNS forwarder will use the DNS servers entered in %1$sSystem > General Setup%2$s or those obtained via DHCP or PPP on WAN if &quot;Allow DNS server list to be overridden by DHCP/PPP on WAN&quot; is checked. If that option is not used (or if a static IP address is used on WAN), at least one DNS server must be manually specified on the %1$sSystem > General Setup%2$s page."
msgstr "DNS forwarder ຈະໃຊ້ເຊີບເວີ DNS ທີ່ປ້ອນໄວ້ໃນ %1$sSystem > General Setup%2$s ຫຼື ເຊີບເວີທີ່ໄດ້ຮັບຜ່ານ DHCP ຫຼື PPP ໃນ WAN ຫາກມີການໝາຍເອົາ \"Allow DNS server list to be overridden by DHCP/PPP on WAN\". ຫາກບໍ່ໄດ້ໃຊ້ຕົວເລືອກນັ້ນ (ຫຼື ຫາກໃຊ້ທີ່ຢູ່ IP ແບບຄົງທີ່ໃນ WAN), ຕ້ອງລະບຸເຊີບເວີ DNS ຢ່າງໜ້ອຍໜຶ່ງອັນດ້ວຍຕົນເອງໃນໜ້າ %1$sSystem > General Setup%2$s."

