msgid "Country Code"
msgstr "ລະຫັດປະເທດ"

#: src/usr/local/www/system_certmanager.php:980 src/usr/local/www/system_certmanager.php:1074 src/usr/local/www/system_camanager.php:727
msgid "State or Province"
msgstr "ລັດ ຫຼື ແຂວງ"

#: src/usr/local/www/system_certmanager.php:988 src/usr/local/www/system_certmanager.php:1082 src/usr/local/www/system_camanager.php:735
msgid "City"
msgstr "ເມືອງ"

#: src/usr/local/www/system_certmanager.php:996 src/usr/local/www/system_certmanager.php:1090 src/usr/local/www/system_camanager.php:743
msgid "Organization"
msgstr "ອົງກອນ"

#: src/usr/local/www/system_certmanager.php:1004 src/usr/local/www/system_certmanager.php:1098 src/usr/local/www/system_camanager.php:751
msgid "Organizational Unit"
msgstr "ໜ່ວຍງານໃນອົງກອນ"

#: src/usr/local/www/system_certmanager.php:1011
msgid "External Signing Request"
msgstr "ຄຳຮ້ອງຂໍການລົງນາມຈາກພາຍນອກ"

#: src/usr/local/www/system_certmanager.php:1105
msgid "Choose an Existing Certificate"
msgstr "ເລືອກໃບຢັ້ງຢືນທີ່ມີຢູ່"

#: src/usr/local/www/system_certmanager.php:1137
msgid "*Existing Certificates"
msgstr "*ໃບຢັ້ງຢືນທີ່ມີຢູ່"

#: src/usr/local/www/system_certmanager.php:1144
msgid "Certificate Attributes"
msgstr "ຄຸນລັກສະນະຂອງໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ"

#: src/usr/local/www/system_certmanager.php:1148
msgid "Attribute Notes"
msgstr "ໝາຍເຫດຄຸນລັກສະນະ"

#: src/usr/local/www/system_certmanager.php:1150
msgid "The following attributes are added to certificates and requests when they are created or signed. These attributes behave differently depending on the selected mode."
msgstr "ຄຸນລັກສະນະຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ຈະຖືກເພີ່ມໃສ່ໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ ແລະ ຄຳຮ້ອງຂໍເມື່ອຖືກສ້າງ ຫຼື ລົງນາມ. ຄຸນລັກສະນະເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຈະເຮັດວຽກຕ່າງກັນ ຂຶ້ນກັບໂໝດທີ່ເລືອກ."

#: src/usr/local/www/system_certmanager.php:1154
msgid "For Internal Certificates, these attributes are added directly to the certificate as shown."
msgstr "ສຳລັບໃບຢັ້ງຢືນພາຍໃນ, ຄຸນລັກສະນະເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຈະຖືກເພີ່ມເຂົ້າໃນໃບຢັ້ງຢືນໂດຍກົງຕາມທີ່ສະແດງ."

#: src/usr/local/www/system_certmanager.php:1156
msgid "For Certificate Signing Requests, These attributes are added to the request but they may be ignored or changed by the CA that signs the request. "
msgstr "ສຳລັບຄຳຮ້ອງຂໍການລົງນາມໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ, ຄຸນລັກສະນະເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຈະຖືກເພີ່ມໃສ່ຄຳຮ້ອງຂໍ ແຕ່ພວກມັນອາດຈະຖືກບໍ່ສົນໃຈ ຫຼື ຖືກປ່ຽນແປງໂດຍ CA ທີ່ລົງນາມໃນຄຳຮ້ອງຂໍນັ້ນ. "

#: src/usr/local/www/system_certmanager.php:1158
msgid "If this CSR will be signed using the Certificate Manager on this firewall, set the attributes when signing instead as they cannot be carried over."
msgstr "ຫາກ CSR ນີ້ຈະຖືກລົງນາມໂດຍໃຊ້ຕົວຈັດການໃບຢັ້ງຢືນໃນໄຟວໍນີ້, ໃຫ້ຕັ້ງຄ່າຄຸນລັກສະນະໃນຂະນະທີ່ລົງນາມແທນ ເພາະພວກມັນບໍ່ສາມາດສືບທອດຕໍ່ໄປໄດ້."

#: src/usr/local/www/system_certmanager.php:1159
msgid "When Signing a Certificate Request, existing attributes in the request cannot be copied. The attributes below will be applied to the resulting certificate."
msgstr "ເມື່ອລົງນາມໃນຄຳຮ້ອງຂໍໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ, ຄຸນລັກສະນະທີ່ມີຢູ່ໃນຄຳຮ້ອງຂໍບໍ່ສາມາດຄັດລອກໄດ້. ຄຸນລັກສະນະຂ້າງລຸ່ມນີ້ຈະຖືກນຳໃຊ້ກັບໃບຢັ້ງຢືນທີ່ໄດ້ຮັບ."

#: src/usr/local/www/system_certmanager.php:1165
msgid "*Certificate Type"
msgstr "*ປະເພດໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ"

#: src/usr/local/www/system_certmanager.php:1168
msgid "Add type-specific usage attributes to the signed certificate. Used for placing usage restrictions on, or granting abilities to, the signed certificate."
