#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_misc.php:218
msgid "Cryptographic & Thermal Hardware"
msgstr "ຮາດແວການເຂົ້າລະຫັດ ແລະ ເຊັນເຊີຄວາມຮ້ອນ"

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_misc.php:222
msgid "Cryptographic Hardware"
msgstr "ຮາດແວການເຂົ້າລະຫັດ"

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_misc.php:225
msgid "A cryptographic accelerator module will use hardware support to speed up some cryptographic functions on systems which have the chip. Loading the BSD Crypto Device module will allow access to acceleration devices using drivers built into the kernel, such as Hifn or ubsec chipsets. If the firewall does not contain a crypto chip, this option will have no effect. To unload the selected module, set this option to \"none\" and then reboot."
msgstr "ໂມດູນເລັ່ງຄວາມໄວການເຂົ້າລະຫັດຈະໃຊ້ຮາດແວເພື່ອຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ຟັງຊັນການເຂົ້າລະຫັດບາງຢ່າງເຮັດວຽກໄດ້ໄວຂຶ້ນໃນລະບົບທີ່ມີຊິບຮອງຮັບ. ການໂຫຼດໂມດູນ BSD Crypto Device ຈະຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ເຂົ້າເຖິງອຸປະກອນເລັ່ງຄວາມໄວໂດຍໃຊ້ໄດຣເວີທີ່ມານຳ kernel ເຊັ່ນ Hifn ຫຼື ubsec. ຫາກໄຟວໍບໍ່ມີຊິບເຂົ້າລະຫັດ, ຕົວເລືອກນີ້ຈະບໍ່ມີຜົນຫຍັງ. ເພື່ອປິດການໃຊ້ງານ, ໃຫ້ເລືອກເປັນ \"none\" ແລ້ວຣີບູດເຄື່ອງ."

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_misc.php:234 src/usr/local/www/widgets/include/thermal_sensors.inc:26 src/usr/local/www/widgets/widgets/thermal_sensors.widget.php:324
msgid "Thermal Sensors"
msgstr "ເຊັນເຊີຄວາມຮ້ອນ"

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_misc.php:237
msgid "With a supported CPU, selecting a thermal sensor will load the appropriate driver to read its temperature. Setting this to \"None\" will attempt to read the temperature from an ACPI-compliant motherboard sensor instead, if one is present. If there is not a supported thermal sensor chip in the system, this option will have no effect. To unload the selected module, set this option to \"none\" and then reboot."
msgstr "ຫາກ CPU ຮອງຮັບ, ການເລືອກເຊັນເຊີຄວາມຮ້ອນຈະໂຫຼດໄດຣເວີທີ່ເໝາະສົມເພື່ອອ່ານອຸນຫະພູມ. ຫາກຕັ້ງເປັນ \"None\", ມັນຈະພະຍາຍາມອ່ານອຸນຫະພູມຈາກເຊັນເຊີທີ່ຮອງຮັບ ACPI ເທິງເມນບອດແທນ (ຖ້າມີ). ຫາກລະບົບບໍ່ມີຊິບເຊັນເຊີຄວາມຮ້ອນທີ່ຮອງຮັບ, ຕົວເລືອກນີ້ຈະບໍ່ມີຜົນ. ເພື່ອປິດການໃຊ້ງານ, ໃຫ້ເລືອກເປັນ \"none\" ແລ້ວຣີບູດເຄື່ອງ."

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_misc.php:249
msgid "Kernel Page Table Isolation"
msgstr "Kernel Page Table Isolation"

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_misc.php:252 src/usr/local/www/widgets/widgets/system_information.widget.php:43 src/usr/local/www/widgets/widgets/system_information.widget.php:291
msgid "Kernel PTI"
msgstr "Kernel PTI"

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_misc.php:255
#, php-format
msgid "Meltdown workaround. If disabled the kernel memory can be accessed by unprivileged users on affected CPUs. This option forces the workaround off, and requires a reboot to activate. %1$s%1$sPTI is active by default only on affected CPUs, if PTI is disabled by default then this option will have no effect. %1$sCurrent PTI status: %2$s"
msgstr "ການແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາ Meltdown. ຫາກປິດໃຊ້ງານ, ຜູ້ໃຊ້ທີ່ບໍ່ມີສິດອາດຈະເຂົ້າເຖິງໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳຂອງ kernel ໄດ້ໃນ CPU ທີ່ໄດ້ຮັບຜົນກະທົບ. ຕົວເລືອກນີ້ແມ່ນການບັງຄັບປິດການແກ້ໄຂ ແລະ ຕ້ອງຣີບູດເພື່ອໃຫ້ມີຜົນ. %1$s%1$sໂດຍປົກກະຕິ PTI ຈະເຮັດວຽກສະເພາະ CPU ທີ່ໄດ້ຮັບຜົນກະທົບເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ຫາກ PTI ຖືກປິດໂດຍເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຢູ່ແລ້ວ, ຕົວເລືອກນີ້ຈະບໍ່ມີຜົນ. %1$sສະຖານະ PTI ປັດຈຸບັນ: %2$s"

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_misc.php:264
msgid "Microarchitectural Data Sampling Mitigation"
msgstr "Microarchitectural Data Sampling Mitigation"

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_misc.php:267
msgid "MDS Mode"
msgstr "ໂຫມດ MDS"

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_misc.php:270
#, php-format
msgid "Microarchitectural Data Sampling mitigation. If disabled the kernel memory can be accessed by unprivileged users on affected CPUs. This option controls which method of MDS mitigation is used, if any. %1$s%1$sCurrent MDS status: %2$s"
msgstr "ການບັນເທົາຜົນກະທົບ Microarchitectural Data Sampling. ຫາກປິດໃຊ້ງານ, ຜູ້ໃຊ້ທີ່ບໍ່ມີສິດອາດຈະເຂົ້າເຖິງໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳຂອງ kernel ໄດ້ໃນ CPU ທີ່ໄດ້ຮັບຜົນກະທົບ. ຕົວເລືອກນີ້ໃຊ້ເພື່ອຄວບຄຸມວິທີການບັນເທົາ MDS. %1$s%1$sສະຖານະ MDS ປັດຈຸບັນ: %2$s"

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_misc.php:276 src/usr/local/www/firewall_schedule_edit.php:54 src/usr/local/www/head.inc:309 src/usr/local/www/firewall_schedule.php:44 src/usr/local/www/firewall_schedule.php:86
msgid "Schedules"
msgstr "ຕາຕະລາງເວລາ"

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_misc.php:280
msgid "Schedule States"
msgstr "ສະຖານະຕາຕະລາງເວລາ"

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_misc.php:283
msgid "By default, when a schedule expires, connections permitted by that schedule are killed. This option overrides that behavior by not clearing states for existing connections."
msgstr "ໂດຍເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ເມື່ອຕາຕະລາງເວລາໝົດອາຍຸ, ການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ທີ່ໄດ້ຮັບອະນຸຍາດໂດຍຕາຕະລາງນັ້ນຈະຖືກຕັດ. ຕົວເລືອກນີ້ຈະປ່ຽນພຶດຕິກຳນັ້ນໂດຍການບໍ່ລຶບສະຖານະສຳລັບການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ທີ່ມີຢູ່ແລ້ວ."

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_misc.php:288 src/usr/local/www/system_gateways_edit.php:197
msgid "Gateway Monitoring"
msgstr "ການຕິດຕາມເກດເວ"

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_misc.php:292
msgid "State Killing on Gateway Failure"
msgstr "ຕັດສະຖານະເມື່ອເກດເວມີບັນຫາ"

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_misc.php:295
msgid "The monitoring process will flush all states when a gateway goes down if this box is checked."
msgstr "ຫາກເລືອກຕົວເລືອກນີ້, ຂະບວນການຕິດຕາມຈະລ້າງສະຖານະທັງໝົດອອກເມື່ອເກດເວໃຊ້ງານບໍ່ໄດ້."

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_misc.php:300
msgid "Skip rules when gateway is down"
msgstr "ຂ້າມກົດລະບຽບເມື່ອເກດເວໃຊ້ງານບໍ່ໄດ້"

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_misc.php:303
msgid "By default, when a rule has a gateway specified and this gateway is down, the rule is created omitting the gateway. This option overrides that behavior by omitting the entire rule instead."
msgstr "ໂດຍເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ເມື່ອກົດລະບຽບໃດໜຶ່ງມີການລະບຸເກດເວ ແລະ ເກດເວນັ້ນໃຊ້ງານບໍ່ໄດ້, ກົດລະບຽບຈະຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນໂດຍລະເວັ້ນການໃຊ້ເກດເວນັ້ນ. ຕົວເລືອກນີ້ຈະປ່ຽນພຶດຕິກຳນັ້ນໂດຍການລະເວັ້ນກົດລະບຽບນັ້ນໄປທັງໝົດເລີຍ."

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_misc.php:308
msgid "RAM Disk Settings (Reboot to Apply Changes)"
msgstr "ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ RAM Disk (ຣີບູດເພື່ອໃຫ້ມີຜົນ)"

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_misc.php:312
msgid "Use RAM Disks"
msgstr "ໃຊ້ RAM Disks"

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_misc.php:315
msgid "Set this to use /tmp and /var as RAM disks (memory file system disks) on a full install rather than use the hard disk. Setting this will cause the data in /tmp and /var to be lost. RRD, DHCP leases and log directory will be retained. Changing this setting will cause the firewall to reboot after clicking \"Save\"."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້ເພື່ອໃຊ້ /tmp ແລະ /var ເປັນ RAM disks ແທນການໃຊ້ຮາດດິດ. ການຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ຂໍ້ມູນໃນ /tmp ແລະ /var ສູນຫາຍ (ຍົກເວັ້ນ RRD, DHCP leases ແລະ ໄດເຣັກທໍຣີລັອກທີ່ຈະຖືກເກັບໄວ້). ການປ່ຽນແປງນີ້ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ໄຟວໍຣີບູດຫຼັງຈາກຄລິກ \"ບັນທຶກ\"."

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_misc.php:320
msgid "RAM Disk Size"
msgstr "ຂະໜາດ RAM Disk"

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_misc.php:324
msgid "/tmp RAM Disk Size"
msgstr "ຂະໜາດ /tmp RAM Disk"

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_misc.php:328
msgid "/tmp RAM Disk<br />Do not set lower than 40."
msgstr "/tmp RAM Disk<br />ຢ່າຕັ້ງຄ່າຕ່ຳກວ່າ 40."

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_misc.php:332
msgid "/var RAM Disk Size"
msgstr "ຂະໜາດ /var RAM Disk"

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_misc.php:336
msgid "/var RAM Disk<br />Do not set lower than 60."
msgstr "/var RAM Disk<br />ຢ່າຕັ້ງຄ່າຕ່ຳກວ່າ 60."

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_misc.php:338
#, php-format
msgid "Sets the size, in MiB, for the RAM disks. Ensure each RAM disk is large enough to contain the current contents of the directories in question. %sMaximum total size of all RAM disks cannot exceed available kernel memory: %s"
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າຂະໜາດ (MiB) ສຳລັບ RAM disks. ກວດສອບໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າ RAM disk ແຕ່ລະອັນມີຂະໜາດໃຫຍ່ພໍທີ່ຈະເກັບຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ມີຢູ່ໃນໄດເຣັກທໍຣີນັ້ນໆ. %sຂະໜາດລວມທັງໝົດຂອງ RAM disks ຕ້ອງບໍ່ເກີນໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳ kernel ທີ່ມີຢູ່: %s"

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_misc.php:345
