msgstr "ເປີດໃຊ້ຕົວເລືອກນີ້ເພື່ອບໍ່ສົ່ງ Netgate Device ID ໄປກັບ User-Agent header."

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_misc.php:407
msgid "The \\\"Use Ramdisk\\\" setting has been changed. This requires the firewall\\nto reboot.\\n\\nReboot now ?"
msgstr "ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ \\\"Use Ramdisk\\\" ຖືກປ່ຽນແປງ. ຕ້ອງຣີບູດໄຟວໍເພື່ອໃຫ້ມີຜົນ.\\n\\nຣີບູດດຽວນີ້ເລີຍບໍ່?"

#: src/usr/local/www/system_hasync.php:72
msgid "Password and confirmation must match."
msgstr "ລະຫັດຜ່ານ ແລະ ການຢືນຢັນຕ້ອງກົງກັນ."

#: src/usr/local/www/system_hasync.php:76
msgid "pfsync Synchronize Peer IP must be an IPv4 IP."
msgstr "pfsync Synchronize Peer IP ຕ້ອງເປັນທີ່ຢູ່ IPv4."

#: src/usr/local/www/system_hasync.php:80
