#: src/usr/local/www/system_hasync.php:120
msgid "State Synchronization Settings (pfsync)"
msgstr "ການຕັ້ງຄ່າການຊິງໂຄໄນຣຊ໌ສະຖານະ (pfsync)"

#: src/usr/local/www/system_hasync.php:124
msgid "Synchronize states"
msgstr "ຊິງໂຄໄນຣຊ໌ສະຖານະ"

#: src/usr/local/www/system_hasync.php:128
#, php-format
msgid "Each firewall sends these messages out via multicast on a specified interface, using the PFSYNC protocol (IP Protocol 240). It also listens on that interface for similar messages from other firewalls, and imports them into the local state table.%1$sThis setting should be enabled on all members of a failover group.%1$sClicking \"Save\" will force a configuration sync if it is enabled! (see Configuration Synchronization Settings below)"
msgstr "ໄຟວໍແຕ່ລະເຄື່ອງຈະສົ່ງຂໍ້ຄວາມເຫຼົ່ານີ້ອອກໄປແບບ multicast ຜ່ານອິນເຕີເຟດທີ່ລະບຸ ໂດຍໃຊ້ໂປຣໂຕຄໍ PFSYNC (IP Protocol 240). ມັນຍັງຈະລໍຖ້າຮັບຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ຄ້າຍຄືກັນຈາກໄຟວໍເຄື່ອງອື່ນ ແລະ ນຳຂໍ້ມູນມາໃສ່ໃນຕາຕະລາງສະຖານະທ້ອງຖິ່ນ. %1$sການຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້ຄວນຖືກເປີດໃຊ້ງານໃນທຸກເຄື່ອງທີ່ຢູ່ໃນກຸ່ມ failover. %1$sການຄລິກ \"ບັນທຶກ\" ຈະເປັນການບັງຄັບໃຫ້ຊິງໂຄໄນຣຊ໌ການຕັ້ງຄ່າທັນທີຫາກເປີດໃຊ້ງານໄວ້!"

#: src/usr/local/www/system_hasync.php:135
msgid "Synchronize Interface"
msgstr "ອິນເຕີເຟດສຳລັບຊິງໂຄໄນຣຊ໌"

#: src/usr/local/www/system_hasync.php:138
#, php-format
msgid "If Synchronize States is enabled this interface will be used for communication.%1$sIt is recommended to set this to an interface other than LAN! A dedicated interface works the best.%1$sAn IP must be defined on each machine participating in this failover group.%1$sAn IP must be assigned to the interface on any participating sync nodes."
msgstr "ຫາກເປີດໃຊ້ການຊິງໂຄໄນຣຊ໌ສະຖານະ, ອິນເຕີເຟດນີ້ຈະຖືກໃຊ້ສຳລັບການສື່ສານ. %1$sແນະນຳໃຫ້ຕັ້ງເປັນອິນເຕີເຟດອື່ນທີ່ບໍ່ແມ່ນ LAN! ການໃຊ້ອິນເຕີເຟດສະເພາະ (dedicated) ຈະດີທີ່ສຸດ. %1$sຕ້ອງກຳນົດ IP ໃຫ້ກັບແຕ່ລະເຄື່ອງທີ່ຢູ່ໃນກຸ່ມ failover ນີ້."

#: src/usr/local/www/system_hasync.php:145
msgid "pfsync Synchronize Peer IP"
msgstr "pfsync Synchronize Peer IP"

#: src/usr/local/www/system_hasync.php:149
msgid "Setting this option will force pfsync to synchronize its state table to this IP address. The default is directed multicast."
msgstr "ການຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້ຈະບັງຄັບໃຫ້ pfsync ຊິງໂຄໄນຣຊ໌ຕາຕະລາງສະຖານະໄປຍັງ IP ນີ້. ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນ directed multicast."

#: src/usr/local/www/system_hasync.php:153
msgid "Configuration Synchronization Settings (XMLRPC Sync)"
msgstr "ການຕັ້ງຄ່າການຊິງໂຄໄນຣຊ໌ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ (XMLRPC Sync)"

#: src/usr/local/www/system_hasync.php:157
msgid "Synchronize Config to IP"
msgstr "ຊິງໂຄໄນຣຊ໌ການຕັ້ງຄ່າໄປຍັງ IP"

#: src/usr/local/www/system_hasync.php:161
#, php-format
msgid "Enter the IP address of the firewall to which the selected configuration sections should be synchronized.%1$s%1$sXMLRPC sync is currently only supported over connections using the same protocol and port as this system - make sure the remote system's port and protocol are set accordingly!%1$sDo not use the Synchronize Config to IP and password option on backup cluster members!"
msgstr "ປ້ອນທີ່ຢູ່ IP ຂອງໄຟວໍທີ່ຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ຊິງໂຄໄນຣຊ໌ການຕັ້ງຄ່າໄປຫາ. %1$s%1$sປະຈຸບັນ XMLRPC ຮອງຮັບສະເພາະການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ທີ່ໃຊ້ໂປຣໂຕຄໍ ແລະ ພອດດຽວກັນກັບລະບົບນີ້ເທົ່ານັ້ນ. %1$sຫ້າມໃຊ້ຕົວເລືອກນີ້ໃນເຄື່ອງທີ່ເປັນ backup cluster!"

#: src/usr/local/www/system_hasync.php:167
msgid "Remote System Username"
msgstr "ຊື່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ຂອງລະບົບປາຍທາງ"

#: src/usr/local/www/system_hasync.php:171
#, php-format
msgid "Enter the webConfigurator username of the system entered above for synchronizing the configuration.%1$sDo not use the Synchronize Config to IP and username option on backup cluster members!"
msgstr "ປ້ອນຊື່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ webConfigurator ຂອງລະບົບປາຍທາງ. %1$sຫ້າມໃຊ້ຕົວເລືອກນີ້ໃນເຄື່ອງທີ່ເປັນ backup cluster!"

#: src/usr/local/www/system_hasync.php:176
msgid "Remote System Password"
msgstr "ລະຫັດຜ່ານຂອງລະບົບປາຍທາງ"

#: src/usr/local/www/system_hasync.php:179
#, php-format
msgid "Enter the webConfigurator password of the system entered above for synchronizing the configuration.%1$sDo not use the Synchronize Config to IP and password option on backup cluster members!"
msgstr "ປ້ອນລະຫັດຜ່ານ webConfigurator ຂອງລະບົບປາຍທາງ. %1$sຫ້າມໃຊ້ຕົວເລືອກນີ້ໃນເຄື່ອງທີ່ເປັນ backup cluster!"

#: src/usr/local/www/system_hasync.php:184
msgid "Synchronize admin"
msgstr "ຊິງໂຄໄນຣຊ໌ບັນຊີ admin"

#: src/usr/local/www/system_hasync.php:188
#, php-format
msgid ""
"By default, the admin account does not synchronize, and each node may have a different admin password.%1$sThis option automatically updates XMLRPC Remote System Password when the password is changed on \n"
"\t\t\tthe Remote System Username account."
msgstr "ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ບັນຊີ admin ຈະບໍ່ມີການຊິງຄ໌ຂໍ້ມູນ, ແລະ ແຕ່ລະໂນດອາດມີລະຫັດຜ່ານ admin ທີ່ແຕກຕ່າງກັນ.%1$sຕົວເລືອກນີ້ຈະອັບເດດລະຫັດຜ່ານລະບົບທາງໄກ XMLRPC ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ ເມື່ອມີການປ່ຽນແປງລະຫັດຜ່ານໃນບັນຊີຊື່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ລະບົບທາງໄກ (Remote System Username)."

#: src/usr/local/www/system_hasync.php:192
