#: src/usr/local/www/diag_packet_capture.php:349
msgid "Promiscuous"
msgstr "Promiscuous mode"

#: src/usr/local/www/diag_packet_capture.php:352
#, php-format
msgid ""
"%1$sNon-promiscuous mode captures only traffic that is directly relevant to the host (sent by it, sent or broadcast to it, or routed through it) and does not show packets that are ignored at network adapter level.%2$s%3$sPromiscuous mode%4$s (\"sniffing\") captures all data seen by the adapter, whether or not it is valid or related to the host, but in some cases may have undesirable side effects and not all adapters support this option. Click Info for details %5$sPromiscuous mode requires more kernel processing of packets. This puts a slightly higher demand on system "
"resources, especially on very busy networks or low power processors. The change in packet processing may allow a hostile host to detect that an adapter is in promiscuous mode or to 'fingerprint' the kernel (see %6$s). Some network adapters may not support or work well in promiscuous mode (see %7$s).%8$s"
msgstr ""
"%1$sໂໝດບໍ່ປະປົນ (Non-promiscuous mode) ຈະຈັບເອົາສະເພາະຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງໂດຍກົງກັບໂຮສ໌ (ຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ສົ່ງອອກ, ສົ່ງມາຫາ ຫຼື ກະຈາຍສັນຍານຫາ, ຫຼື ຖືກສົ່ງຜ່ານໂຮສ໌) ແລະ ຈະບໍ່ສະແດງແພັກເກັດຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ຖືກລະເລີຍໃນລະດັບອະແດັບເຕີເຄືອຂ່າຍ.%2$s%3$sໂໝດປະປົນ (Promiscuous mode)%4$s (\"ການດັກຟັງ\" ຫຼື \"sniffing\") ຈະຈັບເອົາຂໍ້ມູນທັງໝົດທີ່ຜ່ານອະແດັບເຕີ, ບໍ່ວ່າຂໍ້ມູນນັ້ນຈະຖືກຕ້ອງ ຫຼື ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບໂຮສ໌ຫຼືບໍ່, ແຕ່ໃນບາງກໍລະນີອາດສົ່ງຜົນຂ້າງຄຽງທີ່ບໍ່ເພິ່ງປະສົງ ແລະ ບໍ່ແມ່ນອະແດັບເຕີທຸກລຸ້ນທີ່ຈະຮອງຮັບຕົວເລືອກນີ້. ຄລິກ Info ເພື່ອເບິ່ງລາຍລະອຽດ %5$sໂໝດປະປົນຕ້ອງການການປະມວນຜົນຂອງເຄີເນິນ (Kernel) ຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນ. ສິ່ງນີ້ເຮັດໃຫ້ມີການໃຊ້ຊັບພະຍາກອນລະບົບສູງຂຶ້ນເລັກນ້ອຍ, ໂດຍສະເພາະໃນເຄືອຂ່າຍທີ່ມີການໃຊ້ງານໜາແໜ້ນ ຫຼື ໂປຣເຊດເຊີທີ່ມີກຳລັງຕ່ຳ. "
"ການປ່ຽນແປງໃນການປະມວນຜົນແພັກເກັດອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ໂຮສ໌ທີ່ບໍ່ຫວັງດີສາມາດກວດພົບໄດ້ວ່າອະແດັບເຕີກຳລັງຢູ່ໃນໂໝດປະປົນ ຫຼື ສາມາດລະບຸເອກະລັກ (fingerprint) ຂອງເຄີເນິນໄດ້ (ເບິ່ງ %6$s). ອະແດັບເຕີເຄືອຂ່າຍບາງລຸ້ນອາດຈະບໍ່ຮອງຮັບ ຫຼື ເຮັດວຽກໄດ້ບໍ່ດີໃນໂໝດປະປົນ (ເບິ່ງ %7$s).%8$s"

#: src/usr/local/www/diag_packet_capture.php:375
msgid "IPv4 Only"
msgstr "IPv4 ເທົ່ານັ້ນ"

#: src/usr/local/www/diag_packet_capture.php:376
msgid "IPv6 Only"
msgstr "IPv6 ເທົ່ານັ້ນ"

#: src/usr/local/www/diag_packet_capture.php:378
msgid "Select the type of traffic to be captured."
msgstr "ເລືອກປະເພດຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ຕ້ອງການດັກຈັບ."

#: src/usr/local/www/diag_packet_capture.php:385
msgid "Select the protocol to capture, or \"Any\". "
msgstr "ເລືອກໂປຣໂຕຄໍທີ່ຕ້ອງການດັກຈັບ ຫຼື ເລືອກ \"ທັງໝົດ\". "

#: src/usr/local/www/diag_packet_capture.php:389
msgid "Host Address"
msgstr "ທີ່ຢູ່ໂຮສ"

#: src/usr/local/www/diag_packet_capture.php:392
#, php-format
msgid ""
"This value is either the Source or Destination IP address, subnet in CIDR notation, or MAC address.%1$sMatching can be negated by preceding the value with \"!\". Multiple IP addresses or CIDR subnets may be specified. Comma (\",\") separated values perform a boolean \"AND\". Separating with a pipe (\"|\") performs a boolean \"OR\".%1$sMAC addresses must be entered in colon-separated format, such as xx:xx:xx:xx:xx:xx or a partial address consisting of one (xx), two (xx:xx), or four (xx:xx:xx:xx) segments.%1$sIf this field is left blank, all packets on the specified "
"interface will be captured."
msgstr "ຄ່ານີ້ສາມາດເປັນ IP ຕົ້ນທາງ ຫຼື ປາຍທາງ, subnet (CIDR) ຫຼື ທີ່ຢູ່ MAC. %1$sສາມາດໃຊ້ \"!\" ທາງໜ້າເພື່ອໝາຍເຖິງ \"ຍົກເວັ້ນ\". ໃຊ້ຈຸດ \",\" ແທນ \"ແລະ\" (AND) ແລະ ໃຊ້ຂີດ \"|\" ແທນ \"ຫຼື\" (OR). ຫາກປະຫວ່າງໄວ້ ຈະດັກຈັບແພັກເກັດທັງໝົດ."

#: src/usr/local/www/diag_packet_capture.php:401 src/usr/local/www/status_upnp.php:74 src/usr/local/www/firewall_nat_edit.php:393 src/usr/local/www/diag_testport.php:54 src/usr/local/www/firewall_aliases_edit.php:183 src/usr/local/www/interfaces.php:3473 src/usr/local/www/interfaces.php:3497 src/usr/local/www/firewall_rules.php:404 src/usr/local/www/firewall_rules.php:406
msgid "Port"
msgstr "ພອດ"

#: src/usr/local/www/diag_packet_capture.php:404
msgid "The port can be either the source or destination port. The packet capture will look for this port in either field. Matching can be negated by preceding the value with \"!\". Multiple ports may be specified. Comma (\",\") separated values perform a boolean \"AND\". Separating with a pipe (\"|\") performs a boolean \"OR\".Leave blank if not filtering by port."
msgstr "ສາມາດເປັນພອດຕົ້ນທາງ ຫຼື ປາຍທາງ. ໃຊ້ \"!\" ເພື່ອຍົກເວັ້ນ. ໃຊ້ \",\" ສຳລັບ \"ແລະ\" ແລະ \"|\" ສຳລັບ \"ຫຼື\". ຫາກບໍ່ຕ້ອງການກອງດ້ວຍພອດ ໃຫ້ປະຫວ່າງໄວ້."

#: src/usr/local/www/diag_packet_capture.php:410
msgid "Packet Length"
msgstr "ຄວາມຍາວແພັກເກັດ"

#: src/usr/local/www/diag_packet_capture.php:413
msgid "The Packet length is the number of bytes of each packet that will be captured. Default value is 0, which will capture the entire frame regardless of its size."
msgstr "ຄວາມຍາວຂອງແພັກເກັດ (ໄບຕ໌) ທີ່ຈະດັກຈັບ. ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນ 0 ໝາຍເຖິງການດັກຈັບທັງໝົດໂດຍບໍ່ສົນໃຈຂະໜາດ."

#: src/usr/local/www/diag_packet_capture.php:418 src/usr/local/www/services_captiveportal_vouchers_edit.php:75 src/usr/local/www/diag_ping.php:55
msgid "Count"
msgstr "ຈຳນວນ"

#: src/usr/local/www/diag_packet_capture.php:421
#, php-format
msgid "This is the number of packets the packet capture will grab. Default value is 100.%sEnter 0 (zero) for no count limit."
msgstr "ຈຳນວນແພັກເກັດທີ່ຈະດັກຈັບ. ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນ 100. %sໃສ່ 0 ຫາກບໍ່ຕ້ອງການຈຳກັດຈຳນວນ."

#: src/usr/local/www/diag_packet_capture.php:430
msgid "Medium"
msgstr "ປານກາງ"

#: src/usr/local/www/diag_packet_capture.php:432
msgid "Full"
msgstr "ລະອຽດທັງໝົດ"

#: src/usr/local/www/diag_packet_capture.php:427
msgid "Level of detail"
msgstr "ລະດັບຄວາມລະອຽດ"

#: src/usr/local/www/diag_packet_capture.php:435
#, php-format
msgid "This is the level of detail that will be displayed after hitting \"Stop\" when the packets have been captured.%sThis option does not affect the level of detail when downloading the packet capture. "
msgstr "ນີ້ແມ່ນລະດັບຄວາມລະອຽດທີ່ຈະສະແດງຜົນ ຫຼັງຈາກກົດ \"Stop\" ເມື່ອມີການຈັບແພັກເກັດແລ້ວ.%sຕົວເລືອກນີ້ຈະບໍ່ມີຜົນຕໍ່ລະດັບຄວາມລະອຽດ ໃນເວລາທີ່ດາວໂຫລດໄຟລ໌ການຈັບແພັກເກັດ. "

#: src/usr/local/www/diag_packet_capture.php:441
msgid "Reverse DNS Lookup"
msgstr "ການຄົ້ນຫາ DNS ແບບຢ້ອນກັບ"

#: src/usr/local/www/diag_packet_capture.php:444
#, php-format
msgid "The packet capture will perform a reverse DNS lookup associated with all IP addresses.%sThis option can cause delays for large packet captures."
msgstr "ຈະເຮັດການຄົ້ນຫາຊື່ DNS ຈາກທີ່ຢູ່ IP ທັງໝົດ. %sຕົວເລືອກນີ້ອາດຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ຊ້າຫາກມີຂໍ້ມູນຈຳນວນຫຼາຍ."

#: src/usr/local/www/diag_packet_capture.php:474 src/usr/local/www/diag_packet_capture.php:497
