msgstr "ບໍ່ມີໄຟລ໌ຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ຈະສະແດງ."

#: src/usr/local/www/diag_packet_capture.php:597
msgid "Select a detail level to view the contents of the packet capture."
msgstr "ເລືອກລະດັບຄວາມລະອຽດເພື່ອເບິ່ງເນື້ອໃນຂອງຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ດັກຈັບໄດ້."

#: src/usr/local/www/diag_gmirror.php:35 src/usr/local/www/head.inc:401
