#: src/usr/local/www/services_ntpd.php:307
msgid "Time Servers"
msgstr "ເຊີເວີເວລາ"

#: src/usr/local/www/services_ntpd.php:310
#, php-format
msgid "%d is the maximum number of configured servers."
msgstr "ສາມາດຕັ້ງຄ່າເຊີເວີໄດ້ສູງສຸດ %d ເຄື່ອງ."

#: src/usr/local/www/services_ntpd.php:363
#, php-format
msgid ""
"NTP will only sync if a majority of the servers agree on the time.  For best results you should configure between 3 and 5 servers (%4$sNTP support pages recommend at least 4 or 5%5$s), or a pool. If only one server is configured, it %2$swill%3$s be believed, and if 2 servers are configured and they disagree, %2$sneither%3$s will be believed. Options:%1$s%2$sPrefer%3$s - NTP should favor the use of this server more than all others.%1$s%2$sNo Select%3$s - NTP should not use this server for time, but stats for this server will be collected and displayed.%1$s%2$sIs a "
"Pool%3$s - this entry is a pool of NTP servers and not a single address. This is assumed for *.pool.ntp.org."
msgstr "NTP ຈະຊິງຄ໌ຂໍ້ມູນໄດ້ກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອເຊີເວີສ່ວນໃຫຍ່ມີເວລາທີ່ກົງກັນ. ເພື່ອຜົນລັບທີ່ດີທີ່ສຸດ ທ່ານຄວນກຳນົດຄ່າລະຫວ່າງ 3 ຫາ 5 ເຊີເວີ (%4$sໜ້າສະໜັບສະໜູນຂອງ NTP ແນະນຳຢ່າງໜ້ອຍ 4 ຫຼື 5%5$s), ຫຼື ແບບພູລ (pool). ຫາກມີການກຳນົດຄ່າພຽງເຊີເວີດຽວ, ມັນ %2$sຈະ%3$s ຖືກເຊື່ອຖື, ແລະ ຫາກມີການກຳນົດຄ່າ 2 ເຊີເວີແລ້ວພວກມັນມີເວລາບໍ່ກົງກັນ, %2$sທັງສອງ%3$s ຈະບໍ່ຖືກເຊື່ອຖື. ຕົວເລືອກ:%1$s%2$sບຸລິມະສິດ (Prefer)%3$s - NTP ຄວນໃຫ້ຄວາມສຳຄັນໃນການໃຊ້ງານເຊີເວີນີ້ຫຼາຍກວ່າເຄື່ອງອື່ນໆທັງໝົດ.%1$s%2$sບໍ່ເລືອກ (No Select)%3$s - NTP ບໍ່ຄວນໃຊ້ເຊີເວີນີ້ສຳລັບເວລາ, ແຕ່ຂໍ້ມູນສະຖິຕິຂອງເຊີເວີນີ້ຈະຖືກເກັບກຳ ແລະ ສະແດງຜົນ.%1$s%2$sແມ່ນພູລ (Is a Pool)%3$s - ລາຍການນີ້ແມ່ນກຸ່ມ (pool) ຂອງເຊີເວີ NTP ແລະ ບໍ່ແມ່ນທີ່ຢູ່ດຽວ. ສິ່ງນີ້ຖືກສົມມຸດໄວ້ສຳລັບ *.pool.ntp.org."

#: src/usr/local/www/services_ntpd.php:378
msgid "Max candidate pool peers"
msgstr "ຈຳນວນສູງສຸດຂອງ candidate pool peers"

#: src/usr/local/www/services_ntpd.php:382
msgid "Maximum number of candidate peers in the NTP pool. This value should be set low enough to provide sufficient alternate sources while not contacting an excessively large number of peers. Many servers inside public pools are provided by volunteers, and a large candidate pool places unnecessary extra load on the volunteer time servers for little to no added benefit. (Default: 5)."
msgstr "ຈຳນວນສູງສຸດຂອງ candidate peers ໃນ NTP pool. ຄວນຕັ້ງຄ່າໃຫ້ຕ່ຳພໍເພື່ອບໍ່ໃຫ້ມີການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບ peers ຫຼາຍເກີນໄປ ເພື່ອຫຼຸດພາລະຂອງເຊີເວີອາສາສະໝັກ (ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ: 5)."

#: src/usr/local/www/services_ntpd.php:390
msgid "Orphan Mode"
msgstr "Orphan Mode"

#: src/usr/local/www/services_ntpd.php:394
msgid "Orphan mode allows the system clock to be used when no other clocks are available. The number here specifies the stratum reported during orphan mode and should normally be set to a number high enough to insure that any other servers available to clients are preferred over this server (default: 12)."
msgstr "Orphan mode ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ສາມາດໃຊ້ໂມງຂອງລະບົບໄດ້ເມື່ອບໍ່ມີໂມງອື່ນໃຫ້ໃຊ້. ຕົວເລກນີ້ຄືຄ່າ stratum ທີ່ຈະລາຍງານໃນໂຫມດນີ້ (ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ: 12)."

#: src/usr/local/www/services_ntpd.php:414
msgid "NTP Graphs"
msgstr "ກຣາຟ NTP"

#: src/usr/local/www/services_ntpd.php:421
msgid "Logging"
msgstr "ການບັນທຶກລັອກ"

#: src/usr/local/www/services_ntpd.php:431
#, php-format
msgid "These options enable additional messages from NTP to be written to the System Log %1$sStatus > System Logs > NTP%2$s"
msgstr "ຕົວເລືອກເຫຼົ່ານີ້ເປີດການໃຊ້ງານຂໍ້ຄວາມເພີ່ມເຕີມຈາກ NTP ເພື່ອບັນທຶກລົງໃນບັນທຶກລະບົບ (System Log) %1$sStatus > System Logs > NTP%2$s"

#: src/usr/local/www/services_ntpd.php:445
msgid "Statistics Logging"
msgstr "ບັນທຶກສະຖິຕິ"

#: src/usr/local/www/services_ntpd.php:447
msgid "Warning: These options will create persistent daily log files in /var/log/ntp."
msgstr "ຄຳເຕືອນ: ຕົວເລືອກເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຈະສ້າງໄຟລ໌ລັອກປະຈຳວັນໃນ /var/log/ntp."

#: src/usr/local/www/services_ntpd.php:481
msgid "Leap seconds"
msgstr "ວິນາທີອະທິກະມາດ (Leap seconds)"

#: src/usr/local/www/services_ntpd.php:484
msgid ""
"Leap seconds may be added or subtracted at the end of June or December. Leap seconds are administered by the %1$sIERS%2$s, who publish them in their Bulletin C approximately 6 - 12 months in advance.  Normally this correction should only be needed if the server is a stratum 1 NTP server, but many NTP servers do not advertise an upcoming leap second when other NTP servers synchronise to them.%3$s%4$sIf the leap second is important to your network services, it is %6$sgood practice%2$s to download and add the leap second file at least a day in advance of any time "
"correction%5$s.%3$s More information and files for downloading can be found on their %1$swebsite%2$s, and also on the %7$NIST%2$s and %8$sNTP%2$s websites."
msgstr "Leap seconds ອາດຈະຖືກເພີ່ມ ຫຼື ຫຼຸດ ໃນທ້າຍເດືອນມິຖຸນາ ຫຼື ທັນວາ. ຫາກ Leap second ມີຄວາມສຳຄັນຕໍ່ບໍລິການໃນເຄືອຂ່າຍຂອງທ່ານ, ແນະນຳໃຫ້ດາວໂຫຼດ ແລະ ເພີ່ມໄຟລ໌ Leap second ລ່ວງໜ້າຢ່າງໜ້ອຍໜຶ່ງມື້."

#: src/usr/local/www/services_ntpd.php:504
msgid "Enter Leap second configuration as text OR select a file to upload."
msgstr "ປ້ອນການຕັ້ງຄ່າ Leap second ເປັນຂໍ້ຄວາມ ຫຼື ເລືອກໄຟລ໌ເພື່ອອັບໂຫຼດ."

