#: src/usr/local/www/services_captiveportal_vouchers.php:365
msgid "Voucher Public Key"
msgstr "ກະແຈສາທາລະນະຂອງບັດ"

#: src/usr/local/www/services_captiveportal_vouchers.php:367
msgid "Paste an RSA public key (64 Bit or smaller) in PEM format here. This key is used to decrypt vouchers."
msgstr "ວາງກະແຈ RSA ສາທາລະນະ (64 ບິດ ຫຼື ນ້ອຍກວ່າ) ໃນຮູບແບບ PEM ທີ່ນີ້. ກະແຈນີ້ໃຊ້ເພື່ອຖອດລະຫັດບັດ."

#: src/usr/local/www/services_captiveportal_vouchers.php:371
msgid "Voucher Private Key"
msgstr "ກະແຈສ່ວນຕົວຂອງບັດ"

#: src/usr/local/www/services_captiveportal_vouchers.php:373
msgid "Paste an RSA private key (64 Bit or smaller) in PEM format here. This key is only used to generate encrypted vouchers and doesn't need to be available if the vouchers have been generated offline."
msgstr "ວາງກະແຈ RSA ສ່ວນຕົວ (64 ບິດ ຫຼື ນ້ອຍກວ່າ) ໃນຮູບແບບ PEM ທີ່ນີ້. ກະແຈນີ້ໃຊ້ສະເພາະເພື່ອສ້າງບັດທີ່ເຂົ້າລະຫັດ ແລະ ບໍ່ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງມີໄວ້ຫາກບັດຖືກສ້າງແບບອອບລາຍ."

#: src/usr/local/www/services_captiveportal_vouchers.php:377
msgid "Character set"
msgstr "ຊຸດຕົວອັກສອນ"

#: src/usr/local/www/services_captiveportal_vouchers.php:380
msgid "Tickets are generated with the specified character set. It should contain printable characters (numbers, lower case and upper case letters) that are hard to confuse with others. Avoid e.g. 0/O and l/1."
msgstr "ບັດຈະຖືກສ້າງດ້ວຍຊຸດຕົວອັກສອນທີ່ກຳນົດ. ມັນຄວນປະກອບດ້ວຍຕົວອັກສອນທີ່ພິມໄດ້ (ຕົວເລກ, ຕົວອັກສອນນ້ອຍ ແລະ ຕົວອັກສອນໃຫຍ່) ທີ່ບໍ່ເຮັດໃຫ້ສັບສົນກັບຕົວອື່ນ. ເຊັ່ນ: ຫຼີກລ່ຽງ 0/O ແລະ l/1."

#: src/usr/local/www/services_captiveportal_vouchers.php:384
msgid "# of Roll bits"
msgstr "ຈຳນວນ Roll bits"

#: src/usr/local/www/services_captiveportal_vouchers.php:387
msgid "Reserves a range in each voucher to store the Roll # it belongs to. Allowed range: 1..31. Sum of Roll+Ticket+Checksum bits must be one Bit less than the RSA key size."
msgstr "ຈອງຊ່ວງໃນແຕ່ລະບັດເພື່ອເກັບໝາຍເລກ Roll ທີ່ມັນສັງກັດຢູ່. ຊ່ວງທີ່ອະນຸຍາດ: 1..31. ຜົນລວມຂອງ Roll+Ticket+Checksum bits ຕ້ອງນ້ອຍກວ່າຂະໜາດກະແຈ RSA ຢູ່ 1 ບິດ."

#: src/usr/local/www/services_captiveportal_vouchers.php:391
msgid "# of Ticket bits"
msgstr "ຈຳນວນ Ticket bits"

#: src/usr/local/www/services_captiveportal_vouchers.php:394
msgid "Reserves a range in each voucher to store the Ticket# it belongs to. Allowed range: 1..16. Using 16 bits allows a roll to have up to 65535 vouchers. A bit array, stored in RAM and in the config, is used to mark if a voucher has been used. A bit array for 65535 vouchers requires 8 KB of storage. "
msgstr "ສຳຮອງຊ່ວງຂໍ້ມູນໃນແຕ່ລະບັດ (Voucher) ເພື່ອເກັບເລກທີ Ticket# ທີ່ມັນຂຶ້ນກັບ. ຊ່ວງທີ່ອະນຸຍາດ: 1..16. ການໃຊ້ 16 ບິດ ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ແຕ່ລະຊຸດ (roll) ສາມາດມີບັດໄດ້ສູງສຸດ 65535 ບັດ. ບິດອາເຣ (Bit array) ທີ່ເກັບໄວ້ໃນ RAM ແລະ ໃນການກຳນົດຄ່າ (config) ແມ່ນຖືກໃຊ້ເພື່ອໝາຍວ່າບັດນັ້ນຖືກໃຊ້ໄປແລ້ວຫຼືບໍ່. ບິດອາເຣສຳລັບ 65535 ບັດ ຕ້ອງການພື້ນທີ່ເກັບຂໍ້ມູນ 8 KB. "

#: src/usr/local/www/services_captiveportal_vouchers.php:400
msgid "# of Checksum bits"
msgstr "ຈຳນວນ Checksum bits"

#: src/usr/local/www/services_captiveportal_vouchers.php:403
msgid "Reserves a range in each voucher to store a simple checksum over Roll # and Ticket#. Allowed range is 0..31."
msgstr "ຈອງຊ່ວງໃນແຕ່ລະບັດເພື່ອເກັບຄ່າ checksum ງ່າຍໆ ຂອງ Roll # ແລະ Ticket#. ຊ່ວງທີ່ອະນຸຍາດແມ່ນ 0..31."

#: src/usr/local/www/services_captiveportal_vouchers.php:407
msgid "Magic number"
msgstr "ໝາຍເລກ Magic (Magic number)"

#: src/usr/local/www/services_captiveportal_vouchers.php:410
msgid "Magic number stored in every voucher. Verified during voucher check. Size depends on how many bits are left by Roll+Ticket+Checksum bits. If all bits are used, no magic number will be used and checked."
msgstr "ໝາຍເລກ Magic ທີ່ເກັບໄວ້ໃນທຸກບັດ. ຈະຖືກກວດສອບໃນລະຫວ່າງການກວດບັດ. ຂະໜາດຂຶ້ນຢູ່ກັບຈຳນວນບິດທີ່ເຫຼືອຈາກ Roll+Ticket+Checksum bits. ຫາກບິດທັງໝົດຖືກໃຊ້ແລ້ວ, ຈະບໍ່ມີການໃຊ້ ແລະ ກວດສອບໝາຍເລກ Magic."

