msgstr "%1$sLOCAL ADDRESS%2$s\t%3$sທີ່ຢູ່ປາຍທາງຝັ່ງທ້ອງຖິ່ນ (local) ທີ່ຊັອກເກັດຜູກໄວ້.%4$s"

#: src/usr/local/www/diag_sockets.php:123
#, php-format
