#, php-format
msgid "Note: This converts %1$s into a routing only platform!%2$sNote: This will also turn off NAT! To only disable NAT, and not firewall rules, visit the %3$sOutbound NAT%4$s page."
msgstr "ໝາຍເຫດ: ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະປ່ຽນ %1$s ໃຫ້ເປັນແພລັດຟອມສຳລັບການເລືອກເສັ້ນທາງ (routing) ເທົ່ານັ້ນ! %2$sໝາຍເຫດ: ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະປິດ NAT ນຳ! ຫາກຕ້ອງການປິດສະເພາະ NAT ແຕ່ບໍ່ປິດກົດໄຟວໍ, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ໜ້າ %3$sOutbound NAT%4$s."

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_firewall.php:134
msgid "Disable Firewall Scrub"
msgstr "ປິດໃຊ້ງານ Firewall Scrub"

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_firewall.php:139
msgid "Firewall Adaptive Timeouts"
msgstr "Firewall Adaptive Timeouts"

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_firewall.php:143
msgid "Adaptive start"
msgstr "Adaptive start"

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_firewall.php:147
#, no-php-format
msgid "When the number of state entries exceeds this value, adaptive scaling begins.  All timeout values are scaled linearly with factor (adaptive.end - number of states) / (adaptive.end - adaptive.start). Defaults to 60% of the Firewall Maximum States value"
msgstr "ເມື່ອຈຳນວນ state entries ເກີນຄ່ານີ້, ການປັບຂະໜາດແບບປັບຕົວ (adaptive scaling) ຈະເລີ່ມຂຶ້ນ. ຄ່າ timeout ທັງໝົດຈະຖືກປັບຕາມສັດສ່ວນ. ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນ 60% ຂອງ Firewall Maximum States."

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_firewall.php:154
msgid "Adaptive end"
msgstr "Adaptive end"

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_firewall.php:158
#, no-php-format
msgid "When reaching this number of state entries, all timeout values become zero, effectively purging all state entries immediately.  This value is used to define the scale factor, it should not actually be reached (set a lower state limit, see below). Defaults to 120% of the Firewall Maximum States value"
msgstr "ເມື່ອຮອດຈຳນວນ state entries ນີ້, ຄ່າ timeout ທັງໝົດຈະກາຍເປັນສູນ ເຊິ່ງຈະເປັນການລ້າງ state entries ທັງໝົດທັນທີ. ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນ 120% ຂອງ Firewall Maximum States."

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_firewall.php:164
msgid "Timeouts for states can be scaled adaptively as the number of state table entries grows. Leave blank to use default values, set to 0 to disable Adaptive Timeouts."
msgstr "Timeouts ສຳລັບ state ສາມາດປັບໄດ້ຕາມຈຳນວນ state table entries ທີ່ເພີ່ມຂຶ້ນ. ປະຫວ່າງໄວ້ເພື່ອໃຊ້ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ຫຼື ຕັ້ງເປັນ 0 ເພື່ອປິດການໃຊ້ງານ."

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_firewall.php:172
msgid "Firewall Maximum States"
msgstr "ຈຳນວນ State ສູງສຸດຂອງໄຟວໍ"

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_firewall.php:176
#, php-format
msgid "Maximum number of connections to hold in the firewall state table. %1$sNote: Leave this blank for the default. On this system the default size is: %2$d"
msgstr "ຈຳນວນການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ສູງສຸດທີ່ຈະເກັບໄວ້ໃນ firewall state table. %1$sໝາຍເຫດ: ປະຫວ່າງໄວ້ເພື່ອໃຊ້ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ. ສຳລັບລະບົບນີ້ ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນ: %2$d"

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_firewall.php:182
msgid "Firewall Maximum Table Entries"
msgstr "ຈຳນວນລາຍການໃນຕາຕະລາງສູງສຸດຂອງໄຟວໍ"

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_firewall.php:186
#, php-format
msgid "Maximum number of table entries for systems such as aliases, sshguard, snort, etc, combined.%1$sNote: Leave this blank for the default. On this system the default size is: %2$d"
msgstr "ຈຳນວນລາຍການສູງສຸດໃນຕາຕະລາງສຳລັບລະບົບຕ່າງໆ ເຊັ່ນ aliases, sshguard, snort ແລະ ອື່ນໆ ລວມກັນ. %1$sໝາຍເຫດ: ປະຫວ່າງໄວ້ເພື່ອໃຊ້ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ. ສຳລັບລະບົບນີ້ ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນ: %2$d"

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_firewall.php:194
msgid "Firewall Maximum Fragment Entries"
msgstr "ຈຳນວນ Fragment ສູງສຸດຂອງໄຟວໍ"

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_firewall.php:198
msgid "Maximum number of packet fragments to hold for reassembly by scrub rules. Leave this blank for the default (5000)"
msgstr "ຈຳນວນ packet fragments ສູງສຸດທີ່ຈະເກັບໄວ້ເພື່ອລວມສ່ວນໃໝ່ໂດຍກົດ scrub. ປະຫວ່າງໄວ້ເພື່ອໃຊ້ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ (5000)"

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_firewall.php:202
msgid "Static route filtering"
msgstr "ການຕອງ Static route"

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_firewall.php:205
msgid "This option only applies if one or more static routes have been defined. If it is enabled, traffic that enters and leaves through the same interface will not be checked by the firewall. This may be desirable in some situations where multiple subnets are connected to the same interface."
msgstr "ຕົວເລືອກນີ້ໃຊ້ສະເພາະເມື່ອມີການກຳນົດ static routes. ຫາກເປີດໃຊ້, ຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ເຂົ້າມາ ແລະ ອອກໄປຜ່ານອິນເຕີເຟດດຽວກັນຈະບໍ່ຖືກກວດສອບໂດຍໄຟວໍ. ສິ່ງນີ້ອາດມີປະໂຫຍດໃນບາງກໍລະນີທີ່ມີຫຼາຍຊັບເນັດເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບອິນເຕີເຟດດຽວກັນ."

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_firewall.php:212
msgid "Disable Auto-added VPN rules"
msgstr "ປິດກົດ VPN ທີ່ເພີ່ມໃຫ້ອັດຕະໂນມັດ"

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_firewall.php:215
msgid "Note: This disables automatically added rules for IPsec."
msgstr "ໝາຍເຫດ: ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະປິດການໃຊ້ງານກົດທີ່ເພີ່ມໃຫ້ອັດຕະໂນມັດສຳລັບ IPsec."

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_firewall.php:219 src/usr/local/www/firewall_rules_edit.php:1575
msgid "Disable reply-to"
msgstr "ປິດໃຊ້ງານ reply-to"

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_firewall.php:222
msgid "With Multi-WAN it is generally desired to ensure traffic leaves the same interface it arrives on, hence reply-to is added automatically by default. When using bridging, this behavior must be disabled if the WAN gateway IP is different from the gateway IP of the hosts behind the bridged interface."
msgstr "ສຳລັບ Multi-WAN ປົກກະຕິແລ້ວຈະຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ຂໍ້ມູນອອກໄປທາງອິນເຕີເຟດດຽວກັບທີ່ເຂົ້າມາ, ດັ່ງນັ້ນ reply-to ຈຶ່ງຖືກເພີ່ມໃຫ້ອັດຕະໂນມັດ. ເມື່ອໃຊ້ bridging ຕ້ອງປິດສ່ວນນີ້ຫາກ IP ເກດເວຂອງ WAN ຕ່າງຈາກ IP ເກດເວຂອງໂຮສທີ່ຢູ່ຫຼັງອິນເຕີເຟດທີ່ເຮັດ bridge."

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_firewall.php:229
msgid "Disable Negate rules"
msgstr "ປິດໃຊ້ງານ Negate rules"

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_firewall.php:232
msgid "With Multi-WAN it is generally desired to ensure traffic reaches directly connected networks and VPN networks when using policy routing. This can be disabled for special purposes but it requires manually creating rules for these networks."
msgstr "ສຳລັບ Multi-WAN ປົກກະຕິແລ້ວຈະຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ຂໍ້ມູນໄປຮອດເຄືອຂ່າຍທີ່ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ໂດຍກົງ ແລະ ເຄືອຂ່າຍ VPN ເມື່ອໃຊ້ policy routing. ສາມາດປິດໄດ້ສຳລັບຈຸດປະສົງພິເສດ ແຕ່ຕ້ອງສ້າງກົດສຳລັບເຄືອຂ່າຍເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ."

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_firewall.php:238
msgid "Allow APIPA"
msgstr "ອະນຸຍາດ APIPA"

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_firewall.php:241
msgid "Normally this traffic is dropped by the firewall, as APIPA traffic cannot be routed, but some providers may utilize APIPA space for interconnect interfaces."
msgstr "ໂດຍປົກກະຕິຂໍ້ມູນເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຈະຖືກໄຟວໍລົບຖິ້ມ ເພາະ APIPA ບໍ່ສາມາດເລືອກເສັ້ນທາງ (route) ໄດ້, ແຕ່ຜູ້ໃຫ້ບໍລິການບາງລາຍອາດໃຊ້ APIPA ສຳລັບອິນເຕີເຟດທີ່ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຫາກັນ."

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_firewall.php:245
msgid "Aliases Hostnames Resolve Interval"
msgstr "ໄລຍະເວລາການ Resolve ຊື່ໂຮສໃນ Aliases"

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_firewall.php:249
#, php-format
msgid "Interval, in seconds, that will be used to resolve hostnames configured on aliases. %1$sNote:\t Leave this blank for the default (300s)."
msgstr "ໄລຍະເວລາ (ວິນາທີ) ທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ໃນການ resolve ຊື່ໂຮສທີ່ຕັ້ງຄ່າໄວ້ໃນ aliases. %1$sໝາຍເຫດ:\t ປະຫວ່າງໄວ້ເພື່ອໃຊ້ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ (300 ວິນາທີ)."

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_firewall.php:255
msgid "Check certificate of aliases URLs"
msgstr "ກວດສອບໃບຢັ້ງຢືນຂອງ URL ໃນ aliases"

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_firewall.php:258
msgid "Make sure the certificate is valid for all HTTPS addresses on aliases. If it's not valid or is revoked, do not download it."
msgstr "ກວດສອບໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າໃບຢັ້ງຢືນນັ້ນຖືກຕ້ອງສຳລັບທຸກທີ່ຢູ່ HTTPS ໃນ aliases. ຫາກບໍ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ ຫຼື ຖືກຍົກເລີກ, ຈະບໍ່ດາວໂຫຼດຂໍ້ມູນ."

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_firewall.php:262
msgid "Bogon Networks"
msgstr "ເຄືອຂ່າຍ Bogon"

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_firewall.php:269
msgid "Monthly"
msgstr "ລາຍເດືອນ"

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_firewall.php:270
msgid "Weekly"
msgstr "ລາຍອາທິດ"

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_firewall.php:271
msgid "Daily"
msgstr "ລາຍວັນ"

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_firewall.php:266
msgid "Update Frequency"
msgstr "ຄວາມຖີ່ຂອງການອັບເດດ"

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_firewall.php:273
msgid "The frequency of updating the lists of IP addresses that are reserved (but not RFC 1918) or not yet assigned by IANA."
msgstr "ຄວາມຖີ່ໃນການອັບເດດລາຍຊື່ IP ທີ່ຖືກຈອງໄວ້ (ແຕ່ບໍ່ແມ່ນ RFC 1918) ຫຼື ຍັງບໍ່ທັນໄດ້ຈັດສັນໂດຍ IANA."

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_firewall.php:279
msgid "Network Address Translation"
msgstr "Network Address Translation (NAT)"

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_firewall.php:295
msgid "NAT + proxy"
msgstr "NAT + proxy"

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_firewall.php:296
msgid "Pure NAT"
msgstr "Pure NAT"

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_firewall.php:291
msgid "NAT Reflection mode for port forwards"
msgstr "ໂໝດ NAT Reflection ສຳລັບການສົ່ງຕໍ່ພອດ (port forwards)"

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_firewall.php:298
#, php-format
msgid ""
"%1$sThe pure NAT mode uses a set of NAT rules to direct packets to the target of the port forward. It has better scalability, but it must be possible to accurately determine the interface and gateway IP used for communication with the target at the time the rules are loaded. There are no inherent limits to the number of ports other than the limits of the protocols.  All protocols available for port forwards are supported.%2$sThe NAT + proxy mode uses a helper program to send packets to the target of the port forward. It is useful in setups where the interface and/or "
"gateway IP used for communication with the target cannot be accurately determined at the time the rules are loaded. Reflection rules are not created for ranges larger than 500 ports and will not be used for more than 1000 ports total between all port forwards. Only TCP and UDP protocols are supported.%3$sIndividual rules may be configured to override this system setting on a per-rule basis."
msgstr "%1$sໂໝດ pure NAT ໃຊ້ຊຸດຂອງກົດ NAT ເພື່ອສົ່ງແພັກເກັດໄປຫາປາຍທາງ. ມັນຮອງຮັບການຂະຫຍາຍຕົວໄດ້ດີກວ່າ ແຕ່ຕ້ອງສາມາດກຳນົດອິນເຕີເຟດ ແລະ IP ເກດເວໄດ້ຢ່າງຊັດເຈນ. %2$sໂໝດ NAT + proxy ໃຊ້ໂປຣແກຣມຊ່ວຍໃນການສົ່ງແພັກເກັດ. ມັນມີປະໂຫຍດໃນກໍລະນີທີ່ບໍ່ສາມາດກຳນົດອິນເຕີເຟດ ຫຼື IP ເກດເວໄດ້ຊັດເຈນໃນເວລາໂຫຼດກົດ. %3$sແຕ່ລະກົດສາມາດຕັ້ງຄ່າເພື່ອຂຽນທັບຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງລະບົບໄດ້."

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_firewall.php:317
msgid "Reflection Timeout"
msgstr "Reflection Timeout"

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_firewall.php:321
#, php-format
msgid "Enter value for Reflection timeout in seconds.%1$sNote: Only applies to Reflection on port forwards in NAT + proxy mode."
msgstr "ປ້ອນຄ່າ Reflection timeout ເປັນວິນາທີ. %1$sໝາຍເຫດ: ໃຊ້ສະເພາະກັບ Reflection ຂອງ port forwards ໃນໂໝດ NAT + proxy ເທົັ້ນ."

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_firewall.php:326
msgid "Enable NAT Reflection for 1:1 NAT"
msgstr "ເປີດໃຊ້ NAT Reflection ສຳລັບ 1:1 NAT"

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_firewall.php:329
msgid "Note: Reflection on 1:1 mappings is only for the inbound component of the 1:1 mappings. This functions the same as the pure NAT mode for port forwards. For more details, refer to the pure NAT mode description above. Individual rules may be configured to override this system setting on a per-rule basis."
msgstr "ໝາຍເຫດ: Reflection ໃນການຈັບຄູ່ແບບ 1:1 ແມ່ນໃຊ້ສຳລັບສ່ວນຂາເຂົ້າເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ມັນເຮັດວຽກຄືກັບໂໝດ pure NAT ສຳລັບ port forwards."

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_firewall.php:337
msgid "Enable automatic outbound NAT for Reflection"
msgstr "ເປີດໃຊ້ outbound NAT ອັດຕະໂນມັດສຳລັບ Reflection"

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_firewall.php:340
msgid "Required for full functionality of the pure NAT mode of NAT Reflection for port forwards or NAT Reflection for 1:1 NAT. Note: This only works for assigned interfaces.  Other interfaces require manually creating the outbound NAT rules that direct the reply packets back through the router."
msgstr "ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງໃຊ້ເພື່ອໃຫ້ໂໝດ pure NAT ຂອງ NAT Reflection ເຮັດວຽກໄດ້ສົມບູນ. ໝາຍເຫດ: ສິ່ງນີ້ໃຊ້ໄດ້ສະເພາະກັບອິນເຕີເຟດທີ່ຖືກກຳນົດໄວ້ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_firewall.php:347
msgid "TFTP Proxy"
msgstr "TFTP Proxy"

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_firewall.php:351
