#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_l2tp.php:103 src/usr/local/www/services_pppoe_edit.php:141
msgid "The specified server address lies in the remote subnet."
msgstr "ທີ່ຢູ່ເຊີບເວີທີ່ລະບຸ ຢູ່ໃນເຄືອຂ່າຍຍ່ອຍຂອງຝັ່ງລູກຂ່າຍ (Remote Subnet)."

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_l2tp.php:106
msgid "The specified server address is equal to the LAN interface address."
msgstr "ທີ່ຢູ່ເຊີບເວີທີ່ລະບຸ ແມ່ນກົງກັບທີ່ຢູ່ຂອງອິນເຕີເຟສ LAN."

