msgid "The Secondary L2TP DNS Server cannot be set when the Primary L2TP DNS Server is empty."
msgstr "ບໍ່ສາມາດຕັ້ງຄ່າ Secondary L2TP DNS Server ໄດ້ ຖ້າຊ່ອງ Primary L2TP DNS Server ຍັງຫວ່າງຢູ່."

