msgid "VPN MTU"
msgstr "VPN MTU"

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_l2tp.php:308 src/usr/local/www/interfaces.php:2015
msgid "If this field is blank, the adapter's default MTU will be used. This is typically 1500 bytes but can vary in some circumstances."
msgstr "ຖ້າຊ່ອງນີ້ຫວ່າງໄວ້, ຈະໃຊ້ຄ່າ MTU ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງອະແດັບເຕີ. ໂດຍປົກກະຕິແມ່ນ 1500 ໄບຕ໌ ແຕ່ອາດມີການປ່ຽນແປງໃນບາງກໍລະນີ."

