#: src/usr/local/www/interfaces_bridge_edit.php:166
msgid "Transmit Hold Count for STP needs to be an integer between 1 and 10."
msgstr "Transmit Hold Count ສຳລັບ STP ຕ້ອງເປັນຕົວເລກຖ້ວນລະຫວ່າງ 1 ຫາ 10."

#: src/usr/local/www/interfaces_bridge_edit.php:170
#, php-format
msgid "%s interface priority for STP needs to be an integer between 0 and 240."
msgstr "ລຳດັບຄວາມສຳຄັນ (Priority) ຂອງອິນເຕີເຟສ %s ສຳລັບ STP ຕ້ອງເປັນຕົວເລກຖ້ວນລະຫວ່າງ 0 ຫາ 240."

#: src/usr/local/www/interfaces_bridge_edit.php:178
