msgid "%s interface path cost for STP needs to be an integer between 1 and 200000000."
msgstr "Path cost ຂອງອິນເຕີເຟສ %s ສຳລັບ STP ຕ້ອງເປັນຕົວເລກຖ້ວນລະຫວ່າງ 1 ຫາ 200,000,000."

#: src/usr/local/www/interfaces_bridge_edit.php:184
msgid "At least one member interface must be selected for a bridge."
msgstr "ຕ້ອງເລືອກອິນເຕີເຟສສະມາຊິກຢ່າງໜ້ອຍໜຶ່ງຕົວສຳລັບການເຮັດບຣິດ (Bridge)."

#: src/usr/local/www/interfaces_bridge_edit.php:191
#, php-format
msgid "The interface (%s) is part of the Captive Portal and cannot be part of the bridge. Remove the interface to continue."
msgstr "ອິນເຕີເຟສ (%s) ເປັນສ່ວນໜຶ່ງຂອງ Captive Portal ແລະ ບໍ່ສາມາດເປັນສ່ວນໜຶ່ງຂອງບຣິດໄດ້. ກະລຸນາລຶບອິນເຕີເຟສນີ້ອອກກ່ອນເພື່ອດຳເນີນການຕໍ່."

#: src/usr/local/www/interfaces_bridge_edit.php:202
#, php-format
