msgid "STP interface (%s) must not be a pseudo-interface or a VLAN interface."
msgstr "ອິນເຕີເຟສ STP (%s) ຕ້ອງບໍ່ແມ່ນ pseudo-interface ຫຼື ອິນເຕີເຟສ VLAN."

#: src/usr/local/www/interfaces_bridge_edit.php:233
#, php-format
msgid "Edge interface (%s) is not part of the bridge. Remove the edge interface to continue."
msgstr "ອິນເຕີເຟສແບບ Edge (%s) ບໍ່ໄດ້ເປັນສ່ວນໜຶ່ງຂອງບຣິດ. ກະລຸນາລຶບອິນເຕີເຟສນີ້ອອກກ່ອນເພື່ອດຳເນີນການຕໍ່."

#: src/usr/local/www/interfaces_bridge_edit.php:241
