msgstr "ອິນເຕີເຟສທີ່ມີສ່ວນຮ່ວມໃນບຣິດນີ້."

#: src/usr/local/www/interfaces_bridge_edit.php:445 src/usr/local/www/firewall_rules_edit.php:1542 src/usr/local/www/firewall_rules_edit.php:1548 src/usr/local/www/vpn_ipsec_phase1.php:1046 src/etc/inc/shaper.inc:4497 src/etc/inc/shaper.inc:4928
msgid "Advanced Options"
msgstr "ຕົວເລືອກຂັ້ນສູງ"

#: src/usr/local/www/interfaces_bridge_edit.php:457
msgid "Cache Size"
msgstr "ຂະໜາດແຄສ (Cache Size)"

#: src/usr/local/www/interfaces_bridge_edit.php:460
msgid "Set the size of the bridge address cache. The default is 2000 entries."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າຂະໜາດແຄສຂອງທີ່ຢູ່ບຣິດ. ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນ 2000 ລາຍການ."

#: src/usr/local/www/interfaces_bridge_edit.php:464
msgid "Cache expire time"
msgstr "ໄລຍະເວລາໝົດອາຍຸຂອງແຄສ"

#: src/usr/local/www/interfaces_bridge_edit.php:467
msgid "Set the timeout of address cache entries to this number of seconds. If seconds is zero, then address cache entries will not be expired. The default is 1200 seconds."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າເວລາໝົດອາຍຸຂອງແຄສທີ່ຢູ່ເປັນວິນາທີ. ຖ້າເປັນ 0, ແຄສຈະບໍ່ມີວັນໝົດອາຍຸ. ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນ 1200 ວິນາທີ."

#: src/usr/local/www/interfaces_bridge_edit.php:473
msgid "Span Port"
msgstr "Span Port"

#: src/usr/local/www/interfaces_bridge_edit.php:477
#, php-format
msgid "Add the interface named by interface as a span port on the bridge. Span ports transmit a copy of every frame received by the bridge. This is most useful for snooping a bridged network passively on another host connected to one of the span ports of the bridge. %1$s%2$sThe span interface cannot be part of the bridge member interfaces.%3$s"
msgstr "ເພີ່ມອິນເຕີເຟສໃຫ້ເປັນ span port ໃນບຣິດ. Span port ຈະສົ່ງສຳເນົາຂອງທຸກໆເຟຣມ (Frame) ທີ່ບຣິດໄດ້ຮັບ. ຄ່ານີ້ມີປະໂຫຍດໃນການຕິດຕາມ (snooping) ຂໍ້ມູນໃນເຄືອຂ່າຍບຣິດແບບ passive ຜ່ານໂຮສອື່ນທີ່ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບ span port. %1$s%2$sອິນເຕີເຟສ span ບໍ່ສາມາດເປັນສ່ວນໜຶ່ງຂອງອິນເຕີເຟສສະມາຊິກຂອງບຣິດໄດ້.%3$s"

#: src/usr/local/www/interfaces_bridge_edit.php:485
msgid "Edge Ports"
msgstr "Edge Ports"

#: src/usr/local/www/interfaces_bridge_edit.php:489
msgid "Set interface as an edge port. An edge port connects directly to end stations and cannot create bridging loops in the network; this allows it to transition straight to forwarding."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າອິນເຕີເຟສໃຫ້ເປັນ edge port. Edge port ຈະເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ໂດຍກົງກັບອຸປະກອນປາຍທາງ ແລະ ບໍ່ກໍ່ໃຫ້ເກີດລູບ (Loops) ໃນເຄືອຂ່າຍ; ສິ່ງນີ້ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ມັນປ່ຽນສະຖານະໄປເປັນການສົ່ງຕໍ່ຂໍ້ມູນ (forwarding) ໄດ້ທັນທີ."

#: src/usr/local/www/interfaces_bridge_edit.php:495
msgid "Auto Edge Ports"
msgstr "Auto Edge Ports"

#: src/usr/local/www/interfaces_bridge_edit.php:499
#, php-format
msgid "Allow interface to automatically detect edge status. This is the default for all interfaces added to a bridge.%1$sThis will disable the autoedge status of interfaces. %2$s"
msgstr "ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ອິນເຕີເຟສກວດສອບສະຖານະ edge ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ. ນີ້ແມ່ນຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນສຳລັບທຸກອິນເຕີເຟສທີ່ເພີ່ມເຂົ້າໃນບຣິດ. %1$sສິ່ງນີ້ຈະປິດສະຖານະ autoedge ຂອງອິນເຕີເຟສ. %2$s"

#: src/usr/local/www/interfaces_bridge_edit.php:506
msgid "PTP Ports"
msgstr "PTP Ports"

#: src/usr/local/www/interfaces_bridge_edit.php:510
msgid "Set the interface as a point-to-point link. This is required for straight transitions to forwarding and should be enabled on a direct link to another RSTP-capable switch."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າອິນເຕີເຟສໃຫ້ເປັນລິ້ງແບບ point-to-point. ນີ້ແມ່ນສິ່ງຈຳເປັນສຳລັບການປ່ຽນສະຖານະໄປເປັນ forwarding ໂດຍກົງ ແລະ ຄວນເປີດໃຊ້ງານໃນລິ້ງທີ່ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ໂດຍກົງກັບສະວິດອື່ນທີ່ຮອງຮັບ RSTP."

#: src/usr/local/www/interfaces_bridge_edit.php:516
msgid "Auto PTP Ports"
msgstr "Auto PTP Ports"

#: src/usr/local/www/interfaces_bridge_edit.php:520
#, php-format
msgid "Automatically detect the point-to-point status on interface by checking the full duplex link status. This is the default for interfaces added to the bridge.%1$sThe interfaces selected here will be removed from default autoedge status. %2$s"
msgstr "ກວດສອບສະຖານະ point-to-point ເທິງອິນເຕີເຟສໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ ໂດຍການກວດສອບສະຖານະລິ້ງແບບ full duplex. ນີ້ແມ່ນຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນສຳລັບອິນເຕີເຟສທີ່ເພີ່ມເຂົ້າໃນບຣິດ. %1$sອິນເຕີເຟສທີ່ເລືອກຢູ່ບ່ອນນີ້ຈະຖືກຍົກເລີກຈາກສະຖານະ autoedge ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ. %2$s"

#: src/usr/local/www/interfaces_bridge_edit.php:527
msgid "Sticky Ports"
msgstr "Sticky Ports"

#: src/usr/local/www/interfaces_bridge_edit.php:531
msgid "Mark an interface as a \"sticky\" interface. Dynamically learned address entries are treated as static once entered into the cache. Sticky entries are never aged out of the cache or replaced, even if the address is seen on a different interface."
msgstr "ກຳນົດອິນເຕີເຟສໃຫ້ເປັນ \"sticky\". ທີ່ຢູ່ທີ່ຮຽນຮູ້ແບບໄດນາມິກຈະຖືກຈັດໃຫ້ເປັນແບບສະແຕຕິກ (Static) ທັນທີທີ່ຖືກບັນທຶກເຂົ້າໃນແຄສ. ຂໍ້ມູນແບບ Sticky ຈະບໍ່ມີວັນໝົດອາຍຸ ຫຼື ຖືກປ່ຽນແທນ ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າຈະພົບທີ່ຢູ່ນັ້ນໃນອິນເຕີເຟສອື່ນກໍຕາມ."

#: src/usr/local/www/interfaces_bridge_edit.php:538
msgid "Private Ports"
msgstr "Private Ports"

#: src/usr/local/www/interfaces_bridge_edit.php:542
msgid "Mark an interface as a \"private\" interface. A private interface does not forward any traffic to any other port that is also a private interface. "
msgstr "ໝາຍອິນເຕີເຟສໃຫ້ເປັນອິນເຕີເຟສ \"ສ່ວນຕົວ\" (private). ອິນເຕີເຟສສ່ວນຕົວຈະບໍ່ສົ່ງຕໍ່ຂໍ້ມູນໃດໆ ໄປຫາພອດອື່ນທີ່ເປັນອິນເຕີເຟສສ່ວນຕົວຄືກັນ. "

#: src/usr/local/www/interfaces_bridge_edit.php:546
msgid "Enable IPv6 auto linklocal"
msgstr "ເປີດໃຊ້ງານ IPv6 auto linklocal"

#: src/usr/local/www/interfaces_bridge_edit.php:549
msgid "When enabled, the AUTO_LINKLOCAL flag is set on the bridge interface and cleared on every member interface. This is required when the bridge interface is used for stateless autoconfiguration. "
msgstr "ເມື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ງານ, ແຟລັກ AUTO_LINKLOCAL ຈະຖືກກຳນົດໃສ່ອິນເຕີເຟສບຣິດ ແລະ ຖືກຍົກເລີກອອກຈາກທຸກໆອິນເຕີເຟສສະມາຊິກ. ສິ່ງນີ້ແມ່ນຈຳເປັນ ເມື່ອອິນເຕີເຟສບຣິດຖືກໃຊ້ສຳລັບການກຳນົດຄ່າອັດຕະໂນມັດແບບບໍ່ມີສະຖານະ (stateless autoconfiguration). "

#: src/usr/local/www/interfaces_bridge_edit.php:555
msgid "Enable RSTP/STP"
msgstr "ເປີດໃຊ້ງານ RSTP/STP"

#: src/usr/local/www/interfaces_bridge_edit.php:562
msgid "RSTP/STP"
msgstr "RSTP/STP"

#: src/usr/local/www/interfaces_bridge_edit.php:571
msgid "Protocol used for spanning tree."
msgstr "ໂປຣໂຕຄໍທີ່ໃຊ້ສຳລັບ spanning tree."

#: src/usr/local/www/interfaces_bridge_edit.php:577
msgid "STP Interfaces"
msgstr "STP Interfaces"

#: src/usr/local/www/interfaces_bridge_edit.php:581
msgid "Enable Spanning Tree Protocol on interface. The if_bridge(4) driver has support for the IEEE 802.1D Spanning Tree Protocol (STP). STP is used to detect and remove loops in a network topology."
msgstr "ເປີດໃຊ້ Spanning Tree Protocol ເທິງອິນເຕີເຟສ. ໄດຣເວີ if_bridge(4) ຮອງຮັບ IEEE 802.1D Spanning Tree Protocol (STP). STP ຖືກນຳໃຊ້ເພື່ອມີໄວ້ກວດຈັບ ແລະ ກຳຈັດລູບ (Loops) ໃນໂຄງສ້າງເຄືອຂ່າຍ."

#: src/usr/local/www/interfaces_bridge_edit.php:586
msgid "Valid time"
msgstr "Valid time"

#: src/usr/local/www/interfaces_bridge_edit.php:590
msgid "Set the time that a Spanning Tree Protocol configuration is valid. The default is 20 seconds. The minimum is 6 seconds and the maximum is 40 seconds."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າເວລາທີ່ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ STP ຈະມີຜົນ. ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນ 20 ວິນາທີ. ຕ່ຳສຸດແມ່ນ 6 ວິນາທີ ແລະ ສູງສຸດແມ່ນ 40 ວິນາທີ."

#: src/usr/local/www/interfaces_bridge_edit.php:594
msgid "Forward time"
msgstr "Forward time"

#: src/usr/local/www/interfaces_bridge_edit.php:598
msgid "Set the time that must pass before an interface begins forwarding packets when Spanning Tree is enabled. The default is 15 seconds. The minimum is 4 seconds and the maximum is 30 seconds. "
msgstr "ກຳນົດເວລາທີ່ຕ້ອງຜ່ານໄປ ກ່ອນທີ່ອິນເຕີເຟສຈະເລີ່ມສົ່ງຕໍ່ແພັກເກັດ ເມື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ງານ Spanning Tree. ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນ 15 ວິນາທີ. ຄ່າຕ່ຳສຸດແມ່ນ 4 ວິນາທີ ແລະ ຄ່າສູງສຸດແມ່ນ 30 ວິນາທີ. "

#: src/usr/local/www/interfaces_bridge_edit.php:602
msgid "Hello time"
msgstr "Hello time"

#: src/usr/local/www/interfaces_bridge_edit.php:606
msgid "Set the time in seconds between broadcasting of Spanning Tree Protocol configuration messages. The hello time may only be changed when operating in legacy STP mode. The default is 2 seconds. The minimum is 1 second and the maximum is 2 seconds."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າໄລຍະເວລາເປັນວິນາທີ ລະຫວ່າງການກະຈາຍຂໍ້ຄວາມການຕັ້ງຄ່າ STP. Hello time ສາມາດປ່ຽນໄດ້ສະເພາະເມື່ອເຮັດວຽກໃນໂໝດ legacy STP ເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນ 2 ວິນາທີ. ຕ່ຳສຸດແມ່ນ 1 ວິນາທີ ແລະ ສູງສຸດແມ່ນ 2 ວິນາທີ."

#: src/usr/local/www/interfaces_bridge_edit.php:611 src/usr/local/www/interfaces_vlan.php:98 src/usr/local/www/system_gateway_groups.php:131 src/etc/inc/shaper.inc:1812
msgid "Priority"
msgstr "ລຳດັບຄວາມສຳຄັນ"

#: src/usr/local/www/interfaces_bridge_edit.php:615
msgid "Set the bridge priority for Spanning Tree. The default is 32768. The minimum is 0 and the maximum is 61440. "
msgstr "ກຳນົດບຸລິມະສິດບຣິດ (bridge priority) ສຳລັບ Spanning Tree. ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນ 32768. ຄ່າຕ່ຳສຸດແມ່ນ 0 ແລະ ຄ່າສູງສຸດແມ່ນ 61440. "

#: src/usr/local/www/interfaces_bridge_edit.php:619
msgid "Hold Count"
msgstr "Hold Count"

#: src/usr/local/www/interfaces_bridge_edit.php:623
msgid "Set the transmit hold count for Spanning Tree. This is the number of packets transmitted before being rate limited. The default is 6. The minimum is 1 and the maximum is 10."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າ transmit hold count ສຳລັບ Spanning Tree. ນີ້ແມ່ນຈຳນວນແພັກເກັດທີ່ຖືກສົ່ງອອກ ກ່ອນທີ່ຈະມີການຈຳກັດຄວາມໄວ (rate limited). ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນ 6. ຕ່ຳສຸດແມ່ນ 1 ແລະ ສູງສຸດແມ່ນ 10."

#: src/usr/local/www/interfaces_bridge_edit.php:628
msgid " Priority"
msgstr " ລຳດັບຄວາມສຳຄັນ"

#: src/usr/local/www/interfaces_bridge_edit.php:632
msgid "Set the Spanning Tree priority of interface to value. The default is 128. The minimum is 0 and the maximum is 240. Increments of 16."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າ Spanning Tree priority ຂອງອິນເຕີເຟສ. ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນ 128. ຕ່ຳສຸດແມ່ນ 0 ແລະ ສູງສຸດແມ່ນ 240. ໂດຍເພີ່ມຂຶ້ນເທື່ອລະ 16."

#: src/usr/local/www/interfaces_bridge_edit.php:639
msgid " Path cost"
msgstr " Path cost"

#: src/usr/local/www/interfaces_bridge_edit.php:643
msgid "Set the Spanning Tree path cost of interface to value. The default is calculated from the link speed. To change a previously selected path cost back to automatic, set the cost to 0. The minimum is 1 and the maximum is 200000000."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າ Spanning Tree path cost ຂອງອິນເຕີເຟສ. ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນຄິດໄລ່ຈາກຄວາມໄວຂອງລິ້ງ. ເພື່ອປ່ຽນຄ່າ path cost ທີ່ເຄີຍເລືອກໄວ້ກັບໄປເປັນແບບອັດຕະໂນມັດ, ໃຫ້ຕັ້ງເປັນ 0. ຕ່ຳສຸດແມ່ນ 1 ແລະ ສູງສຸດແມ່ນ 200,000,000."

