msgid "Set this option to disable this client-specific override without removing it from the list."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າຕົວເລືອກນີ້ເພື່ອປິດໃຊ້ການ override ນີ້ ໂດຍບໍ່ຕ້ອງລຶບອອກຈາກລາຍການ."

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_openvpn_csc.php:366
msgid "Enter the X.509 common name for the client certificate, or the username for VPNs utilizing password authentication. This match is case sensitive."
msgstr "ປ້ອນ X.509 common name ສຳລັບໃບຢັ້ງຢືນລູກຂ່າຍ, ຫຼື ຊື່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ສຳລັບ VPN ທີ່ໃຊ້ການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນດ້ວຍລະຫັດຜ່ານ. ການກວດສອບຊື່ແມ່ນແຍກຕົວອັກສອນໃຫຍ່-ນ້ອຍ (case sensitive)."

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_openvpn_csc.php:373
msgid "A description for administrative reference (not parsed)."
msgstr "ຄຳອະທິບາຍສຳລັບການອ້າງອີງຂອງຜູ້ດູແລລະບົບ (ບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກນຳໄປປະມວນຜົນ)."

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_openvpn_csc.php:377
msgid "Connection blocking"
msgstr "ການບລັອກການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່"

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_openvpn_csc.php:380
msgid "Prevents the client from connecting to this server. Do not use this option to permanently disable a client due to a compromised key or password. Use a CRL (certificate revocation list) instead."
msgstr "ປ້ອງກັນບໍ່ໃຫ້ລູກຂ່າຍເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບເຊີບເວີນີ້. ຫ້າມໃຊ້ຕົວເລືອກນີ້ເພື່ອປິດການໃຊ້ງານລູກຂ່າຍແບບຖາວອນຍ້ອນຄີ ຫຼື ລະຫັດຜ່ານຮົ່ວໄຫຼ. ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ CRL (ລາຍການຍົກເລີກໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ) ແທນ."

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_openvpn_csc.php:391
#, php-format
msgid "The virtual IPv4 network used for private communications between this client and the server expressed using CIDR (e.g. 10.0.8.5/24). %1$sWith subnet topology, enter the client IP address and the subnet mask must match the IPv4 Tunnel Network on the server. %1$sWith net30 topology, the first network address of the /30 is assumed to be the server address and the second network address will be assigned to the client."
msgstr "ເຄືອຂ່າຍ IPv4 ສະເໝືອນທີ່ໃຊ້ສຳລັບການສື່ສານສ່ວນຕົວລະຫວ່າງລູກຂ່າຍນີ້ ແລະ ເຊີບເວີ ໃນຮູບແບບ CIDR (ເຊັ່ນ 10.0.8.5/24). %1$sສຳລັບ subnet topology, ໃຫ້ປ້ອນ IP ຂອງລູກຂ່າຍ ແລະ subnet mask ຕ້ອງກົງກັບ IPv4 Tunnel Network ໃນເຊີບເວີ. %1$sສຳລັບ net30 topology, ທີ່ຢູ່ທຳອິດຂອງ /30 ຈະຖືກຖືວ່າເປັນທີ່ຢູ່ເຊີບເວີ ແລະ ທີ່ຢູ່ທີສອງຈະຖືກມອບໃຫ້ລູກຂ່າຍ."

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_openvpn_csc.php:401
#, php-format
msgid "The virtual IPv6 network used for private communications between this client and the server expressed using prefix (e.g. 2001:db9:1:1::100/64). %1$sEnter the client IPv6 address and prefix. The prefix must match the IPv6 Tunnel Network prefix on the server. "
msgstr "ເຄືອຂ່າຍ IPv6 ສະເໝືອນທີ່ໃຊ້ສຳລັບການສື່ສານສ່ວນຕົວລະຫວ່າງລູກຂ່າຍນີ້ ແລະ ເຊີບເວີ ໃນຮູບແບບ prefix (ເຊັ່ນ 2001:db9:1:1::100/64). %1$sໃຫ້ປ້ອນທີ່ຢູ່ IPv6 ແລະ prefix ຂອງລູກຂ່າຍ. Prefix ຕ້ອງກົງກັບ IPv6 Tunnel Network prefix ໃນເຊີບເວີ. "

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_openvpn_csc.php:407
msgid "IPv4 Local Network/s"
msgstr "ເຄືອຂ່າຍ IPv4 ພາຍໃນ (Local Network/s)"

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_openvpn_csc.php:410
#, php-format
msgid "These are the IPv4 server-side networks that will be accessible from this particular client. Expressed as a comma-separated list of one or more CIDR networks. %1$sNOTE: Networks do not need to be specified here if they have already been defined on the main server configuration."
msgstr "ນີ້ແມ່ນເຄືອຂ່າຍ IPv4 ຝັ່ງເຊີບເວີທີ່ລູກຂ່າຍນີ້ສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງໄດ້. ໃຫ້ຂຽນໃນຮູບແບບລາຍການ CIDR ທີ່ແຍກດ້ວຍຈຸດ. %1$sໝາຍເຫດ: ບໍ່ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງລະບຸເຄືອຂ່າຍຢູ່ບ່ອນນີ້ ຖ້າມີການກຳນົດໄວ້ໃນການຕັ້ງຄ່າເຊີບເວີຫຼັກແລ້ວ."

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_openvpn_csc.php:416
msgid "IPv6 Local Network/s"
msgstr "ເຄືອຂ່າຍ IPv6 ພາຍໃນ (Local Network/s)"

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_openvpn_csc.php:419
#, php-format
msgid "These are the IPv6 server-side networks that will be accessible from this particular client. Expressed as a comma-separated list of one or more IP/PREFIX networks.%1$sNOTE: Networks do not need to be specified here if they have already been defined on the main server configuration."
msgstr "ນີ້ແມ່ນເຄືອຂ່າຍ IPv6 ຝັ່ງເຊີບເວີທີ່ລູກຂ່າຍນີ້ສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງໄດ້. ໃຫ້ຂຽນໃນຮູບແບບລາຍການ IP/PREFIX ທີ່ແຍກດ້ວຍຈຸດ. %1$sໝາຍເຫດ: ບໍ່ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງລະບຸເຄືອຂ່າຍຢູ່ບ່ອນນີ້ ຖ້າມີການກຳນົດໄວ້ໃນການຕັ້ງຄ່າເຊີບເວີຫຼັກແລ້ວ."

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_openvpn_csc.php:425
msgid "IPv4 Remote Network/s"
msgstr "ເຄືອຂ່າຍ IPv4 ຝັ່ງລູກຂ່າຍ (Remote Network/s)"

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_openvpn_csc.php:428
#, php-format
msgid "These are the IPv4 client-side networks that will be routed to this client specifically using iroute, so that a site-to-site VPN can be established. Expressed as a comma-separated list of one or more CIDR ranges. May be left blank if there are no client-side networks to be routed.%1$sNOTE: Remember to add these subnets to the IPv4 Remote Networks list on the corresponding OpenVPN server settings."
msgstr "ນີ້ແມ່ນເຄືອຂ່າຍ IPv4 ຝັ່ງລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ຈະຖືກຣູດ (Route) ໄປຫາລູກຂ່າຍນີ້ໂດຍສະເພາະຜ່ານ iroute ເພື່ອສ້າງ site-to-site VPN. ໃຫ້ຂຽນໃນຮູບແບບລາຍການ CIDR ທີ່ແຍກດ້ວຍຈຸດ. ສາມາດປ່ອຍຫວ່າງໄວ້ໄດ້ຖ້າບໍ່ມີເຄືອຂ່າຍຝັ່ງລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ຈະຣູດ. %1$sໝາຍເຫດ: ຢ່າລືມເພີ່ມ subnet ເຫຼົ່ານີ້ເຂົ້າໃນລາຍການ IPv4 Remote Networks ໃນການຕັ້ງຄ່າເຊີບເວີ OpenVPN ທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງ."

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_openvpn_csc.php:435
msgid "IPv6 Remote Network/s"
msgstr "ເຄືອຂ່າຍ IPv6 ຝັ່ງລູກຂ່າຍ (Remote Network/s)"

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_openvpn_csc.php:438
#, php-format
msgid "These are the IPv6 client-side networks that will be routed to this client specifically using iroute, so that a site-to-site VPN can be established. Expressed as a comma-separated list of one or more IP/PREFIX networks. May be left blank if there are no client-side networks to be routed.%1$sNOTE: Remember to add these subnets to the IPv6 Remote Networks list on the corresponding OpenVPN server settings."
msgstr "ນີ້ແມ່ນເຄືອຂ່າຍ IPv6 ຝັ່ງລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ຈະຖືກຣູດ (Route) ໄປຫາລູກຂ່າຍນີ້ໂດຍສະເພາະຜ່ານ iroute ເພື່ອສ້າງ site-to-site VPN. ໃຫ້ຂຽນໃນຮູບແບບລາຍການ IP/PREFIX ທີ່ແຍກດ້ວຍຈຸດ. ສາມາດປ່ອຍຫວ່າງໄວ້ໄດ້ຖ້າບໍ່ມີເຄືອຂ່າຍຝັ່ງລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ຈະຣູດ. %1$sໝາຍເຫດ: ຢ່າລືມເພີ່ມ subnet ເຫຼົ່ານີ້ເຂົ້າໃນລາຍການ IPv6 Remote Networks ໃນການຕັ້ງຄ່າເຊີບເວີ OpenVPN ທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງ."

