#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_openvpn_csc.php:571
msgid "Possible options: b-node (broadcasts), p-node (point-to-point name queries to a WINS server), m-node (broadcast then query name server), and h-node (query name server, then broadcast). "
msgstr "ຕົວເລືອກທີ່ເປັນໄປໄດ້: b-node (broadcasts), p-node (point-to-point name queries ໄປຫາເຊີເວີ WINS), m-node (broadcast ແລ້ວຈຶ່ງ query name server), ແລະ h-node (query name server ແລ້ວຈຶ່ງ broadcast). "

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_openvpn_csc.php:579
msgid "A NetBIOS Scope ID provides an extended naming service for NetBIOS over TCP/IP. The NetBIOS scope ID isolates NetBIOS traffic on a single network to only those nodes with the same NetBIOS scope ID. "
msgstr "NetBIOS Scope ID ໃຫ້ບໍລິການຕັ້ງຊື່ແບບຂະຫຍາຍສຳລັບ NetBIOS ຜ່ານ TCP/IP. NetBIOS scope ID ຈະແຍກການຮັບສົ່ງຂໍ້ມູນ NetBIOS ໃນເຄືອຂ່າຍດຽວໃຫ້ສະເພາະ Node ທີ່ມີ NetBIOS scope ID ດຽວກັນເທົ່ານັ້ນ. "

