msgid "Allow IP options"
msgstr "ອະນຸຍາດຕົວເລືອກ IP"

#: src/usr/local/www/firewall_rules_edit.php:1585
#, php-format
msgid "A packet matching this rule can be marked and this mark used to match on other NAT/filter rules. It is called %1$sPolicy filtering%2$s."
msgstr "ແພັກເກັດທີ່ກົງກັບກົດນີ້ສາມາດຖືກໝາຍໄວ້ ແລະ ເຄື່ອງໝາຍນີ້ສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອໃຫ້ກົງກັບກົດ NAT/filter ອື່ນໆໄດ້. ເອີ້ນວ່າ %1$sPolicy filtering%2$s."

#: src/usr/local/www/firewall_rules_edit.php:1588 src/usr/local/www/firewall_rules_edit.php:1599
msgid "Tagged"
msgstr "ຕິດແທັກ (Tagged)"

#: src/usr/local/www/firewall_rules_edit.php:1592
msgid "nottagged"
msgstr "ບໍ່ໄດ້ຕິດແທັກ (nottagged)"

#: src/usr/local/www/firewall_rules_edit.php:1604
msgid "Match a mark placed on a packet by a different rule with the Tag option. Check Invert to match packets which do not contain this tag."
msgstr "ກວດສອບເຄື່ອງໝາຍທີ່ຕິດມາກັບແພັກເກັດຈາກກົດອື່ນດ້ວຍຕົວເລືອກ Tag. ເລືອກ Invert ເພື່ອກວດສອບແພັກເກັດທີ່ບໍ່ມີແທັກນີ້."

#: src/usr/local/www/firewall_rules_edit.php:1610
msgid "Max. states"
msgstr "ສະຖານະສູງສຸດ"

