#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_network.php:82
msgid "IPv6 Options"
msgstr "ຕົວເລືອກ IPv6"

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_network.php:86
msgid "Allow IPv6"
msgstr "ອະນຸຍາດ IPv6"

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_network.php:89
msgid "NOTE: This does not disable any IPv6 features on the firewall, it only blocks traffic."
msgstr "ໝາຍເຫດ: ສິ່ງນີ້ບໍ່ໄດ້ປິດຄຸນສົມບັດ IPv6 ໃດໆໃນໄຟວໍ, ມັນພຽງແຕ່ບລັອກການຮັບສົ່ງຂໍ້ມູນເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_network.php:94
msgid "IPv6 over IPv4 Tunneling"
msgstr "ການເຮັດ Tunnel IPv6 ຜ່ານ IPv4"

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_network.php:97
#, php-format
msgid "These options create an RFC 2893 compatible mechanism for IPv4 NAT encapsulation of IPv6 packets, that can be used to tunnel IPv6 packets over IPv4 routing infrastructures. IPv6 firewall rules are %1$salso required%2$s, to control and pass encapsulated traffic."
msgstr "ຕົວເລືອກເຫຼົ່ານີ້ສ້າງກົນໄກທີ່ຮອງຮັບ RFC 2893 ສຳລັບການຫຸ້ມຫໍ່ແພັກເກັດ IPv6 ໃນ IPv4 NAT, ເຊິ່ງສາມາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອເຮັດ Tunnel ສົ່ງແພັກເກັດ IPv6 ຜ່ານໂຄງສ້າງພື້ນຖານການກຳນົດເສັ້ນທາງ IPv4. %1$sຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງມີ%2$s ກົດໄຟວໍ IPv6 ນຳ ເພື່ອຄວບຄຸມ ແລະ ອະນຸຍາດຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ຖືກຫຸ້ມຫໍ່."

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_network.php:103
msgid "IPv4 address of Tunnel Peer"
msgstr "ທີ່ຢູ່ IPv4 ຂອງ Tunnel Peer"

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_network.php:110
msgid "Prefer IPv4 over IPv6"
msgstr "ໃຫ້ບຸລິມະສິດ IPv4 ກ່ອນ IPv6"

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_network.php:113
msgid "By default, if IPv6 is configured and a hostname resolves IPv6 and IPv4 addresses, IPv6 will be used. If this option is selected, IPv4 will be preferred over IPv6."
msgstr "ໂດຍປົກກະຕິ, ຖ້າຕັ້ງຄ່າ IPv6 ໄວ້ ແລະ ຊື່ໂຮສສາມາດແປເປັນທັງທີ່ຢູ່ IPv6 ແລະ IPv4, IPv6 ຈະຖືກນຳໃຊ້. ຖ້າເລືອກຕົວເລືອກນີ້, IPv4 ຈະຖືກນຳໃຊ້ກ່ອນ IPv6."

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_network.php:118
msgid "IPv6 DNS entry"
msgstr "ລາຍການ IPv6 DNS"

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_network.php:121
msgid "If a LAN interface's IPv6 configuration is set to Track, and the tracked interface loses connectivity, it can cause connections to this firewall that were established via hostname to fail. This can happen unintentionally when accessing the firewall by hostname, since by default both IPv4 and IPv6 entries are added to the system's DNS. Enabling this option prevents those IPv6 records from being created."
msgstr "ຖ້າການຕັ້ງຄ່າ IPv6 ຂອງອິນເຕີເຟສ LAN ຖືກຕັ້ງເປັນ Track, ແລະ ອິນເຕີເຟສທີ່ຖືກຕິດຕາມນັ້ນສູນເສຍການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່, ມັນອາດຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບໄຟວໍນີ້ຜ່ານຊື່ໂຮສລົ້ມເຫຼວ. ສິ່ງນີ້ອາດເກີດຂຶ້ນໂດຍບໍ່ໄດ້ຕັ້ງໃຈເມື່ອເຂົ້າເຖິງໄຟວໍດ້ວຍຊື່ໂຮສ, ເນື່ອງຈາກໂດຍປົກກະຕິແລ້ວທັງ IPv4 ແລະ IPv6 ຈະຖືກເພີ່ມເຂົ້າໃນ DNS ຂອງລະບົບ. ການເປີດໃຊ້ຕົວເລືອກນີ້ຈະປ້ອງກັນບໍ່ໃຫ້ມີການສ້າງບັນທຶກ IPv6 ເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນ."

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_network.php:130
msgid "Raw DUID: As stored in DUID file or seen in firewall logs"
msgstr "Raw DUID: ຕາມທີ່ເກັບໄວ້ໃນໄຟລ໌ DUID ຫຼື ທີ່ເຫັນໃນ firewall logs"

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_network.php:131
msgid "DUID-LLT: Based on Link-layer Address Plus Time"
msgstr "DUID-LLT: ອ້າງອີງຕາມທີ່ຢູ່ Link-layer ບວກກັບເວລາ"

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_network.php:132
msgid "DUID-EN: Assigned by Vendor based on Enterprise Number"
msgstr "DUID-EN: ກຳນົດໂດຍຜູ້ຜະລິດອ້າງອີງຕາມໝາຍເລກ Enterprise"

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_network.php:133
msgid "DUID-LL: Based on Link-layer Address"
msgstr "DUID-LL: ອ້າງອີງຕາມທີ່ຢູ່ Link-layer"

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_network.php:134
msgid "DUID-UUID: Based on Universally Unique Identifier"
msgstr "DUID-UUID: ອ້າງອີງຕາມ Universally Unique Identifier (UUID)"

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_network.php:128 src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_network.php:146
msgid "DHCP6 DUID"
msgstr "DHCP6 DUID"

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_network.php:136
#, php-format
msgid ""
"A DHCPv6 Unique Identifier (DUID) is used by the firewall when requesting an IPv6 address.%1$s%1$sBy default, the firewall automatically creates a dynamic DUID-LLT which is not saved in the firewall configuration. To ensure that the same DUID is retained by the firewall at all times, enter a DUID in this section. The new DUID will take effect after a reboot or when the WAN interface(s) are reconfigured by the firewall.%1$s%1$sIf the firewall is configured to use a RAM disk for /var, the best practice is to store a DUID here; otherwise, the DUID will change on each "
"reboot."
msgstr "DHCPv6 Unique Identifier (DUID) ຖືກນຳໃຊ້ໂດຍໄຟວໍເມື່ອມີການຮ້ອງຂໍທີ່ຢູ່ IPv6.%1$s%1$sໂດຍປົກກະຕິ, ໄຟວໍຈະສ້າງ DUID-LLT ແບບໄດນາມິກໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ ເຊິ່ງບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກບັນທຶກໄວ້ໃນການຕັ້ງຄ່າໄຟວໍ. ເພື່ອໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າໄຟວໍຈະໃຊ້ DUID ເດີມຕະຫຼອດເວລາ, ໃຫ້ປ້ອນ DUID ໃນສ່ວນນີ້. DUID ໃໝ່ຈະມີຜົນຫຼັງຈາກການເລີ່ມລະບົບໃໝ່ ຫຼື ເມື່ອອິນເຕີເຟສ WAN ຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າໃໝ່.%1$s%1$sຖ້າໄຟວໍຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າໃຫ້ໃຊ້ RAM disk ສຳລັບ /var, ວິທີທີ່ດີທີ່ສຸດແມ່ນໃຫ້ເກັບ DUID ໄວ້ບ່ອນນີ້; ບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, DUID ຈະປ່ຽນແປງທຸກຄັ້ງທີ່ເລີ່ມລະບົບໃໝ່."

