#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_network.php:222
msgid "Hardware Checksum Offloading"
msgstr "Hardware Checksum Offloading"

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_network.php:225
#, php-format
msgid "Checking this option will disable hardware checksum offloading.%1$sChecksum offloading is broken in some hardware, particularly some Realtek cards. Rarely, drivers may have problems with checksum offloading and some specific NICs. This will take effect after a machine reboot or re-configure of each interface."
msgstr "ການເລືອກຕົວເລືອກນີ້ຈະປິດການໃຊ້ງານ hardware checksum offloading.%1$sChecksum offloading ມີບັນຫາໃນຮາດແວບາງຊະນິດ, ໂດຍສະເພາະກາດ Realtek ບາງລຸ້ນ. ໃນບາງກໍລະນີທີ່ພົບໜ້ອຍ, ໄດຣເວີອາດມີບັນຫາກັບ checksum offloading ແລະ ກາດເຄືອຂ່າຍ (NIC) ບາງອັນ. ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະມີຜົນຫຼັງຈາກການເລີ່ມລະບົບໃໝ່ ຫຼື ການຕັ້ງຄ່າແຕ່ລະອິນເຕີເຟສໃໝ່."

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_network.php:233
msgid "Hardware TCP Segmentation Offloading"
msgstr "Hardware TCP Segmentation Offloading"

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_network.php:236
msgid "Checking this option will disable hardware TCP segmentation offloading (TSO, TSO4, TSO6). This offloading is broken in some hardware drivers, and may impact performance with some specific NICs. This will take effect after a machine reboot or re-configure of each interface."
msgstr "ການເລືອກຕົວເລືອກນີ້ຈະປິດການໃຊ້ງານ hardware TCP segmentation offloading (TSO, TSO4, TSO6). Offloading ນີ້ມີບັນຫາໃນໄດຣເວີຮາດແວບາງອັນ ແລະ ອາດສົ່ງຜົນກະທົບຕໍ່ປະສິດທິພາບຂອງກາດເຄືອຂ່າຍບາງລຸ້ນ. ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະມີຜົນຫຼັງຈາກການເລີ່ມລະບົບໃໝ່ ຫຼື ການຕັ້ງຄ່າແຕ່ລະອິນເຕີເຟສໃໝ່."

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_network.php:243
msgid "Hardware Large Receive Offloading"
msgstr "Hardware Large Receive Offloading"

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_network.php:246
msgid "Checking this option will disable hardware large receive offloading (LRO). This offloading is broken in some hardware drivers, and may impact performance with some specific NICs. This will take effect after a machine reboot or re-configure of each interface."
msgstr "ການເລືອກຕົວເລືອກນີ້ຈະປິດການໃຊ້ງານ hardware large receive offloading (LRO). Offloading ນີ້ມີບັນຫາໃນໄດຣເວີຮາດແວບາງອັນ ແລະ ອາດສົ່ງຜົນກະທົບຕໍ່ປະສິດທິພາບຂອງກາດເຄືອຂ່າຍບາງລຸ້ນ. ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະມີຜົນຫຼັງຈາກການເລີ່ມລະບົບໃໝ່ ຫຼື ການຕັ້ງຄ່າແຕ່ລະອິນເຕີເຟສໃໝ່."

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_network.php:253
msgid "hn ALTQ support"
msgstr "ການຮອງຮັບ hn ALTQ"

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_network.php:256
msgid "Checking this option will enable the ALTQ support for hn NICs. The ALTQ support disables the multiqueue API and may reduce the system capability to handle traffic. This will take effect after a machine reboot."
msgstr "ການເລືອກຕົວເລືອກນີ້ຈະເປີດໃຊ້ການຮອງຮັບ ALTQ ສຳລັບກາດເຄືອຂ່າຍ hn. ການຮອງຮັບ ALTQ ຈະປິດການໃຊ້ງານ multiqueue API ແລະ ອາດຫຼຸດຄວາມສາມາດຂອງລະບົບໃນການຈັດການຂໍ້ມູນ. ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະມີຜົນຫຼັງຈາກການເລີ່ມລະບົບໃໝ່."

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_network.php:262
msgid "ARP Handling"
msgstr "ການຈັດການ ARP"

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_network.php:265
msgid "This option will suppress ARP log messages when multiple interfaces reside on the same broadcast domain."
msgstr "ຕົວເລືອກນີ້ຈະຊ່ວຍຢຸດການສະແດງຂໍ້ຄວາມ ARP log ເມື່ອມີຫຼາຍອິນເຕີເຟສຢູ່ໃນ broadcast domain ດຽວກັນ."

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_network.php:270
msgid "Reset All States"
msgstr "ລ້າງສະຖານະທັງໝົດ (Reset All States)"

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_network.php:273
msgid "This option resets all states when a WAN IP Address changes instead of only states associated with the previous IP Address."
msgstr "ຕົວເລືອກນີ້ຈະລ້າງສະຖານະທັງໝົດເມື່ອທີ່ຢູ່ WAN IP ປ່ຽນແປງ ແທນທີ່ຈະລ້າງສະເພາະສະຖານະທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງກັບທີ່ຢູ່ IP ເດີມ."

