#: src/usr/local/www/services_pppoe_edit.php:391
msgid "If entered these servers will be given to all PPPoE clients, otherwise LAN DNS and one WAN DNS will go to all clients."
msgstr "ຖ້າປ້ອນຂໍ້ມູນເຫຼົ່ານີ້ ເຊີເວີເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຈະຖືກມອບໃຫ້ລູກຂ່າຍ PPPoE ທັງໝົດ, ບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນ LAN DNS ແລະ WAN DNS ຢ່າງລະໜຶ່ງອັນຈະຖືກສົ່ງໃຫ້ລູກຂ່າຍທັງໝົດ."

#: src/usr/local/www/services_pppoe_edit.php:398
