msgstr "ພອດຊີຣຽວ (serial ports) ທັງໝົດແມ່ນຖືກສະແດງຢູ່ໃນລາຍການ, ໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າເລືອກພອດທີ່ມີ GPS ຕໍ່ຢູ່. "

#: src/usr/local/www/services_ntpd_gps.php:425
#, php-format
msgid "A higher baud rate is generally only helpful if the GPS is sending too many sentences. It is recommended to configure the GPS to send only one sentence at a baud rate of 4800 or 9600.%1$sAutoset tries to find the correct baud rate of the GPS device and then saves the configuration.%1$sAlways Auto tries to find the correct baud rate of the GPS device every time NTPd is started."
msgstr "Baud rate ທີ່ສູງຂຶ້ນໂດຍທົ່ວໄປແລ້ວຈະມີປະໂຫຍດກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອ GPS ສົ່ງຂໍ້ມູນຫຼາຍເກີນໄປ. ແນະນຳໃຫ້ຕັ້ງຄ່າ GPS ໃຫ້ສົ່ງຂໍ້ມູນພຽງຊຸດດຽວທີ່ baud rate 4800 ຫຼື 9600.%1$sAutoset ຈະພະຍາຍາມຊອກຫາ baud rate ທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງຂອງອຸປະກອນ GPS ແລະ ບັນທຶກການຕັ້ງຄ່າ.%1$sAlways Auto ຈະພະຍາຍາມຊອກຫາ baud rate ທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງຂອງອຸປະກອນ GPS ທຸກຄັ້ງທີ່ເລີ່ມ NTPd."

#: src/usr/local/www/services_ntpd_gps.php:436
#, php-format
msgid "Before sending the initialization commands, check the GPS baud rate. If it is not correct try to find the correct baud rate automatically, send the initialization commands if the correct rate is found, and then set the baud rate to the configured speed.%1$sThis is useful if the GPS device resets back to a default rate on power loss or when changing the baud rate."
msgstr "ກ່ອນທີ່ຈະສົ່ງຄຳສັ່ງເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ໃຫ້ກວດສອບ GPS baud rate. ຖ້າບໍ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ ໃຫ້ພະຍາຍາມຊອກຫາ baud rate ທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ, ສົ່ງຄຳສັ່ງເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຖ້າພົບອັດຕາທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ, ແລ້ວຕັ້ງ baud rate ເປັນຄວາມໄວທີ່ຕັ້ງຄ່າໄວ້.%1$sສິ່ງນີ້ມີປະໂຫຍດຖ້າອຸປະກອນ GPS ກັບໄປເປັນຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນເມື່ອໄຟດັບ ຫຼື ເມື່ອມີການປ່ຽນແປງ baud rate."

#: src/usr/local/www/services_ntpd_gps.php:447
msgid "NMEA Sentences"
msgstr "NMEA Sentences"

#: src/usr/local/www/services_ntpd_gps.php:451
msgid "By default NTP will listen for all supported NMEA sentences. One or more sentences to listen for may be specified."
msgstr "ໂດຍປົກກະຕິ NTP ຈະຮັບຟັງທຸກ NMEA sentences ທີ່ຮອງຮັບ. ສາມາດລະບຸໜຶ່ງ ຫຼື ຫຼາຍ sentences ທີ່ຕ້ອງການຮັບຟັງໄດ້."

#: src/usr/local/www/services_ntpd_gps.php:462
msgid "Fudge Time 1"
msgstr "Fudge Time 1"

#: src/usr/local/www/services_ntpd_gps.php:465
msgid "Fudge time 1 is used to specify the GPS PPS signal offset (default: 0.0)."
msgstr "Fudge time 1 ຖືກໃຊ້ເພື່ອລະບຸຄ່າຊົດເຊີຍສັນຍານ GPS PPS (ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ: 0.0)."

#: src/usr/local/www/services_ntpd_gps.php:469
msgid "Fudge Time 2"
msgstr "Fudge Time 2"

#: src/usr/local/www/services_ntpd_gps.php:472
msgid "Fudge time 2 is used to specify the GPS time offset (default: 0.0)."
msgstr "Fudge time 2 ຖືກໃຊ້ເພື່ອລະບຸຄ່າຊົດເຊີຍເວລາ GPS (ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ: 0.0)."

#: src/usr/local/www/services_ntpd_gps.php:476
msgid "Stratum (0-16)"
msgstr "Stratum (0-16)"

#: src/usr/local/www/services_ntpd_gps.php:479
msgid "This may be used to change the GPS Clock stratum (default: 0). This may be useful to, for some reason, have ntpd prefer a different clock."
msgstr "ສິ່ງນີ້ອາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອປ່ຽນ stratum ຂອງໂມງ GPS (ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ: 0). ອາດມີປະໂຫຍດຖ້າຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ ntpd ເລືອກໃຊ້ໂມງອື່ນດ້ວຍເຫດຜົນບາງຢ່າງ."

#: src/usr/local/www/services_ntpd_gps.php:542
msgid "Enabling this will rapidly fill the log, but is useful for tuning Fudge time 2."
msgstr "ການເປີດໃຊ້ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ log ເຕັມໄວ, ແຕ່ມີປະໂຫຍດໃນການປັບແຕ່ງ Fudge time 2."

#: src/usr/local/www/services_ntpd_gps.php:549
msgid "Enable extended GPS status if GPGSV or GPGGA are explicitly enabled by GPS initialization commands."
msgstr "ເປີດໃຊ້ສະຖານະ GPS ເພີ່ມເຕີມຖ້າ GPGSV ຫຼື GPGGA ຖືກເປີດໃຊ້ໂດຍຄຳສັ່ງເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງ GPS."

#: src/usr/local/www/services_ntpd_gps.php:557
msgid "This may be used to change the GPS Clock ID (default: GPS)."
msgstr "ສິ່ງນີ້ອາດໃຊ້ເພື່ອປ່ຽນ Clock ID ຂອງ GPS (ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ: GPS)."

#: src/usr/local/www/services_ntpd_gps.php:570
msgid "GPS Initialization"
msgstr "ການເລີ່ມຕົ້ນລະບົບ GPS"

#: src/usr/local/www/services_ntpd_gps.php:578
msgid "Commands entered here will be sent to the GPS during initialization. Please read and understand the GPS documentation before making any changes here."
msgstr "ຄຳສັ່ງທີ່ປ້ອນຢູ່ນີ້ຈະຖືກສົ່ງໄປຫາ GPS ໃນລະຫວ່າງການເລີ່ມຕົ້ນລະບົບ. ກະລຸນາອ່ານ ແລະ ເຮັດຄວາມເຂົ້າໃຈເອກະສານຂອງ GPS ກ່ອນທີ່ຈະເຮັດການປ່ຽນແປງໃດໆ."

