#: src/usr/local/www/firewall_nat_out_edit.php:247
msgid "Only Round Robin pool options may be chosen when selecting an alias."
msgstr "ສາມາດເລືອກໄດ້ສະເພາະຕົວເລືອກ Round Robin pool ເທົ່ານັ້ນເມື່ອເລືອກ alias."

#: src/usr/local/www/firewall_nat_out_edit.php:256
