msgstr "ໃນກໍລະນີສ່ວນໃຫຍ່ ຕົວເລືອກນີ້ບໍ່ຈຳເປັນ."

#: src/usr/local/www/firewall_nat_out_edit.php:479
msgid "The interface on which traffic is matched as it exits the firewall. In most cases this is \"WAN\" or another externally-connected interface."
msgstr "ອິນເຕີເຟສທີ່ຂໍ້ມູນຈະຖືກກວດສອບເມື່ອອອກຈາກໄຟວໍ. ໃນກໍລະນີສ່ວນໃຫຍ່ແມ່ນ \"WAN\" ຫຼື ອິນເຕີເຟສອື່ນໆທີ່ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ພາຍນອກ."

#: src/usr/local/www/firewall_nat_out_edit.php:499
msgid "Choose which protocol this rule should match. In most cases \"any\" is specified."
msgstr "ເລືອກໂປຣໂຕຄໍທີ່ກົດນີ້ຄວນກວດສອບ. ໃນກໍລະນີສ່ວນໃຫຍ່ແມ່ນລະບຸເປັນ \"any\"."

#: src/usr/local/www/firewall_nat_out_edit.php:501
msgid "*Source"
msgstr "*ຕົ້ນທາງ (Source)"

#: src/usr/local/www/firewall_nat_out_edit.php:515
msgid "Source network for the outbound NAT mapping."
msgstr "ເຄືອຂ່າຍຕົ້ນທາງສຳລັບການຈັບຄູ່ NAT ຂາອອກ."

