msgid "*Address"
msgstr "*ທີ່ຢູ່ (Address)"

#: src/usr/local/www/firewall_nat_out_edit.php:568
#, php-format
msgid "Connections matching this rule will be mapped to the specified %1$sAddress%2$s.%3$sThe %1$sAddress%2$s can be an Interface, a Host-type Alias, or a %4$sVirtual IP%5$s address."
msgstr "ການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ທີ່ກົງກັບກົດນີ້ຈະຖືກຈັບຄູ່ກັບ %1$sທີ່ຢູ່%2$s ທີ່ລະບຸ.%3$s %1$sທີ່ຢູ່%2$s ສາມາດເປັນອິນເຕີເຟສ, Host Alias, ຫຼື ທີ່ຢູ່ %4$sVirtual IP%5$s."

#: src/usr/local/www/firewall_nat_out_edit.php:574
msgid "Other subnet"
msgstr "Subnet ອື່ນໆ"

#: src/usr/local/www/firewall_nat_out_edit.php:577
#, php-format
msgid "This subnet must be routed to the firewall or each address in the subnet must be defined in one or more %1$sVirtual IP%2$s addresses."
msgstr "Subnet ນີ້ຕ້ອງຖືກກຳນົດເສັ້ນທາງມາຫາໄຟວໍ ຫຼື ແຕ່ລະທີ່ຢູ່ພາຍໃນ subnet ຕ້ອງຖືກກຳນົດໃນທີ່ຢູ່ %1$sVirtual IP%2$s ຢ່າງໜ້ອຍໜຶ່ງອັນ."

#: src/usr/local/www/firewall_nat_out_edit.php:586
msgid "Round Robin"
msgstr "Round Robin"

#: src/usr/local/www/firewall_nat_out_edit.php:587
msgid "Round Robin with Sticky Address"
msgstr "Round Robin ແບບຈື່ທີ່ຢູ່ (Sticky Address)"

#: src/usr/local/www/firewall_nat_out_edit.php:588
msgid "Random"
msgstr "ສຸ່ມ (Random)"

#: src/usr/local/www/firewall_nat_out_edit.php:589
msgid "Random with Sticky Address"
msgstr "ສຸ່ມແບບຈື່ທີ່ຢູ່ (Sticky Address)"

#: src/usr/local/www/firewall_nat_out_edit.php:590
msgid "Source hash"
msgstr "Source hash"

#: src/usr/local/www/firewall_nat_out_edit.php:591
msgid "Bit mask"
msgstr "Bit mask"

#: src/usr/local/www/firewall_nat_out_edit.php:582
msgid "Pool options"
msgstr "ຕົວເລືອກ Pool"

#: src/usr/local/www/firewall_nat_out_edit.php:594
msgid "Only Round Robin types work with Host Aliases. Any type can be used with a Subnet."
msgstr "ສະເພາະປະເພດ Round Robin ເທົ່ານັ້ນທີ່ໃຊ້ໄດ້ກັບ Host Aliases. ແຕ່ຖ້າເປັນ Subnet ສາມາດໃຊ້ປະເພດໃດກໍໄດ້."

#: src/usr/local/www/firewall_nat_out_edit.php:596
msgid "Round Robin: Loops through the translation addresses."
msgstr "Round Robin: ວົນຮອບໄປຕາມລາຍການທີ່ຢູ່ແປງ."

#: src/usr/local/www/firewall_nat_out_edit.php:597
msgid "Random: Selects an address from the translation address pool at random."
msgstr "Random: ສຸ່ມເລືອກທີ່ຢູ່ຈາກ pool ຂອງທີ່ຢູ່ແປງ."

#: src/usr/local/www/firewall_nat_out_edit.php:598
msgid "Source Hash: Uses a hash of the source address to determine the translation address, ensuring that the redirection address is always the same for a given source."
msgstr "Source Hash: ໃຊ້ hash ຂອງທີ່ຢູ່ຕົ້ນທາງເພື່ອລະບຸທີ່ຢູ່ແປງ, ເພື່ອໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າທີ່ຢູ່ປາຍທາງຈະຄືເກົ່າສະເໝີສຳລັບຕົ້ນທາງເດີມ."

#: src/usr/local/www/firewall_nat_out_edit.php:599
msgid "Bitmask: Applies the subnet mask and keeps the last portion identical; 10.0.1.50 -&gt; x.x.x.50."
msgstr "Bitmask: ນຳໃຊ້ subnet mask ແລະ ເກັບສ່ວນທ້າຍໄວ້ຄືເກົ່າ; 10.0.1.50 -&gt; x.x.x.50."

#: src/usr/local/www/firewall_nat_out_edit.php:600
msgid "Sticky Address: The Sticky Address option can be used with the Random and Round Robin pool types to ensure that a particular source address is always mapped to the same translation address."
msgstr "Sticky Address: ຕົວເລືອກ Sticky Address ສາມາດໃຊ້ກັບ pool ປະເພດ Random ແລະ Round Robin ເພື່ອໃຫ້ແນ່ໃຈວ່າທີ່ຢູ່ຕົ້ນທາງໃດໜຶ່ງຈະຖືກຈັບຄູ່ກັບທີ່ຢູ່ແປງເດີມສະເໝີ."

#: src/usr/local/www/firewall_nat_out_edit.php:605
msgid "Source Hash Key"
msgstr "Source Hash Key"

#: src/usr/local/www/firewall_nat_out_edit.php:608
msgid "The key that is fed to the hashing algorithm in hex format, preceeded by \"0x\", or any string. A non-hex string is hashed using md5 to a hexadecimal key. Defaults to a randomly generated value."
msgstr "ຄີທີ່ຈະສົ່ງເຂົ້າ hashing algorithm ໃນຮູບແບບ hex ເຊິ່ງຂຶ້ນຕົ້ນດ້ວຍ \"0x\", ຫຼື ຂໍ້ຄວາມໃດກໍໄດ້. ຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ບໍ່ແມ່ນ hex ຈະຖືກ hash ດ້ວຍ md5 ໃຫ້ເປັນ hex key. ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນການສຸ່ມຄ່າໃໝ່."

#: src/usr/local/www/firewall_nat_out_edit.php:618
#, php-format
msgid "Enter the external source %1$sPort or Range%2$s used for remapping the original source port on connections matching the rule. %3$sPort ranges are a low port and high port number separated by \":\".%4$sLeave blank when %1$sStatic Port%2$s is checked."
msgstr "ປ້ອນ %1$sພອດ ຫຼື ຊ່ວງພອດ%2$s ຕົ້ນທາງພາຍນອກທີ່ໃຊ້ສຳລັບການປ່ຽນພອດຕົ້ນທາງເດີມສຳລັບການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ທີ່ກົງກັບກົດ. %3$sຊ່ວງພອດແມ່ນໃຊ້ໝາຍເລກພອດຕ່ຳຫາສູງແຍກກັນດ້ວຍ \":\".%4$sປະວ່າງໄວ້ເມື່ອເລືອກ %1$sStatic Port%2$s."

#: src/usr/local/www/firewall_nat_out_edit.php:633
msgid "Misc"
msgstr "ອື່ນໆ (Misc)"

#: src/usr/local/www/firewall_nat_out_edit.php:641
msgid "Prevents the rule on Master from automatically syncing to other CARP members. This does NOT prevent the rule from being overwritten on Slave."
msgstr "ປ້ອງກັນບໍ່ໃຫ້ກົດໃນເຄື່ອງຫຼັກ (Master) ຊິງຄ໌ຂໍ້ມູນໄປຫາສະມາຊິກ CARP ອື່ນໆໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ. ສິ່ງນີ້ບໍ່ໄດ້ປ້ອງກັນກົດຈາກການຖືກຂຽນທັບໃນເຄື່ອງຮອງ (Slave)."

