msgstr "ເກີດຂໍ້ຜິດພາດໃນການຕໍ່ອາຍຸ"

#: src/usr/local/www/system_certmanager_renew.php:91 src/usr/local/www/system_certmanager_renew.php:104
msgid "Renew or Reissue"
msgstr "ຕໍ່ອາຍຸ ຫຼື ອອກໃຫ້ໃໝ່ (Renew or Reissue)"

#: src/usr/local/www/system_certmanager_renew.php:123
msgid "Renewing or reissuing a CA or certificate will replace the old entry. The old entry will be lost, and cannot be revoked after it has been replaced. Daemons known to be using this entry or one of its descendents will be restarted after the entry is replaced."
msgstr "ການຕໍ່ອາຍຸ ຫຼື ການອອກ CA ຫຼື ໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ (Certificate) ໃໝ່ຈະເປັນການຂຽນທັບລາຍການເກົ່າ. ລາຍການເກົ່າຈະສູນຫາຍໄປ ແລະ ບໍ່ສາມາດຍົກເລີກ (revoke) ໄດ້ຫຼັງຈາກຖືກປ່ຽນແທນ. ບໍລິການ (Daemons) ທີ່ກຳລັງໃຊ້ລາຍການນີ້ ຫຼື ລາຍການທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງຈະຖືກເລີ່ມລະບົບໃໝ່ຫຼັງຈາກປ່ຽນລາຍການແລ້ວ."

#: src/usr/local/www/system_certmanager_renew.php:131
msgid "Renew or Reissue: "
msgstr "ຕໍ່ອາຍຸ ຫຼື ອອກໃຫ້ໃໝ່: "

#: src/usr/local/www/system_certmanager_renew.php:145
msgid "Subject Key ID"
msgstr "Subject Key ID"

#: src/usr/local/www/system_certmanager_renew.php:159
msgid "Issued By"
msgstr "ອອກໃຫ້ໂດຍ"

#: src/usr/local/www/system_certmanager_renew.php:166
msgid "Reuse Key"
msgstr "ໃຊ້ຄີເດີມ (Reuse Key)"

#: src/usr/local/www/system_certmanager_renew.php:169
msgid "Set this option to retain the existing keys when reissuing. Uncheck to generate a new key."
msgstr "ເລືອກຕົວເລືອກນີ້ເພື່ອເກັບຄີເດີມໄວ້ເມື່ອມີການອອກໃໝ່. ຖ້າບໍ່ເລືອກຈະເປັນການສ້າງຄີໃໝ່."

#: src/usr/local/www/system_certmanager_renew.php:173
msgid "Strict Security"
msgstr "ຄວາມປອດໄພເຂັ້ມງວດ (Strict Security)"

#: src/usr/local/www/system_certmanager_renew.php:176
msgid "Set this option to enforce stricter security requirements, which may alter certain certificate properties such as the digest, key length, and lifetime. Note that this will override the value of Reuse Key if the old key does not meet the stricter requirements."
msgstr "ເລືອກຕົວເລືອກນີ້ເພື່ອບັງຄັບໃຊ້ຂໍ້ກຳນົດຄວາມປອດໄພທີ່ເຂັ້ມງວດຂຶ້ນ, ເຊິ່ງອາດຈະປ່ຽນແປງຄຸນສົມບັດບາງຢ່າງຂອງໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ ເຊັ່ນ digest, ຄວາມຍາວຂອງຄີ ແລະ ອາຍຸການໃຊ້ງານ. ໝາຍເຫດວ່າສິ່ງນີ້ຈະຂຽນທັບຄ່າຂອງ Reuse Key ຖ້າຄີເດີມບໍ່ເປັນໄປຕາມຂໍ້ກຳນົດທີ່ເຂັ້ມງວດ."

#: src/usr/local/www/system_certmanager_renew.php:197
msgid "Renew/Reissue"
msgstr "ຕໍ່ອາຍຸ/ອອກໃຫ້ໃໝ່"

#: src/usr/local/www/system_certmanager_renew.php:205
msgid "Certificate Properties vs Strict Security"
msgstr "ຄຸນສົມບັດໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ ທຽບກັບ ຄວາມປອດໄພເຂັ້ມງວດ"

#: src/usr/local/www/system_certmanager_renew.php:209
msgid "If Strict Security is checked, weak certificate properties will be replaced as necessary."
msgstr "ຖ້າເລືອກຄວາມປອດໄພເຂັ້ມງວດ (Strict Security), ຄຸນສົມບັດຂອງໃບຢັ້ງຢືນທີ່ອ່ອນແອຈະຖືກປ່ຽນແທນຕາມຄວາມຈຳເປັນ."

#: src/usr/local/www/system_certmanager_renew.php:210
msgid "This table lists the specific changes necessary to meet strict security requirements."
msgstr "ຕາຕະລາງນີ້ສະແດງລາຍການການປ່ຽນແປງທີ່ຈຳເປັນເພື່ອໃຫ້ເປັນໄປຕາມຂໍ້ກຳນົດຄວາມປອດໄພທີ່ເຂັ້ມງວດ."

#: src/usr/local/www/system_certmanager_renew.php:218
msgid "Property"
msgstr "ຄຸນສົມບັດ"

#: src/usr/local/www/system_certmanager_renew.php:219
