msgstr "ວິທີການກວດສອບສິດ (Authentication) ບໍ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ."

#: src/usr/local/www/services_captiveportal.php:214
msgid "Certificate must be specified for HTTPS login."
msgstr "ຕ້ອງລະບຸໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ (Certificate) ສຳລັບການເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບແບບ HTTPS."

#: src/usr/local/www/services_captiveportal.php:217
msgid "The HTTPS server name must be specified for HTTPS login."
msgstr "ຕ້ອງລະບຸຊື່ເຊີເວີ HTTPS ສຳລັບການເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບແບບ HTTPS."

#: src/usr/local/www/services_captiveportal.php:224
msgid "The timeout must be at least 1 minute."
msgstr "ເວລາກຳນົດ (timeout) ຕ້ອງມີຢ່າງໜ້ອຍ 1 ນາທີ."

#: src/usr/local/www/services_captiveportal.php:240
msgid "Hard timeout must be less than or equal to the Default lease time set on DHCP Server"
msgstr "Hard timeout ຕ້ອງໜ້ອຍກວ່າ ຫຼື ເທົ່າກັບເວລາການເຊົ່າ IP ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ (Default lease time) ທີ່ຕັ້ງໄວ້ໃນ DHCP Server"

#: src/usr/local/www/services_captiveportal.php:247
msgid "The idle timeout must be at least 1 minute."
msgstr "Idle timeout ຕ້ອງມີຢ່າງໜ້ອຍ 1 ນາທີ."

#: src/usr/local/www/services_captiveportal.php:251
msgid "The traffic quota must be at least 1 megabyte."
msgstr "ໂຄຕ້າການຮັບສົ່ງຂໍ້ມູນ (traffic quota) ຕ້ອງມີຢ່າງໜ້ອຍ 1 megabyte."

#: src/usr/local/www/services_captiveportal.php:255
msgid "The pass-through credit count must be a number or left blank."
msgstr "ຈຳນວນ pass-through credit ຕ້ອງເປັນຕົວເລກ ຫຼື ປະວ່າງໄວ້."

#: src/usr/local/www/services_captiveportal.php:258
msgid "The waiting period to restore pass-through credits must be above 0 hours."
msgstr "ໄລຍະເວລາລໍຖ້າເພື່ອຄືນ pass-through credits ຕ້ອງຫຼາຍກວ່າ 0 ຊົ່ວໂມງ."

#: src/usr/local/www/services_captiveportal.php:263
msgid "The maximum number of concurrent connections per client IP address may not be larger than the global maximum."
msgstr "ຈຳນວນການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ພ້ອມກັນສູງສຸດຕໍ່ໜຶ່ງ IP ຂອງລູກຂ່າຍ ຕ້ອງບໍ່ເກີນຄ່າສູງສຸດລວມ (global maximum)."

#: src/usr/local/www/services_captiveportal.php:268
msgid "You need to select at least one authentication server."
msgstr "ທ່ານຕ້ອງເລືອກເຊີເວີກວດສອບສິດຢ່າງໜ້ອຍໜຶ່ງອັນ."

#: src/usr/local/www/services_captiveportal.php:280
msgid "RADIUS MAC Authentication can only be performed on a RADIUS server."
msgstr "ການກວດສອບສິດ RADIUS MAC ສາມາດເຮັດໄດ້ໃນ RADIUS server ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

#: src/usr/local/www/services_captiveportal.php:285
msgid "RADIUS MAC Authentication cannot be used if MAC filtering is disabled"
msgstr "ບໍ່ສາມາດໃຊ້ການກວດສອບສິດ RADIUS MAC ໄດ້ ຖ້າຫາກປິດການກອງ MAC (MAC filtering)."

#: src/usr/local/www/services_captiveportal.php:291
msgid "You need to select an option for Concurrent user logins."
msgstr "ທ່ານຕ້ອງເລືອກຕົວເລືອກສຳລັບການເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບຂອງຜູ້ໃຊ້ພ້ອມກັນ (Concurrent user logins)."

#: src/usr/local/www/services_captiveportal.php:295
msgid "You need to select at least one accounting server."
msgstr "ທ່ານຕ້ອງເລືອກເຊີເວີ accounting ຢ່າງໜ້ອຍໜຶ່ງອັນ."

#: src/usr/local/www/services_captiveportal.php:298
msgid "You need to select an option for Accounting Updates !"
msgstr "ທ່ານຕ້ອງເລືອກຕົວເລືອກສຳລັບການອັບເດດ Accounting !"

#: src/usr/local/www/services_captiveportal.php:301
msgid "The NAS-Identifier must be 3-253 characters long and should only contain ASCII characters."
msgstr "NAS-Identifier ຕ້ອງມີຄວາມຍາວ 3-253 ຕົວອັກສອນ ແລະ ຄວນປະກອບມີສະເພາະຕົວອັກສອນ ASCII ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

#: src/usr/local/www/services_captiveportal.php:305
msgid "Unsupported logo image type."
msgstr "ບໍ່ຮອງຮັບປະເພດໄຟລ໌ຮູບພາບໂລໂກ້ນີ້."

#: src/usr/local/www/services_captiveportal.php:309
msgid "Unsupported background image type."
msgstr "ບໍ່ຮອງຮັບປະເພດໄຟລ໌ຮູບພາບພື້ນຫຼັງນີ້."

#: src/usr/local/www/services_captiveportal.php:534
msgid "Captive Portal Configuration"
msgstr "ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ Captive Portal"

#: src/usr/local/www/services_captiveportal.php:556
msgid "Select the interface(s) to enable for captive portal."
msgstr "ເລືອກອິນເຕີເຟສທີ່ຈະເປີດໃຊ້ງານ captive portal."

#: src/usr/local/www/services_captiveportal.php:560
msgid "Maximum concurrent connections"
msgstr "ຈຳນວນການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ພ້ອມກັນສູງສຸດ"

#: src/usr/local/www/services_captiveportal.php:564
msgid "Limits the number of concurrent connections to the captive portal HTTP(S) server. This does not set how many users can be logged in to the captive portal, but rather how many connections a single IP can establish to the portal web server."
msgstr "ຈຳກັດຈຳນວນການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ພ້ອມກັນກັບເຊີເວີ HTTP(S) ຂອງ captive portal. ສິ່ງນີ້ບໍ່ໄດ້ກຳນົດຈຳນວນຜູ້ໃຊ້ທີ່ສາມາດເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບໄດ້, ແຕ່ເປັນການກຳນົດວ່າໜຶ່ງ IP ສາມາດສ້າງການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບເວັບເຊີເວີຂອງໂພທໍໄດ້ເທົ່າໃດ."

#: src/usr/local/www/services_captiveportal.php:569
msgid "Idle timeout (Minutes)"
msgstr "Idle timeout (ນາທີ)"

#: src/usr/local/www/services_captiveportal.php:572
msgid "Clients will be disconnected after this amount of inactivity. They may log in again immediately, though. Leave this field blank for no idle timeout."
msgstr "ລູກຂ່າຍຈະຖືກຕັດການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຫຼັງຈາກບໍ່ມີການເຄື່ອນໄຫວຕາມເວລາທີ່ກຳນົດ. ແນວໃດກໍຕາມ, ພວກເຂົາສາມາດເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບໃໝ່ໄດ້ທັນທີ. ປະວ່າງໄວ້ຖ້າບໍ່ຕ້ອງການກຳນົດ idle timeout."

#: src/usr/local/www/services_captiveportal.php:576
msgid "Hard timeout (Minutes)"
msgstr "Hard timeout (ນາທີ)"

#: src/usr/local/www/services_captiveportal.php:579
msgid "Clients will be disconnected after this amount of time, regardless of activity. They may log in again immediately, though. Leave this field blank for no hard timeout (not recommended unless an idle timeout is set)."
msgstr "ລູກຂ່າຍຈະຖືກຕັດການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຫຼັງຈາກຄົບກຳນົດເວລານີ້ ໂດຍບໍ່ສົນໃຈວ່າຈະມີການເຄື່ອນໄຫວຫຼືບໍ່. ພວກເຂົາສາມາດເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບໃໝ່ໄດ້ທັນທີ. ປະວ່າງໄວ້ຖ້າບໍ່ຕ້ອງການກຳນົດ hard timeout (ບໍ່ແນະນຳ ຍົກເວັ້ນແຕ່ຈະມີການຕັ້ງ idle timeout ໄວ້)."

#: src/usr/local/www/services_captiveportal.php:584
msgid "Traffic quota (Megabytes)"
msgstr "ໂຄຕ້າການຮັບສົ່ງຂໍ້ມູນ (ເມກາໄບ)"

#: src/usr/local/www/services_captiveportal.php:587
msgid "Clients will be disconnected after exceeding this amount of traffic, inclusive of both downloads and uploads. They may log in again immediately, though. Leave this field blank for no traffic quota."
msgstr "ລູກຂ່າຍຈະຖືກຕັດການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຫຼັງຈາກໃຊ້ຂໍ້ມູນເກີນກຳນົດນີ້, ເຊິ່ງລວມທັງການດາວໂຫຼດ ແລະ ອັບໂຫຼດ. ແນວໃດກໍຕາມ, ເຂົາເຈົ້າສາມາດລົງຊື່ເຂົ້າໃຊ້ຄືນໃໝ່ໄດ້ທັນທີ. ປ່ອຍຫວ່າງໄວ້ຖ້າບໍ່ຕ້ອງການກຳນົດໂຄຕ້າ."

#: src/usr/local/www/services_captiveportal.php:592
msgid "Pass-through credits per MAC address."
msgstr "ເຄຣດິດການຜ່ານ (Pass-through) ຕໍ່ໜຶ່ງທີ່ຢູ່ MAC."

#: src/usr/local/www/services_captiveportal.php:595
msgid "Allows passing through the captive portal without authentication a limited number of times per MAC address. Once used up, the client can only log in with valid credentials until the waiting period specified below has expired. Recommended to set a hard timeout and/or idle timeout when using this for it to be effective."
msgstr "ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ຜ່ານ captive portal ໂດຍບໍ່ຕ້ອງຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນຕາມຈຳນວນຄັ້ງທີ່ກຳນົດຕໍ່ທີ່ຢູ່ MAC. ເມື່ອໃຊ້ໝົດແລ້ວ, ລູກຂ່າຍຈະຕ້ອງລົງຊື່ເຂົ້າໃຊ້ດ້ວຍຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງເທົ່ານັ້ນ ຈົນກວ່າໄລຍະເວລາລໍຖ້າທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້ຂ້າງລຸ່ມຈະໝົດໄປ. ແນະນຳໃຫ້ຕັ້ງຄ່າ hard timeout ແລະ/ຫຼື idle timeout ເພື່ອໃຫ້ຟັງຊັນນີ້ມີປະສິດທິພາບ."

#: src/usr/local/www/services_captiveportal.php:601
msgid "Waiting period to restore pass-through credits. (Hours)"
msgstr "ໄລຍະເວລາລໍຖ້າເພື່ອຄືນເຄຣດິດການຜ່ານ. (ຊົ່ວໂມງ)"

#: src/usr/local/www/services_captiveportal.php:604
msgid "Clients will have their available pass-through credits restored to the original count after this amount of time since using the first one. This must be above 0 hours if pass-through credits are enabled."
msgstr "ລູກຂ່າຍຈະໄດ້ຮັບເຄຣດິດການຜ່ານຄືນໃໝ່ຕາມຈຳນວນເດີມ ຫຼັງຈາກຜ່ານໄລຍະເວລານີ້ນັບຕັ້ງແຕ່ການໃຊ້ເຄຣດິດທຳອິດ. ຄ່ານີ້ຕ້ອງຫຼາຍກວ່າ 0 ຊົ່ວໂມງ ຫາກເປີດໃຊ້ເຄຣດິດການຜ່ານ."

#: src/usr/local/www/services_captiveportal.php:609
msgid "Reset waiting period"
msgstr "ຣີເຊັດໄລຍະເວລາລໍຖ້າ"

#: src/usr/local/www/services_captiveportal.php:612
msgid "If enabled, the waiting period is reset to the original duration if access is attempted when all pass-through credits have already been exhausted."
msgstr "ຫາກເປີດໃຊ້, ໄລຍະເວລາລໍຖ້າຈະຖືກຣີເຊັດເປັນຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ ຫາກມີການພະຍາຍາມເຂົ້າໃຊ້ໃນຂະນະທີ່ເຄຣດິດການຜ່ານທັງໝົດຖືກໃຊ້ໝົດແລ້ວ."

#: src/usr/local/www/services_captiveportal.php:616
msgid "Logout popup window"
msgstr "ໜ້າຕ່າງປັອບອັບສຳລັບອອກຈາກລະບົບ"

#: src/usr/local/www/services_captiveportal.php:619
msgid "If enabled, a popup window will appear when clients are allowed through the captive portal. This allows clients to explicitly disconnect themselves before the idle or hard timeout occurs."
msgstr "ຫາກເປີດໃຊ້, ໜ້າຕ່າງປັອບອັບຈະສະແດງຂຶ້ນເມື່ອລູກຂ່າຍຜ່ານ captive portal. ສິ່ງນີ້ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ລູກຂ່າຍສາມາດຕັດການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ດ້ວຍຕົນເອງໄດ້ ກ່ອນທີ່ຈະຮອດກຳນົດ idle ຫຼື hard timeout."

#: src/usr/local/www/services_captiveportal.php:624
msgid "Pre-authentication redirect URL"
msgstr "URL ສຳລັບສົ່ງຕໍ່ກ່ອນການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນ"

#: src/usr/local/www/services_captiveportal.php:627
msgid "Set a default redirection URL. Visitors will be redirected to this URL after authentication only if the captive portal doesn't know where to redirect them. This field will be accessible through $PORTAL_REDIRURL$ variable in captiveportal's HTML pages."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າ URL ສຳລັບສົ່ງຕໍ່ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ. ຜູ້ເຂົ້າຊົມຈະຖືກສົ່ງໄປຫາ URL ນີ້ຫຼັງຈາກຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນແລ້ວ ໃນກໍລະນີທີ່ captive portal ບໍ່ຮູ້ວ່າຈະສົ່ງພວກເຂົາໄປໃສ. ຊ່ອງນີ້ສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງໄດ້ຜ່ານຕົວປ່ຽນ $PORTAL_REDIRURL$ ໃນໜ້າ HTML ຂອງ captive portal."

#: src/usr/local/www/services_captiveportal.php:631
msgid "After authentication Redirection URL"
msgstr "URL ສຳລັບສົ່ງຕໍ່ຫຼັງການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນ"

#: src/usr/local/www/services_captiveportal.php:634
msgid "Set a forced redirection URL. Clients will be redirected to this URL instead of the one they initially tried to access after they've authenticated."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າ URL ສຳລັບບັງຄັບການສົ່ງຕໍ່. ລູກຂ່າຍຈະຖືກສົ່ງໄປຫາ URL ນີ້ແທນທີ່ URL ທີ່ພວກເຂົາພະຍາຍາມເຂົ້າເຖິງໃນຕອນທຳອິດ ຫຼັງຈາກທີ່ຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນແລ້ວ."

#: src/usr/local/www/services_captiveportal.php:638
msgid "Blocked MAC address redirect URL"
msgstr "URL ສຳລັບສົ່ງຕໍ່ທີ່ຢູ່ MAC ທີ່ຖືກບລັອກ"

#: src/usr/local/www/services_captiveportal.php:641
msgid "Blocked MAC addresses will be redirected to this URL when attempting access."
msgstr "ທີ່ຢູ່ MAC ທີ່ຖືກບລັອກຈະຖືກສົ່ງຕໍ່ໄປຫາ URL ນີ້ເມື່ອພະຍາຍາມເຂົ້າໃຊ້ງານ."

#: src/usr/local/www/services_captiveportal.php:646 src/usr/local/www/services_captiveportal.php:653
msgid "Preserve users database"
msgstr "ຮັກສາຖານຂໍ້ມູນຜູ້ໃຊ້"

#: src/usr/local/www/services_captiveportal.php:649
#, php-format
msgid "If enabled, connected users won't be disconnected during a %s reboot. This setting is not editable because High Availability is enabled."
msgstr "ຫາກເປີດໃຊ້, ຜູ້ໃຊ້ທີ່ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຢູ່ຈະບໍ່ຖືກຕັດການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ໃນລະຫວ່າງການຣີບູດ %s. ການຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້ບໍ່ສາມາດແກ້ໄຂໄດ້ເນື່ອງຈາກເປີດໃຊ້ High Availability ຢູ່."

#: src/usr/local/www/services_captiveportal.php:656
#, php-format
msgid "If enabled, connected users won't be disconnected during a %s reboot."
msgstr "ຫາກເປີດໃຊ້, ຜູ້ໃຊ້ທີ່ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຢູ່ຈະບໍ່ຖືກຕັດການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ໃນລະຫວ່າງການຣີບູດ %s."

#: src/usr/local/www/services_captiveportal.php:661
msgid "Concurrent user logins"
msgstr "ການລົງຊື່ເຂົ້າໃຊ້ພ້ອມກັນ"

#: src/usr/local/www/services_captiveportal.php:664
#, php-format
msgid "Disabled: Do not allow concurrent logins per username or voucher.%1$sMultiple: No restrictions to the number of logins per username or voucher will be applied.%1$sLast login: Only the most recent login per username or voucher will be granted. Previous logins will be disconnected.%1$sFirst login: Only the first login per username or voucher will be granted. Further login attempts using the username or voucher will not be possible while an initial user is already active."
msgstr "ປິດໃຊ້ງານ: ບໍ່ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ລົງຊື່ເຂົ້າໃຊ້ພ້ອມກັນຕໍ່ຊື່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ ຫຼື ບັດເຕີມ (voucher). %1$sຫຼາຍຄັ້ງ: ບໍ່ຈຳກັດຈຳນວນການລົງຊື່ເຂົ້າໃຊ້ຕໍ່ຊື່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ ຫຼື ບັດເຕີມ. %1$sການເຂົ້າໃຊ້ຫຼ້າສຸດ: ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ສະເພາະການເຂົ້າໃຊ້ຫຼ້າສຸດຕໍ່ຊື່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ ຫຼື ບັດເຕີມເທົ່ານັ້ນ, ການເຂົ້າໃຊ້ກ່ອນໜ້ານີ້ຈະຖືກຕັດການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່. %1$sການເຂົ້າໃຊ້ທຳອິດ: ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ສະເພາະການເຂົ້າໃຊ້ຄັ້ງທຳອິດເທົ່ານັ້ນ, ຈະບໍ່ສາມາດເຂົ້າໃຊ້ເພີ່ມໄດ້ຫາກຜູ້ໃຊ້ທຳອິດຍັງເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຢູ່."

#: src/usr/local/www/services_captiveportal.php:673
msgid "MAC filtering"
msgstr "ການກອງທີ່ຢູ່ MAC"

#: src/usr/local/www/services_captiveportal.php:676
#, php-format
msgid "If enabled no attempts will be made to ensure that the MAC address of clients stays the same while they are logged in. This is required when the MAC address of the client cannot be determined (usually because there are routers between %s and the clients). If this is enabled, RADIUS MAC authentication cannot be used."
msgstr "ຫາກເປີດໃຊ້ ຈະບໍ່ມີການກວດສອບວ່າທີ່ຢູ່ MAC ຂອງລູກຂ່າຍຍັງຄືເກົ່າຫຼືບໍ່ໃນຂະນະທີ່ລົງຊື່ເຂົ້າໃຊ້ຢູ່. ສິ່ງນີ້ຈຳເປັນເມື່ອບໍ່ສາມາດລະບຸທີ່ຢູ່ MAC ຂອງລູກຂ່າຍໄດ້ (ສ່ວນຫຼາຍແມ່ນຍ້ອນມີຣາວເຕີຂັ້ນລະຫວ່າງ %s ແລະ ລູກຂ່າຍ). ຫາກເປີດໃຊ້ສິ່ງນີ້, ຈະບໍ່ສາມາດໃຊ້ການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນ RADIUS MAC ໄດ້."

#: src/usr/local/www/services_captiveportal.php:682
msgid "Pass-through MAC Auto Entry"
msgstr "ການເພີ່ມລາຍການ MAC ຜ່ານອັດຕະໂນມັດ"

#: src/usr/local/www/services_captiveportal.php:685
#, php-format
msgid "When enabled, a MAC passthrough entry is automatically added after the user has successfully authenticated. Users of that MAC address will never have to authenticate again. To remove the passthrough MAC entry either log in and remove it manually from the %1$sMAC tab%2$s or send a POST from another system. If this is enabled, the logout window will not be shown."
msgstr "ເມື່ອເປີດໃຊ້, ລາຍການ MAC passthrough ຈະຖືກເພີ່ມໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດຫຼັງຈາກຜູ້ໃຊ້ຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນສຳເລັດ. ຜູ້ໃຊ້ທີ່ໃຊ້ MAC ນັ້ນຈະບໍ່ຕ້ອງຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນອີກ. ຫາກຕ້ອງການລຶບລາຍການອອກ ສາມາດລຶບດ້ວຍຕົນເອງໄດ້ທີ່ %1$sແຖບ MAC%2$s ຫຼື ສົ່ງຄ່າ POST ຈາກລະບົບອື່ນ. ຫາກເປີດໃຊ້ສິ່ງນີ້, ໜ້າຕ່າງອອກຈາກລະບົບຈະບໍ່ສະແດງຂຶ້ນ."

#: src/usr/local/www/services_captiveportal.php:692
msgid "Per-user bandwidth restriction"
msgstr "ການຈຳກັດແບນວິດຕໍ່ຜູ້ໃຊ້"

#: src/usr/local/www/services_captiveportal.php:699
msgid "Default download (Kbit/s)"
msgstr "ດາວໂຫຼດເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ (Kbit/s)"

#: src/usr/local/www/services_captiveportal.php:706
msgid "Default upload (Kbit/s)"
msgstr "ອັບໂຫຼດເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ (Kbit/s)"

#: src/usr/local/www/services_captiveportal.php:709
msgid "If this option is set, the captive portal will restrict each user who logs in to the specified default bandwidth. RADIUS servers can override the default settings. Leave empty for no limit."
msgstr "ຫາກຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້, captive portal ຈະຈຳກັດແບນວິດຂອງຜູ້ໃຊ້ແຕ່ລະຄົນຕາມຄ່າທີ່ກຳນົດ. ເຊີບເວີ RADIUS ສາມາດກຳນົດຄ່າທັບຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນນີ້ໄດ້. ປ່ອຍຫວ່າງໄວ້ຫາກບໍ່ຕ້ອງການຈຳກັດ."

#: src/usr/local/www/services_captiveportal.php:714
msgid "Use custom captive portal page"
msgstr "ໃຊ້ໜ້າ captive portal ທີ່ກຳນົດເອງ"

#: src/usr/local/www/services_captiveportal.php:717
msgid "If set a portal.html page must be created and uploaded. If unchecked the default template will be used"
msgstr "ຫາກເລືອກ, ຕ້ອງສ້າງ ແລະ ອັບໂຫຼດໄຟລ໌ portal.html. ຫາກບໍ່ເລືອກ ຈະໃຊ້ຮູບແບບເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ"

#: src/usr/local/www/services_captiveportal.php:721
