#: src/usr/local/www/services_captiveportal.php:873
msgid "Add a logo for use in the default portal login screen. File will be renamed captiveportal-logo.* The image will be resized to fit within the given area, It can be of any image type: .png, .jpg, .svg <strong>This image will not be stored in the config</strong>. The default logo will be used if no custom image is present."
msgstr "ເພີ່ມໂລໂກ້ສຳລັບໃຊ້ໃນໜ້າລົງຊື່ເຂົ້າໃຊ້ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ. ໄຟລ໌ຈະຖືກປ່ຽນຊື່ເປັນ captiveportal-logo.* ຮູບຈະຖືກປັບຂະໜາດໃຫ້ພໍດີກັບພື້ນທີ່ທີ່ກຳນົດ, ສາມາດໃຊ້ໄຟລ໌ປະເພດ: .png, .jpg, .svg. <strong>ຮູບນີ້ຈະບໍ່ຖືກເກັບໄວ້ໃນໄຟລ໌ config</strong>. ຫາກບໍ່ມີຮູບທີ່ກຳນົດເອງ ຈະໃຊ້ໂລໂກ້ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ."

