#: src/usr/local/www/services_captiveportal.php:887
msgid "Add a background image for use in the default portal login screen. File will be renamed captiveportal-background.* The background image will fill the screen. <strong>This image will not be stored in the config</strong>. The default background image will be used if no custom background is present."
msgstr "ເພີ່ມຮູບພື້ນຫຼັງສຳລັບໃຊ້ໃນໜ້າລົງຊື່ເຂົ້າໃຊ້ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ. ໄຟລ໌ຈະຖືກປ່ຽນຊື່ເປັນ captiveportal-background.* ຮູບພື້ນຫຼັງຈະສະແດງເຕັມຈໍ. <strong>ຮູບນີ້ຈະບໍ່ຖືກເກັບໄວ້ໃນໄຟລ໌ config</strong>. ຫາກບໍ່ມີຮູບທີ່ກຳນົດເອງ ຈະໃຊ້ຮູບພື້ນຫຼັງເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ."

