#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_ipsec_phase1.php:1000 src/usr/local/www/vpn_ipsec_phase2.php:768
msgid "Life Time"
msgstr "ໄລຍະເວລາໃຊ້ງານ (Life Time)"

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_ipsec_phase1.php:1004
#, no-php-format
msgid "Hard IKE SA life time, in seconds, after which the IKE SA will be expired. Must be larger than Rekey Time and Reauth Time. Cannot be set to the same value as Rekey Time or Reauth Time. If left empty, defaults to 110% of whichever timer is higher (reauth or rekey)"
msgstr "ໄລຍະເວລາ Hard IKE SA (ວິນາທີ), ຫຼັງຈາກນັ້ນ IKE SA ຈະໝົດອາຍຸ. ຕ້ອງຫຼາຍກວ່າ Rekey Time ແລະ Reauth Time. ຫາກປ່ອຍຫວ່າງໄວ້ ຈະມີຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນເປັນ 110% ຂອງຄ່າທີ່ສູງກວ່າລະຫວ່າງ reauth ຫຼື rekey."

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_ipsec_phase1.php:1011 src/usr/local/www/vpn_ipsec_phase2.php:780
msgid "Rekey Time"
msgstr "ເວລາສ້າງຄີໃໝ່ (Rekey Time)"

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_ipsec_phase1.php:1015
msgid "Time, in seconds, before an IKE SA establishes new keys. This works without interruption. Cannot be set to the same value as Life Time. Only supported by IKEv2, and is recommended for use with IKEv2. Leave blank to use a default value of 90% Life Time when using IKEv2. Enter a value of 0 to disable."
msgstr "ໄລຍະເວລາ (ວິນາທີ) ກ່ອນທີ່ IKE SA ຈະສ້າງຄີໃໝ່. ສິ່ງນີ້ເຮັດວຽກໂດຍບໍ່ມີການຂັດຈັງຫວະ. ຮອງຮັບສະເພາະ IKEv2 ເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ປ່ອຍຫວ່າງເພື່ອໃຊ້ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນທີ່ 90% ຂອງ Life Time. ໃສ່ 0 ເພື່ອປິດໃຊ້ງານ."

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_ipsec_phase1.php:1023
msgid "Reauth Time"
msgstr "ເວລາຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນໃໝ່ (Reauth Time)"

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_ipsec_phase1.php:1027
msgid "Time, in seconds, before an IKE SA is torn down and recreated from scratch, including authentication. This can be disruptive unless both sides support make-before-break and overlapping IKE SA entries. Cannot be set to the same value as Life Time. Supported by IKEv1 and IKEv2. Leave blank to use a default value of 90% Life Time when using IKEv1. Enter a value of 0 to disable."
msgstr "ໄລຍະເວລາ (ວິນາທີ) ກ່ອນທີ່ IKE SA ຈະຖືກຍົກເລີກ ແລະ ສ້າງໃໝ່ທັງໝົດ. ອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຂັດຈັງຫວະ. ຮອງຮັບທັງ IKEv1 ແລະ IKEv2. ປ່ອຍຫວ່າງເພື່ອໃຊ້ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນທີ່ 90% ຂອງ Life Time ເມື່ອໃຊ້ IKEv1. ໃສ່ 0 ເພື່ອປິດໃຊ້ງານ."

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_ipsec_phase1.php:1036 src/usr/local/www/vpn_ipsec_phase2.php:793
msgid "Rand Time"
msgstr "Rand Time"

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_ipsec_phase1.php:1040
#, no-php-format
msgid "A random value up to this amount will be subtracted from Rekey Time/Reauth Time to avoid simultaneous renegotiation. If left empty, defaults to 10% of Life Time. Enter 0 to disable randomness, but be aware that simultaneous renegotiation can lead to duplicate security associations."
msgstr "ຄ່າສຸ່ມທີ່ຈະຖືກນຳມາລົບອອກຈາກ Rekey Time/Reauth Time ເພື່ອຫຼີກເວັ້ນການສ້າງຄີໃໝ່ພ້ອມກັນ. ຫາກປ່ອຍຫວ່າງ ຈະມີຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນເປັນ 10% ຂອງ Life Time. ໃສ່ 0 ເພື່ອປິດການສຸ່ມ."

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_ipsec_phase1.php:1050
msgid "Responder Only"
msgstr "ເປັນຜູ້ຕອບສະໜອງເທົ່ານັ້ນ (Responder Only)"

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_ipsec_phase1.php:1057
msgid "Child SA Close Action"
msgstr "ການກະທຳເມື່ອ Child SA ຖືກປິດ"

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_ipsec_phase1.php:1060
msgid "Set this option to control the behavior when the remote peer unexpectedly closes a child SA (P2)"
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້ເພື່ອຄວບຄຸມພຶດຕິກຳເມື່ອປາຍທາງປິດ Child SA (Phase 2) ໂດຍບໍ່ຄາດຄິດ."

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_ipsec_phase1.php:1066
msgid "Force"
msgstr "ບັງຄັບ (Force)"

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_ipsec_phase1.php:1064
msgid "NAT Traversal"
msgstr "NAT Traversal"

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_ipsec_phase1.php:1067
msgid "Set this option to enable the use of NAT-T (i.e. the encapsulation of ESP in UDP packets) if needed, which can help with clients that are behind restrictive firewalls."
msgstr "ເປີດໃຊ້ NAT-T (ການຫຸ້ມຫໍ່ ESP ໃນ UDP) ເພື່ອຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ໃຊ້ງານໄດ້ໃນກໍລະນີທີ່ຢູ່ຫຼັງໄຟວໍ."

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_ipsec_phase1.php:1072
msgid "MOBIKE"
msgstr "MOBIKE"

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_ipsec_phase1.php:1075
msgid "Set this option to control the use of MOBIKE"
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້ເພື່ອຄວບຄຸມການໃຊ້ MOBIKE"

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_ipsec_phase1.php:1080
#, php-format
msgid "Enable this to allow multiple phase 1 configurations with the same endpoint. When enabled, %s does not manage routing to the remote gateway and traffic will follow the default route without regard for the chosen interface. Static routes can override this behavior."
msgstr "ເປີດໃຊ້ເພື່ອອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ມີການຕັ້ງຄ່າ Phase 1 ຫຼາຍອັນທີ່ມີຈຸດເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ດຽວກັນ. ເມື່ອເປີດໃຊ້, %s ຈະບໍ່ຈັດການເສັ້ນທາງ (Routing) ໄປຫາເກດເວປາຍທາງ ແລະ ຂໍ້ມູນຈະແລ່ນຕາມເສັ້ນທາງເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ."

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_ipsec_phase1.php:1079
msgid "Gateway duplicates"
msgstr "ເກດເວຊ້ຳກັນ (Gateway duplicates)"

