msgid "PRF Selection"
msgstr "ການເລືອກ PRF"

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_ipsec_phase1.php:1098
msgid "Manual PRF selection is typically not required, but can be useful in combination with AEAD Encryption Algorithms such as AES-GCM"
msgstr "ປົກກະຕິແລ້ວບໍ່ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງເລືອກ PRF ດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ ແຕ່ອາດມີປະໂຫຍດເມື່ອໃຊ້ຮ່ວມກັບ AES-GCM."

