#: src/usr/local/www/firewall_aliases_edit.php:193
msgid "Networks are specified in CIDR format. Select the CIDR mask that pertains to each entry. /32 specifies a single IPv4 host, /128 specifies a single IPv6 host, /24 specifies 255.255.255.0, /64 specifies a normal IPv6 network, etc. Hostnames (FQDNs) may also be specified, using a /32 mask for IPv4 or /128 for IPv6. An IP range such as 192.168.1.1-192.168.1.254 may also be entered and a list of CIDR networks will be derived to fill the range."
msgstr "ເນັດເວີກຕ້ອງຢູ່ໃນຮູບແບບ CIDR. /32 ແມ່ນ IPv4 ໂຮສດຽວ, /128 ແມ່ນ IPv6 ໂຮສດຽວ, /24 ແມ່ນ 255.255.255.0. ສາມາດລະບຸຊື່ໂຮສ (FQDN) ໄດ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ /32 ຫຼື /128. ນອກຈາກນີ້ຍັງສາມາດໃສ່ເປັນຊ່ວງ IP ເຊັ່ນ 192.168.1.1-192.168.1.254 ໄດ້."

#: src/usr/local/www/firewall_aliases_edit.php:194
msgid "Enter as many hosts as desired. Hosts must be specified by their IP address or fully qualified domain name (FQDN). FQDN hostnames are periodically re-resolved and updated. If multiple IPs are returned by a DNS query, all are used. An IP range such as 192.168.1.1-192.168.1.10 or a small subnet such as 192.168.1.16/28 may also be entered and a list of individual IP addresses will be generated."
msgstr "ໃສ່ຈຳນວນໂຮສຕາມທີ່ຕ້ອງການ. ຕ້ອງລະບຸດ້ວຍ IP ຫຼື FQDN. ຊື່ໂຮສ FQDN ຈະຖືກອັບເດດເປັນໄລຍະ. ສາມາດໃສ່ຊ່ວງ IP ຫຼື ຊັບເນັດຂະໜາດນ້ອຍໄດ້."

#: src/usr/local/www/firewall_aliases_edit.php:195
msgid "Enter ports as desired, with a single port or port range per entry. Port ranges can be expressed by separating with a colon."
msgstr "ໃສ່ພອດຕາມທີ່ຕ້ອງການ, ໜຶ່ງພອດ ຫຼື ໜຶ່ງຊ່ວງພອດຕໍ່ລາຍການ. ຊ່ວງພອດໃຫ້ແຍກດ້ວຍເຄື່ອງໝາຍໂຄລອນ (:)."

#: src/usr/local/www/firewall_aliases_edit.php:196
msgid "Enter as many URLs as desired. After saving, the URLs will be downloaded and the items imported into the alias. Use only with small sets of IP addresses (less than 3000)."
msgstr "ໃສ່ URL ຕາມທີ່ຕ້ອງການ. ຫຼັງຈາກບັນທຶກ ລະບົບຈະດາວໂຫຼດ ແລະ ນຳເຂົ້າລາຍການ. ຄວນໃຊ້ກັບລາຍການ IP ຈຳນວນໜ້ອຍ (ຕ່ຳກວ່າ 3,000)."

#: src/usr/local/www/firewall_aliases_edit.php:197
msgid "Enter as many URLs as desired. After saving, the URLs will be downloaded and the items imported into the alias. Use only with small sets of Ports (less than 3000)."
msgstr "ໃສ່ URL ຕາມທີ່ຕ້ອງການ. ຫຼັງຈາກບັນທຶກ ລະບົບຈະດາວໂຫຼດ ແລະ ນຳເຂົ້າລາຍການ. ຄວນໃຊ້ກັບລາຍການພອດຈຳນວນໜ້ອຍ (ຕ່ຳກວ່າ 3,000)."

#: src/usr/local/www/firewall_aliases_edit.php:198
msgid "Enter a single URL containing a large number of IPs and/or Subnets. After saving, the URLs will be downloaded and a table file containing these addresses will be created. This will work with large numbers of addresses (30,000+) or small numbers."
msgstr "ໃສ່ URL ດຽວທີ່ມີ IP ແລະ/ຫຼື ຊັບເນັດຈຳນວນຫຼາຍ. ຫຼັງຈາກບັນທຶກ ລະບົບຈະດາວໂຫຼດ ແລະ ສ້າງໄຟລ໌ຕາຕະລາງ. ວິທີນີ້ຮອງຮັບຂໍ້ມູນຈຳນວນຫຼາຍ (30,000+)."

#: src/usr/local/www/firewall_aliases_edit.php:200
msgid "Enter a single URL containing a list of Port numbers and/or Port ranges. After saving, the URL will be downloaded."
msgstr "ໃສ່ URL ດຽວທີ່ມີລາຍການພອດ ຫຼື ຊ່ວງພອດ. ຫຼັງຈາກບັນທຶກ ລະບົບຈະດາວໂຫຼດຂໍ້ມູນ."

