#: src/usr/local/www/services_unbound_advanced.php:312
#, php-format
msgid "Only send minimum required labels of the QNAME and set QTYPE to A when possible. Best effort approach; full QNAME and original QTYPE will be sent when upstream replies with a RCODE other than NOERROR, except when receiving NXDOMAIN from a DNSSEC signed zone. Default is off.%1$s Refer to %2$sRFC 7816%3$s for in-depth information on Query Name Minimization."
msgstr "ສົ່ງສະເພາະຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ຈຳເປັນຕ່ຳສຸດຂອງ QNAME ແລະ ຕັ້ງ QTYPE ເປັນ A ເມື່ອເຮັດໄດ້. ໂດຍປົກກະຕິຈະປິດໄວ້.%1$s ສາມາດອ່ານລາຍລະອຽດເພີ່ມເຕີມໄດ້ທີ່ %2$sRFC 7816%3$s."

#: src/usr/local/www/services_unbound_advanced.php:316
msgid "Strict Query Name Minimization"
msgstr "ການຫຼຸດຂໍ້ມູນຊື່ແບບເຂັ້ມງວດ (Strict QNAME Minimization)"

#: src/usr/local/www/services_unbound_advanced.php:319
#, php-format
msgid "QNAME minimization in strict mode. %1$sA significant number of domains will fail to resolve when this option in enabled%2$s. Only use if you know what you are doing. This option only has effect when Query Name Minimization is enabled. Default is off."
msgstr "ການຫຼຸດຂໍ້ມູນຊື່ໃນໂໝດເຂັ້ມງວດ. %1$sໂດເມນຈຳນວນຫຼາຍອາດຈະບໍ່ສາມາດຄົ້ນຫາຊື່ໄດ້ຫາກເປີດໃຊ້ສິ່ງນີ້%2$s. ໃຊ້ກໍຕໍ່ເມື່ອທ່ານເຂົ້າໃຈວິທີການເຮັດວຽກຂອງມັນແທ້ໆ. ໂດຍປົກກະຕິຈະປິດໄວ້."

#: src/usr/local/www/services_unbound_advanced.php:323
msgid "Advanced Resolver Options"
msgstr "ຕົວເລືອກ DNS Resolver ຂັ້ນສູງ"

#: src/usr/local/www/services_unbound_advanced.php:327
msgid "Prefetch Support"
msgstr "Prefetch Support"

#: src/usr/local/www/services_unbound_advanced.php:330
msgid "When enabled, this option can cause an increase of around 10% more DNS traffic and load on the server, but frequently requested items will not expire from the cache."
msgstr "ເມື່ອເປີດໃຊ້, ອາດເຮັດໃຫ້ມີການຮັບສົ່ງຂໍ້ມູນ DNS ແລະ ພາລະຂອງເຊີບເວີເພີ່ມຂຶ້ນປະມານ 10%, ແຕ່ລາຍການທີ່ມີການສອບຖາມເລື້ອຍໆຈະບໍ່ໝົດອາຍຸຈາກແຄຊ (Cache)."

#: src/usr/local/www/services_unbound_advanced.php:334
msgid "Prefetch DNS Key Support"
msgstr "Prefetch DNS Key Support"

#: src/usr/local/www/services_unbound_advanced.php:337
#, php-format
msgid "This helps lower the latency of requests but does utilize a little more CPU. See: %1$sWikipedia%2$s"
msgstr "ຊ່ວຍຫຼຸດຄວາມຊ້າ (Latency) ແຕ່ຈະໃຊ້ CPU ເພີ່ມຂຶ້ນເລັກໜ້ອຍ. ເບິ່ງ: %1$sWikipedia%2$s"

#: src/usr/local/www/services_unbound_advanced.php:341
msgid "Harden DNSSEC Data"
msgstr "Harden DNSSEC Data"

#: src/usr/local/www/services_unbound_advanced.php:344
msgid "If such data is absent, the zone becomes bogus. If Disabled and no DNSSEC data is received, then the zone is made insecure. "
msgstr "ຫາກບໍ່ມີຂໍ້ມູນດັ່ງກ່າວ, ໂຊນ (zone) ຈະກາຍເປັນ Bogus (ຂໍ້ມູນຜິດພາດ). ຫາກປິດໃຊ້ງານ ແລະ ບໍ່ໄດ້ຮັບຂໍ້ມູນ DNSSEC, ໂຊນນັ້ນຈະຖືກກຳນົດໃຫ້ເປັນແບບບໍ່ປອດໄພ. "

#: src/usr/local/www/services_unbound_advanced.php:348
msgid "Serve Expired"
msgstr "Serve Expired"

#: src/usr/local/www/services_unbound_advanced.php:351
msgid "When enabled, allows unbound to serve one query even with a TTL of 0, if TTL is 0 then new record will be requested in the background when the cache is served to ensure cache is updated without latency on service of the DNS request."
msgstr "ເມື່ອເປີດໃຊ້, ຈະອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ unbound ຕອບຄຳຖາມໄດ້ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າ TTL ຈະເປັນ 0, ໂດຍຈະມີການຂໍຂໍ້ມູນໃໝ່ໃນເບື້ອງຫຼັງເພື່ອໃຫ້ແຄຊເປັນປັດຈຸບັນສະເໝີ."

#: src/usr/local/www/services_unbound_advanced.php:355
msgid "Aggressive NSEC"
msgstr "Aggressive NSEC"

#: src/usr/local/www/services_unbound_advanced.php:358
msgid "When enabled, unbound uses the DNSSEC NSEC chain to synthesize NXDOMAIN and other denials, using information from previous NXDOMAINs answers. It helps to reduce the query rate towards targets that get a very high nonexistent name lookup rate."
msgstr "ເມື່ອເປີດໃຊ້, unbound ຈະໃຊ້ DNSSEC NSEC chain ເພື່ອຊ່ວຍໃນການຕອບກັບ NXDOMAIN. ຊ່ວຍຫຼຸດຈຳນວນການສອບຖາມຊື່ທີ່ບໍ່ມີຢູ່ຈິງ."

#: src/usr/local/www/services_unbound_advanced.php:364
msgid "Message Cache Size"
msgstr "Message Cache Size"

#: src/usr/local/www/services_unbound_advanced.php:367
msgid "Size of the message cache. The message cache stores DNS response codes and validation statuses. The Resource Record Set (RRSet) cache will automatically be set to twice this amount. The RRSet cache contains the actual RR data. The default is 4 megabytes."
msgstr "ຂະໜາດຂອງແຄຊຂໍ້ຄວາມ (Message cache). ເກັບລະຫັດການຕອບສະໜອງ ແລະ ສະຖານະການຢືນຢັນ. ໂດຍປົກກະຕິແມ່ນ 4 ເມກາໄບ."

#: src/usr/local/www/services_unbound_advanced.php:371
msgid "Outgoing TCP Buffers"
msgstr "Outgoing TCP Buffers"

#: src/usr/local/www/services_unbound_advanced.php:374
msgid "The number of outgoing TCP buffers to allocate per thread. The default value is 10. If 0 is selected then TCP queries are not sent to authoritative servers."
msgstr "ຈຳນວນບັຟເຟີ TCP ຂາອອກທີ່ຈະກຳນົດໃຫ້ແຕ່ລະ Thread. ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນ 10."

#: src/usr/local/www/services_unbound_advanced.php:378
msgid "Incoming TCP Buffers"
msgstr "Incoming TCP Buffers"

#: src/usr/local/www/services_unbound_advanced.php:381
msgid "The number of incoming TCP buffers to allocate per thread. The default value is 10. If 0 is selected then TCP queries are not accepted from clients."
msgstr "ຈຳນວນບັຟເຟີ TCP ຂາເຂົ້າທີ່ຈະກຳນົດໃຫ້ແຕ່ລະ Thread. ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນ 10."

#: src/usr/local/www/services_unbound_advanced.php:385
msgid "EDNS Buffer Size"
msgstr "EDNS Buffer Size"

#: src/usr/local/www/services_unbound_advanced.php:389
#, php-format
msgid "Number of bytes size to advertise as the EDNS reassembly buffer size. This is the value that is used in UDP datagrams sent to peers.%1$sAuto mode sets optimal buffer size by using the smallest MTU of active interfaces and subtracting the IPv4/IPv6 header size.%1$sIf fragmentation reassemble problems occur, usually seen as timeouts, then a value of 1432 should help.%1$sThe 512/1232 values bypasses most IPv4/IPv6 MTU path problems, but it can generate an excessive amount of TCP fallback."
msgstr "ຂະໜາດບັຟເຟີ EDNS. %1$sໂໝດ Auto ຈະກຳນົດຄ່າທີ່ເໝາະສົມຕາມ MTU ຂອງອິນເຕີເຟດ. %1$sຫາກພົບບັນຫາການປະກອບຂໍ້ມູນ (Fragmentation) ໃຫ້ລອງໃຊ້ຄ່າ 1432."

#: src/usr/local/www/services_unbound_advanced.php:396
msgid "Number of Queries per Thread"
msgstr "ຈຳນວນການສອບຖາມຕໍ່ Thread"

#: src/usr/local/www/services_unbound_advanced.php:399
msgid "The number of queries that every thread will service simultaneously. If more queries arrive that need to be serviced, and no queries can be jostled, then these queries are dropped."
msgstr "ຈຳນວນການສອບຖາມທີ່ແຕ່ລະ Thread ຈະໃຫ້ບໍລິການພ້ອມກັນ."

#: src/usr/local/www/services_unbound_advanced.php:403
msgid "Jostle Timeout"
msgstr "Jostle Timeout"

#: src/usr/local/www/services_unbound_advanced.php:406
msgid "This timeout is used for when the server is very busy. This protects against denial of service by slow queries or high query rates. The default value is 200 milliseconds. "
msgstr "ຄ່າການລໍຖ້າ (timeout) ນີ້ຖືກໃຊ້ໃນເວລາທີ່ເຊີເວີມີການໃຊ້ງານໜາແໜ້ນ. ສິ່ງນີ້ປ້ອງກັນການປະຕິເສດການໃຫ້ບໍລິການ (denial of service) ຈາກການສອບຖາມທີ່ຊ້າ ຫຼື ມີອັດຕາການສອບຖາມສູງ. ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນ 200 ມິນລິວິນາທີ. "

#: src/usr/local/www/services_unbound_advanced.php:410
msgid "Maximum TTL for RRsets and Messages"
msgstr "ຄ່າ TTL ສູງສຸດສຳລັບ RRsets ແລະ ຂໍ້ຄວາມ"

#: src/usr/local/www/services_unbound_advanced.php:413
msgid "The Maximum Time to Live for RRsets and messages in the cache. The default is 86400 seconds (1 day). When the internal TTL expires the cache item is expired. This can be configured to force the resolver to query for data more often and not trust (very large) TTL values."
msgstr "ເວລາສູງສຸດທີ່ຈະເກັບຂໍ້ມູນໄວ້ໃນແຄຊ. ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນ 86400 ວິນາທີ (1 ມື້)."

#: src/usr/local/www/services_unbound_advanced.php:418
msgid "Minimum TTL for RRsets and Messages"
msgstr "ຄ່າ TTL ຕ່ຳສຸດສຳລັບ RRsets ແລະ ຂໍ້ຄວາມ"

#: src/usr/local/www/services_unbound_advanced.php:421
msgid "The Minimum Time to Live for RRsets and messages in the cache. The default is 0 seconds. If the minimum value kicks in, the data is cached for longer than the domain owner intended, and thus less queries are made to look up the data. The 0 value ensures the data in the cache is as the domain owner intended. High values can lead to trouble as the data in the cache might not match up with the actual data anymore."
msgstr "ເວລາຕ່ຳສຸດທີ່ຈະເກັບຂໍ້ມູນໄວ້ໃນແຄຊ. ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນ 0 ວິນາທີ."

#: src/usr/local/www/services_unbound_advanced.php:425
msgid "minutes"
msgstr "ນາທີ"

#: src/usr/local/www/services_unbound_advanced.php:428
msgid "TTL for Host Cache Entries"
msgstr "TTL for Host Cache Entries"

#: src/usr/local/www/services_unbound_advanced.php:431
msgid "Time to Live, in seconds, for entries in the infrastructure host cache. The infrastructure host cache contains round trip timing, lameness, and EDNS support information for DNS servers. The default value is 15 minutes."
msgstr "ໄລຍະເວລາ (ວິນາທີ) ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນໃນ infrastructure host cache. ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນ 15 ນາທີ."

#: src/usr/local/www/services_unbound_advanced.php:435
msgid "Number of Hosts to Cache"
msgstr "ຈຳນວນໂຮສທີ່ຈະເກັບໃນແຄຊ"

#: src/usr/local/www/services_unbound_advanced.php:438
msgid "Number of infrastructure hosts for which information is cached. The default is 10,000."
msgstr "ຈຳນວນໂຮສທີ່ຈະເກັບຂໍ້ມູນໄວ້. ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນ 10,000."

#: src/usr/local/www/services_unbound_advanced.php:440
msgid "million"
msgstr "ລ້ານ"

#: src/usr/local/www/services_unbound_advanced.php:443
msgid "Unwanted Reply Threshold"
msgstr "Unwanted Reply Threshold"

#: src/usr/local/www/services_unbound_advanced.php:447
msgid "If enabled, a total number of unwanted replies is kept track of in every thread. When it reaches the threshold, a defensive action is taken and a warning is printed to the log file. This defensive action is to clear the RRSet and message caches, hopefully flushing away any poison. The default is disabled, but if enabled a value of 10 million is suggested."
msgstr "ຫາກເປີດໃຊ້, ຈະມີການຕິດຕາມຈຳນວນການຕອບກັບທີ່ບໍ່ຕ້ອງການ. ຫາກຮອດຄ່າທີ່ກຳນົດ ລະບົບຈະລຶບແຄຊທັງໝົດເພື່ອຄວາມປອດໄພ. ແນະນຳໃຫ້ຕັ້ງເປັນ 10 ລ້ານ."

#: src/usr/local/www/services_unbound_advanced.php:451
#, php-format
msgid "Level %s"
msgstr "ລະດັບ %s"

#: src/usr/local/www/services_unbound_advanced.php:465
msgid "Log Level"
msgstr "ລະດັບການເກັບລັອກ"

#: src/usr/local/www/services_unbound_advanced.php:468
msgid "Select the level of detail to be logged. Each level also includes the information from previous levels. The default is basic operational information (level 1)"
msgstr "ເລືອກລະດັບລາຍລະອຽດຂອງລັອກ. ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນ ລະດັບ 1."

#: src/usr/local/www/services_unbound_advanced.php:472
msgid "Disable Auto-added Access Control"
msgstr "ປິດການເພີ່ມ Access Control ອັດຕະໂນມັດ"

#: src/usr/local/www/services_unbound_advanced.php:475
msgid "By default, IPv4 and IPv6 networks residing on internal interfaces of this system are permitted. Allowed networks must be manually configured on the Access Lists tab if the auto-added entries are disabled."
msgstr "ໂດຍປົກກະຕິ ເນັດເວີກພາຍໃນຈະໄດ້ຮັບອະນຸຍາດໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ. ຫາກປິດຕົວເລືອກນີ້ ທ່ານຕ້ອງຕັ້ງຄ່າເອງໃນແຖບ Access Lists."

#: src/usr/local/www/services_unbound_advanced.php:480
msgid "Disable Auto-added Host Entries"
msgstr "ປິດການເພີ່ມລາຍການໂຮສອັດຕະໂນມັດ"

#: src/usr/local/www/services_unbound_advanced.php:483
#, php-format
msgid "By default, the primary IPv4 and IPv6 addresses of this firewall are added as records for the system domain of this firewall as configured in %1$sSystem: General Setup%2$s. This disables the auto generation of these entries."
msgstr "ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ທີ່ຢູ່ IPv4 ແລະ IPv6 ຫຼັກຂອງໄຟວໍລ໌ນີ້ ຈະຖືກເພີ່ມເປັນບັນທຶກສຳລັບໂດເມນລະບົບຂອງໄຟວໍລ໌ນີ້ ຕາມທີ່ໄດ້ກຳນົດຄ່າໄວ້ໃນ %1$sSystem: General Setup%2$s. ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະປິດການສ້າງລາຍການເຫຼົ່ານີ້ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ."

#: src/usr/local/www/services_unbound_advanced.php:487
msgid "Experimental Bit 0x20 Support"
msgstr "ຮອງຮັບ Bit 0x20 (ທົດລອງ)"

#: src/usr/local/www/services_unbound_advanced.php:490
#, php-format
msgid "See the implementation %1$sdraft dns-0x20%2$s for more information."
msgstr "ເບິ່ງຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມໄດ້ທີ່ %1$sdraft dns-0x20%2$s."

#: src/usr/local/www/services_unbound_advanced.php:494
msgid "DNS64 Support"
msgstr "ຮອງຮັບ DNS64"

#: src/usr/local/www/services_unbound_advanced.php:497
msgid "DNS64 is used with an IPv6/IPv4 translator to enable client-server communication between an IPv6-only client and an IPv4-only servers."
msgstr "DNS64 ໃຊ້ຮ່ວມກັບຕົວແປ IPv6/IPv4 ເພື່ອໃຫ້ລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ໃຊ້ IPv6 ຢ່າງດຽວ ສາມາດຕິດຕໍ່ກັບເຊີບເວີທີ່ໃຊ້ IPv4 ຢ່າງດຽວໄດ້."

#: src/usr/local/www/services_unbound_advanced.php:499 src/usr/local/www/services_unbound_advanced.php:504
msgid "DNS64 Prefix"
msgstr "DNS64 Prefix"

#: src/usr/local/www/services_unbound_advanced.php:507
msgid "IPv6 prefix used by IPv6 representations of IPv4 addresses. If this field is empty, default 64:ff9b::/96 prefix is used."
msgstr "IPv6 prefix ທີ່ໃຊ້ສຳລັບແປງທີ່ຢູ່ IPv4. ຫາກຫວ່າງໄວ້ ຈະໃຊ້ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນ 64:ff9b::/96."

#: src/usr/local/www/interfaces_gif_edit.php:59
msgid "gif remote address"
msgstr "ທີ່ຢູ່ປາຍທາງ gif"

#: src/usr/local/www/interfaces_gif_edit.php:59
msgid "gif tunnel local address"
msgstr "ທີ່ຢູ່ພາຍໃນຂອງ gif tunnel"

#: src/usr/local/www/interfaces_gif_edit.php:59
msgid "gif tunnel remote address"
msgstr "ທີ່ຢູ່ປາຍທາງຂອງ gif tunnel"

#: src/usr/local/www/interfaces_gif_edit.php:59
msgid "gif tunnel remote netmask"
msgstr "ເນັດມາກປາຍທາງຂອງ gif tunnel"

#: src/usr/local/www/interfaces_gif_edit.php:66
msgid "The tunnel local and tunnel remote fields must have valid IP addresses and must not contain CIDR masks or prefixes."
msgstr "ຊ່ອງ tunnel local ແລະ tunnel remote ຕ້ອງເປັນ IP ທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ ແລະ ບໍ່ມີ CIDR mask ຫຼື prefix."

#: src/usr/local/www/interfaces_gif_edit.php:70
msgid "The gif tunnel subnet must be an integer."
msgstr "Subnet ຂອງ gif tunnel ຕ້ອງເປັນຕົວເລກຖ້ວນ."

#: src/usr/local/www/interfaces_gif_edit.php:75
