msgstr "ແບນວິດທີ່ລະບຸບໍ່ສາມາດໜ້ອຍກວ່າ 1."

#: src/usr/local/www/wizards/traffic_shaper_wizard_multi_all.inc:343 src/usr/local/www/wizards/traffic_shaper_wizard_dedicated.inc:307
msgid "The same interface cannot be selected for local and outside."
msgstr "ບໍ່ສາມາດເລືອກອິນເຕີເຟສດຽວກັນສຳລັບທັງພາຍໃນ (local) ແລະ ພາຍນອກ (outside)."

#: src/usr/local/www/wizards/traffic_shaper_wizard_multi_all.inc:352
msgid "The same interface cannot be selected twice on local interfaces."
msgstr "ບໍ່ສາມາດເລືອກອິນເຕີເຟສດຽວກັນຊ້ຳສອງເທື່ອໃນອິນເຕີເຟສທ້ອງຖິ່ນ."

