msgstr "ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ລະບຸແບນວິດເປັນເປີເຊັນເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

#: src/usr/local/www/wizards/traffic_shaper_wizard_multi_all.inc:836 src/usr/local/www/wizards/traffic_shaper_wizard_dedicated.inc:768
