msgstr "ການຕັ້ງຄ່າໄດ້ຖືກນຳໃຊ້ແລ້ວ!"

#: src/usr/local/www/interfaces.php:556
msgid "An interface with the specified description already exists."
msgstr "ມີອິນເຕີເຟສທີ່ມີຄຳອະທິບາຍນີ້ຢູ່ແລ້ວ."

#: src/usr/local/www/interfaces.php:565
#, php-format
msgid "Sorry, an alias with the name %s already exists."
msgstr "ຂໍອະໄພ, ມີຊື່ແທນ (alias) ທີ່ຊື່ %s ຢູ່ແລ້ວ."

#: src/usr/local/www/interfaces.php:574
#, php-format
msgid "Sorry, an interface group with the name %s already exists."
msgstr "ຂໍອະໄພ, ມີກຸ່ມອິນເຕີເຟສທີ່ຊື່ %s ຢູ່ແລ້ວ."

#: src/usr/local/www/interfaces.php:580
msgid "The interface description cannot contain only numbers."
msgstr "ຄຳອະທິບາຍອິນເຕີເຟສບໍ່ສາມາດມີພຽງແຕ່ຕົວເລກເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

#: src/usr/local/www/interfaces.php:585
msgid "The OpenVPN and VTI interface description must be less than 26 characters long."
msgstr "ຄຳອະທິບາຍອິນເຕີເຟສ OpenVPN ແລະ VTI ຕ້ອງຍາວບໍ່ເກີນ 26 ຕົວອັກສອນ."

#: src/usr/local/www/interfaces.php:590
msgid "The GIF and GRE interface description must be less than 23 characters long."
msgstr "ຄຳອະທິບາຍອິນເຕີເຟສ GIF ແລະ GRE ຕ້ອງຍາວບໍ່ເກີນ 23 ຕົວອັກສອນ."

#: src/usr/local/www/interfaces.php:599
msgid "The interface description cannot start with pkg_"
msgstr "ຄຳອະທິບາຍອິນເຕີເຟສບໍ່ສາມາດຂຶ້ນຕົ້ນດ້ວຍ pkg_"

#: src/usr/local/www/interfaces.php:609
#, php-format
msgid "In order to block bogon networks the Firewall Maximum Table Entries value in System / Advanced / Firewall must be increased at least to %s."
msgstr "ເພື່ອບລັອກເຄືອຂ່າຍ bogon, ຄ່າ Firewall Maximum Table Entries ໃນ System / Advanced / Firewall ຕ້ອງເພີ່ມຂຶ້ນຢ່າງໜ້ອຍເປັນ %s."

#: src/usr/local/www/interfaces.php:615
msgid "The DHCP Server is active on this interface and it can be used only with a static IP configuration. Please disable the DHCP Server service on this interface first, then change the interface configuration."
msgstr "ເຊີເວີ DHCP ກຳລັງເຮັດວຽກຢູ່ໃນອິນເຕີເຟສນີ້ ແລະ ມັນສາມາດໃຊ້ໄດ້ກັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າ static IP ເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ກະລຸນາປິດບໍລິການ DHCP Server ໃນອິນເຕີເຟສນີ້ກ່ອນ, ແລ້ວຈຶ່ງປ່ຽນການຕັ້ງຄ່າອິນເຕີເຟສ."

#: src/usr/local/www/interfaces.php:621
msgid "The DHCP Server is active on this interface and it can be used only with IPv4 subnet < 31. Please disable the DHCP Server service on this interface first, then change the interface configuration."
msgstr "ເຊີເວີ DHCP ກຳລັງເຮັດວຽກຢູ່ໃນອິນເຕີເຟສນີ້ ແລະ ສາມາດໃຊ້ໄດ້ກັບ IPv4 subnet < 31 ເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ກະລຸນາປິດບໍລິການ DHCP Server ໃນອິນເຕີເຟສນີ້ກ່ອນ."

#: src/usr/local/www/interfaces.php:630
msgid "The DHCP6 Server is active on this interface and it can be used only with a static IPv6 configuration. Please disable the DHCPv6 Server service on this interface first, then change the interface configuration."
msgstr "ເຊີເວີ DHCP6 ກຳລັງເຮັດວຽກຢູ່ໃນອິນເຕີເຟສນີ້ ແລະ ສາມາດໃຊ້ໄດ້ກັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າ static IPv6 ເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ກະລຸນາປິດບໍລິການ DHCPv6 Server ໃນອິນເຕີເຟສນີ້ກ່ອນ."

#: src/usr/local/www/interfaces.php:635
msgid "The Router Advertisements Server is active on this interface and it can be used only with a static IPv6 configuration. Please disable the Router Advertisements Server service on this interface first, then change the interface configuration."
msgstr "ເຊີເວີ Router Advertisements ກຳລັງເຮັດວຽກຢູ່ໃນອິນເຕີເຟສນີ້ ແລະ ສາມາດໃຊ້ໄດ້ກັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າ static IPv6 ເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ກະລຸນາປິດບໍລິການ Router Advertisements ກ່ອນ."

