msgstr "ຈຳນວນຄັ້ງ (Count) ຕ້ອງຢູ່ລະຫວ່າງ 1 ຫາ %s"

#: src/usr/local/www/diag_ping.php:62
#, php-format
msgid "Wait must be between 1 and %s"
msgstr "ເວລາລໍຖ້າ (Wait) ຕ້ອງຢູ່ລະຫວ່າງ 1 ຫາ %s"

#: src/usr/local/www/diag_ping.php:122
#, php-format
msgid "Host \"%s\" did not respond or could not be resolved."
msgstr "ໂຮສ \"%s\" ບໍ່ຕອບສະໜອງ ຫຼື ບໍ່ສາມາດ resolve ໄດ້."

#: src/usr/local/www/diag_ping.php:156
msgid "Automatically selected (default)"
msgstr "ເລືອກອັດຕະໂນມັດ (ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ)"

#: src/usr/local/www/diag_ping.php:154
msgid "*Source address"
msgstr "*ທີ່ຢູ່ຕົ້ນທາງ"

#: src/usr/local/www/diag_ping.php:157
msgid "Select source address for the ping."
msgstr "ເລືອກທີ່ຢູ່ຕົ້ນທາງສຳລັບການ ping."

#: src/usr/local/www/diag_ping.php:161
msgid "Maximum number of pings"
msgstr "ຈຳນວນການ ping ສູງສຸດ"

#: src/usr/local/www/diag_ping.php:164
msgid "Select the maximum number of pings."
msgstr "ເລືອກຈຳນວນຄັ້ງສູງສຸດທີ່ຈະ ping."

#: src/usr/local/www/diag_ping.php:168
msgid "Seconds between pings"
msgstr "ໄລຍະເວລາ (ວິນາທີ) ລະຫວ່າງການ ping"

#: src/usr/local/www/diag_ping.php:171
msgid "Select the number of seconds to wait between pings."
msgstr "ເລືອກຈຳນວນວິນາທີທີ່ຈະລໍຖ້າລະຫວ່າງການ ping ແຕ່ລະຄັ້ງ."

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_notifications.php:76
msgid "Certificate Expiration"
msgstr "ການໝົດອາຍຸຂອງໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ"

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_notifications.php:79
msgid "When enabled, the firewall will check CA and Certificate expiration times daily and file notices when expired or soon-to-expire entries are detected."
msgstr "ເມື່ອເປີດໃຊ້, ໄຟວໍຈະກວດສອບວັນໝົດອາຍຸຂອງ CA ແລະ ໃບຢັ້ງຢືນທຸກໆມື້ ແລະ ແຈ້ງເຕືອນເມື່ອພົບລາຍການທີ່ໝົດອາຍຸ ຫຼື ໃກ້ຈະໝົດອາຍຸ."

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_notifications.php:84
msgid "Certificate Expiration Threshold"
msgstr "ກຳນົດເວລາແຈ້ງເຕືອນໃບຢັ້ງຢືນໝົດອາຍຸ"

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_notifications.php:88
#, php-format
msgid "The number of days at which a certificate lifetime is considered to be expiring soon and worthy of notification. Default is %d days."
msgstr "ຈຳນວນມື້ກ່ອນໝົດອາຍຸທີ່ຈະໃຫ້ເລີ່ມແຈ້ງເຕືອນ. ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນ %d ມື້."

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_notifications.php:94
msgid "E-Mail"
msgstr "ອີເມວ"

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_notifications.php:98
msgid "Disable SMTP"
msgstr "ປິດການໃຊ້ງານ SMTP"

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_notifications.php:101
msgid "Check this option to disable SMTP notifications but preserve the settings below. Some other mechanisms, such as packages, may need these settings in place to function."
msgstr "ເລືອກຊ່ອງນີ້ເພື່ອປິດການແຈ້ງເຕືອນ SMTP ແຕ່ຍັງຄົງຮັກສາການຕັ້ງຄ່າໄວ້."

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_notifications.php:107
msgid "E-Mail server"
msgstr "ເຊີເວີອີເມວ"

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_notifications.php:110
msgid "This is the FQDN or IP address of the SMTP E-Mail server to which notifications will be sent."
msgstr "ຊື່ໂດເມນ (FQDN) ຫຼື IP ຂອງເຊີເວີ SMTP ທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ສົ່ງການແຈ້ງເຕືອນ."

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_notifications.php:115
msgid "SMTP Port of E-Mail server"
msgstr "ພອດ SMTP ຂອງເຊີເວີອີເມວ"

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_notifications.php:118
msgid "This is the port of the SMTP E-Mail server, typically 25, 587 (submission) or 465 (smtps)."
msgstr "ພອດຂອງເຊີເວີ SMTP, ປົກກະຕິແມ່ນ 25, 587 ຫຼື 465."

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_notifications.php:123
msgid "Connection timeout to E-Mail server"
msgstr "ໄລຍະເວລາໝົດການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບເຊີເວີອີເມວ"

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_notifications.php:126
msgid "This is how many seconds it will wait for the SMTP server to connect. Default is 20s."
msgstr "ຈຳນວນວິນາທີທີ່ຈະລໍຖ້າການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບເຊີເວີ SMTP. ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນ 20 ວິນາທີ."

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_notifications.php:128
msgid "Secure SMTP Connection"
msgstr "ການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ SMTP ແບບປອດໄພ"

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_notifications.php:131
msgid "Enable SSL/TLS"
msgstr "ເປີດໃຊ້ SSL/TLS"

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_notifications.php:140
msgid "Validate SSL/TLS"
msgstr "ກວດສອບຄວາມຖືກຕ້ອງຂອງ SSL/TLS"

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_notifications.php:143
msgid "When disabled, the server certificate will not be validated. Encryption will still be used if available, but the identity of the server will not be confirmed."
msgstr "ເມື່ອປິດ, ຈະບໍ່ມີການກວດສອບໃບຢັ້ງຢືນຂອງເຊີເວີ. ຍັງຄົງມີການເຂົ້າລະຫັດຢູ່ ແຕ່ຈະບໍ່ມີການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນຂອງເຊີເວີ."

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_notifications.php:148
msgid "From e-mail address"
msgstr "ຈາກທີ່ຢູ່ອີເມວ"

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_notifications.php:151
msgid "This is the e-mail address that will appear in the from field."
msgstr "ທີ່ຢູ່ອີເມວທີ່ຈະສະແດງໃນຊ່ອງຜູ້ສົ່ງ (From)."

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_notifications.php:155
msgid "Notification E-Mail address"
msgstr "ທີ່ຢູ່ອີເມວຮັບການແຈ້ງເຕືອນ"

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_notifications.php:158
msgid "Enter the e-mail address to send email notifications to."
msgstr "ໃສ່ທີ່ຢູ່ອີເມວທີ່ຈະໃຫ້ສົ່ງການແຈ້ງເຕືອນໄປຫາ."

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_notifications.php:163
msgid "Notification E-Mail auth username (optional)"
msgstr "ຊື່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ສຳລັບຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນ SMTP (ຖ້າມີ)"

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_notifications.php:167
msgid "Enter the e-mail address username for SMTP authentication."
msgstr "ໃສ່ຊື່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ສຳລັບການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນ SMTP."

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_notifications.php:171
msgid "Notification E-Mail auth password"
msgstr "ລະຫັດຜ່ານສຳລັບຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນ SMTP"

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_notifications.php:175
msgid "Enter the e-mail account password for SMTP authentication."
msgstr "ໃສ່ລະຫັດຜ່ານສຳລັບການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນ SMTP."

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_notifications.php:179
msgid "Notification E-Mail auth mechanism"
msgstr "ກົນໄກການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນ SMTP"

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_notifications.php:182
msgid "Select the authentication mechanism used by the SMTP server. Most work with PLAIN, some servers like Exchange or Office365 might require LOGIN. "
msgstr "ເລືອກກົນໄກການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນທີ່ໃຊ້ໂດຍເຊີເວີ SMTP. ສ່ວນໃຫຍ່ແມ່ນໃຊ້ງານໄດ້ກັບ PLAIN, ບາງເຊີເວີເຊັ່ນ Exchange ຫຼື Office365 ອາດຈະຕ້ອງການ LOGIN. "

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_notifications.php:186
msgid "Test SMTP Settings"
msgstr "ທົດສອບການຕັ້ງຄ່າ SMTP"

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_notifications.php:189
msgid "A test notification will be sent even if the service is marked as disabled.  The last SAVED values will be used, not necessarily the values entered here."
msgstr "ຈະມີການສົ່ງການແຈ້ງເຕືອນທົດສອບ (ໃຊ້ຄ່າຫຼ້າສຸດທີ່ບັນທຶກໄວ້)."

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_notifications.php:194
msgid "Sounds"
msgstr "ສຽງ"

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_notifications.php:198
msgid "Startup/Shutdown Sound"
msgstr "ສຽງເປີດ/ປິດເຄື່ອງ"

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_notifications.php:201
msgid "When this is checked, startup and shutdown sounds will no longer play."
msgstr "ຖ້າເລືອກ, ຈະບໍ່ມີການຫຼິ້ນສຽງຕອນເປີດ ແລະ ປິດເຄື່ອງ."

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_notifications.php:206
msgid "Telegram"
msgstr "Telegram"

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_notifications.php:210
msgid "Enable Telegram"
msgstr "ເປີດໃຊ້ Telegram"

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_notifications.php:213
msgid "Check this option to enable Telegram notifications. <br>You will need a Telegram Bot and its associated API key. <a href=\"https://core.telegram.org/bots#creating-a-new-bot\" target=\"_blank\">Instructions here.</a>"
msgstr "ເລືອກຊ່ອງນີ້ເພື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ການແຈ້ງເຕືອນ Telegram."

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_notifications.php:217 src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_notifications.php:253
msgid "API Key"
msgstr "API Key"

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_notifications.php:221
msgid "Enter the Bot API key required to authenticate with the Telegram API server."
msgstr "ໃສ່ Bot API key ສຳລັບການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນກັບເຊີເວີ Telegram."

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_notifications.php:225
msgid "Chat ID"
msgstr "Chat ID"

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_notifications.php:230
msgid "Enter the chat ID number (private) or channel @username (public) that will be used to send the notifications to."
msgstr "ໃສ່ໝາຍເລກ Chat ID ຫຼື @username ຂອງຊ່ອງທີ່ຈະໃຫ້ສົ່ງການແຈ້ງເຕືອນໄປ."

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_notifications.php:234
msgid "Test Telegram Settings"
msgstr "ທົດສອບການຕັ້ງຄ່າ Telegram"

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_notifications.php:237 src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_notifications.php:307
msgid "A test notification will be sent even if the service is not enabled.  The last SAVED values will be used, not necessarily the values displayed here."
msgstr "ຈະມີການສົ່ງການແຈ້ງເຕືອນທົດສອບ (ໃຊ້ຄ່າຫຼ້າສຸດທີ່ບັນທຶກໄວ້)."

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_notifications.php:242
msgid "Pushover"
msgstr "Pushover"

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_notifications.php:246
msgid "Enable Pushover"
msgstr "ເປີດໃຊ້ Pushover"

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_notifications.php:249
msgid "Check this option to enable Pushover notifications. <br>An API key will need to be created and entered along with the Pushover account user key. <a href=\"https://pushover.net/api#registration\" target=\"_blank\">API documentation.</a>"
msgstr "ເລືອກຊ່ອງນີ້ເພື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ການແຈ້ງເຕືອນ Pushover."

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_notifications.php:257
msgid "Enter the API key required to authenticate with the Pushover API server. <a href=\"https://pushover.net/apps/build\" target=\"_blank\">Create API key here.</a>"
msgstr "ໃສ່ API key ສຳລັບການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນກັບເຊີເວີ Pushover."

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_notifications.php:261
msgid "User Key"
msgstr "User Key"

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_notifications.php:266
msgid "Enter user key of the Pushover account"
msgstr "ໃສ່ user key ຂອງບັນຊີ Pushover"

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_notifications.php:270
msgid "Notification Sound"
msgstr "ສຽງແຈ້ງເຕືອນ"

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_notifications.php:273
msgid "Select notification sound. <a href=\"https://pushover.net/api#sounds\" target=\"_blank\">Notification Sound documentation with audio.</a>"
msgstr "ເລືອກສຽງແຈ້ງເຕືອນ. <a href=\"https://pushover.net/api#sounds\" target=\"_blank\">ເອກະສານສຽງແຈ້ງເຕືອນພ້ອມຕົວຢ່າງສຽງ.</a>"

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_notifications.php:277
msgid "Message Priority"
msgstr "ລະດັບຄວາມສຳຄັນຂອງຂໍ້ຄວາມ"

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_notifications.php:286
msgid "Select message priority. <a href=\"https://pushover.net/api#priority\" target=\"_blank\">Message Priority documentation.</a>"
msgstr "ເລືອກລະດັບຄວາມສຳຄັນຂອງຂໍ້ຄວາມ. <a href=\"https://pushover.net/api#priority\" target=\"_blank\">ເອກະສານລະດັບຄວາມສຳຄັນຂອງຂໍ້ຄວາມ.</a>"

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_notifications.php:290
msgid "Emergency Priority Notification Retry Interval"
msgstr "ໄລຍະຫ່າງການລອງໃໝ່ສຳລັບການແຈ້ງເຕືອນລະດັບສຸກເສີນ"

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_notifications.php:293
msgid "This specifies how often (in seconds) the Pushover servers will send the same notification for Emergency Priority notifications until the notification is acknowledged. <br>This parameter must have a value of at least 30 seconds between retries. Default is 1 minute."
msgstr "ກຳນົດວ່າເຊີເວີ Pushover ຈະສົ່ງການແຈ້ງເຕືອນເດີມຊ້ຳອີກເທື່ອ (ເປັນວິນາທີ) ສຳລັບການແຈ້ງເຕືອນລະດັບສຸກເສີນ ຈົນກວ່າຈະມີການຕອບຮັບ. <br>ຄ່ານີ້ຕ້ອງມີຢ່າງໜ້ອຍ 30 ວິນາທີ ລະຫວ່າງການລອງໃໝ່. ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນ 1 ນາທີ."

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_notifications.php:297
msgid "Emergency Priority Notification Expiration"
msgstr "ເວລາໝົດອາຍຸຂອງການແຈ້ງເຕືອນລະດັບສຸກເສີນ"

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_notifications.php:300
msgid "This specifies how many seconds the notifications will continue to be retried (every retry seconds) for Emergency Priority notifications until the notification is acknowledged. <br>This parameter must have a maximum value of at most 10800 seconds (3 hours). Default is 5 minutes."
msgstr "ກຳນົດວ່າຈະໃຫ້ລອງສົ່ງການແຈ້ງເຕືອນຄືນໃໝ່ເປັນເວລາຈັກວິນາທີ (ທຸກໆຮອບການລອງໃໝ່) ສຳລັບການແຈ້ງເຕືອນລະດັບສຸກເສີນ ຈົນກວ່າຈະມີການຕອບຮັບ. <br>ຄ່ານີ້ຕ້ອງມີຄ່າສູງສຸດບໍ່ເກີນ 10800 ວິນາທີ (3 ຊົ່ວໂມງ). ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນ 5 ນາທີ."

#: src/usr/local/www/system_advanced_notifications.php:304
