#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_openvpn_server.php:991
msgid "System &gt; Cert. Manager"
msgstr "ລະບົບ &gt; ຕົວຈັດການໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ"

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_openvpn_server.php:1001
msgid "*Server certificate"
msgstr "*ໃບຢັ້ງຢືນເຊີເວີ"

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_openvpn_server.php:1008
msgid "*DH Parameter Length"
msgstr "*ຄວາມຍາວຂອງ DH Parameter"

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_openvpn_server.php:1013
msgid "Only DH parameter sets which exist in /etc/ are shown."
msgstr "ສະແດງສະເພາະຊຸດ DH parameter ທີ່ມີຢູ່ໃນ /etc/ ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_openvpn_server.php:1015
msgid "Generating new or stronger DH parameters is CPU-intensive and must be performed manually."
msgstr "ການສ້າງ DH parameters ໃໝ່ ຫຼື ໃຫ້ມີຄວາມປອດໄພສູງຂຶ້ນ ຈະໃຊ້ການປະມວນຜົນ CPU ສູງ ແລະ ຕ້ອງດຳເນີນການດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ."

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_openvpn_server.php:1016
#, php-format
msgid "Consult %1$sthe doc wiki article on DH Parameters%2$sfor information on generating new or stronger parameter sets."
msgstr "ສຶກສາ %1$sບົດຄວາມໃນ doc wiki ກ່ຽວກັບ DH Parameters%2$s ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນການສ້າງຊຸດ parameter ໃໝ່ ຫຼື ໃຫ້ແຂງແຮງກວ່າເກົ່າ."

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_openvpn_server.php:1011
#, php-format
msgid "Diffie-Hellman (DH) parameter set used for key exchange.%1$s%2$s%3$s"
msgstr "ຊຸດ Diffie-Hellman (DH) parameter ທີ່ໃຊ້ສຳລັບການແລກປ່ຽນລະຫັດ (Key exchange).%1$s%2$s%3$s"

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_openvpn_server.php:1024
msgid "ECDH Curve"
msgstr "ECDH Curve"

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_openvpn_server.php:1027
#, php-format
msgid "The Elliptic Curve to use for key exchange. %1$sThe curve from the server certificate is used by default when the server uses an ECDSA certificate. Otherwise, secp384r1 is used as a fallback."
msgstr "Elliptic Curve ທີ່ໃຊ້ສຳລັບການແລກປ່ຽນລະຫັດ. %1$sໂດຍເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ ຈະໃຊ້ curve ຈາກໃບຢັ້ງຢືນເຊີເວີ ເມື່ອເຊີເວີໃຊ້ໃບຢັ້ງຢືນແບບ ECDSA. ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, ຈະໃຊ້ secp384r1 ເປັນຄ່າສຳຮອງ."

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_openvpn_server.php:1100
#, php-format
msgid "The algorithm used to authenticate data channel packets, and control channel packets if a TLS Key is present.%1$sWhen an AEAD Encryption Algorithm mode is used, such as AES-GCM, this digest is used for the control channel only, not the data channel.%1$sThe server and all clients must have the same setting. While SHA1 is the default for OpenVPN, this algorithm is insecure. "
msgstr "ອັລກໍຣິທຶມທີ່ໃຊ້ໃນການຢືນຢັນແພັກເກັດຊ່ອງຂໍ້ມູນ (Data channel) ແລະ ຊ່ອງຄວບຄຸມ (Control channel) ຫາກມີ TLS Key.%1$sເມື່ອໃຊ້ໂໝດ AEAD Encryption ເຊັ່ນ AES-GCM, ຄ່ານີ້ຈະຖືກໃຊ້ສຳລັບຊ່ອງຄວບຄຸມເທົ່ານັ້ນ, ບໍ່ແມ່ນຊ່ອງຂໍ້ມູນ.%1$sເຊີເວີ ແລະ ລູກຂ່າຍທັງໝົດຕ້ອງມີການຕັ້ງຄ່າຄືກັນ. ເຖິງວ່າ SHA1 ຈະເປັນຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງ OpenVPN, ແຕ່ອັລກໍຣິທຶມນີ້ຖືວ່າບໍ່ປອດໄພແລ້ວ. "

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_openvpn_server.php:1116
msgid "Do Not Check"
msgstr "ບໍ່ຕ້ອງກວດສອບ"

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_openvpn_server.php:1114
msgid "*Certificate Depth"
msgstr "*ລະດັບຄວາມເລິກຂອງໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ"

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_openvpn_server.php:1117
msgid "When a certificate-based client logs in, do not accept certificates below this depth. Useful for denying certificates made with intermediate CAs generated from the same CA as the server."
msgstr "ເມື່ອລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ໃຊ້ໃບຢັ້ງຢືນເຂົ້າລະບົບ, ຈະບໍ່ຍອມຮັບໃບຢັ້ງຢືນທີ່ຢູ່ຕ່ຳກວ່າລະດັບຄວາມເລິກນີ້. ມີປະໂຫຍດໃນການປະຕິເສດໃບຢັ້ງຢືນທີ່ສ້າງຂຶ້ນໂດຍ intermediate CA ທີ່ມາຈາກ CA ດຽວກັບເຊີເວີ."

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_openvpn_server.php:1122
msgid "Strict User-CN Matching"
msgstr "ການກວດສອບ User-CN ຢ່າງເຂັ້ມງວດ"

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_openvpn_server.php:1125
msgid "When authenticating users, enforce a match between the common name of the client certificate and the username given at login."
msgstr "ໃນການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນຜູ້ໃຊ້, ບັງຄັບໃຫ້ Common Name (CN) ໃນໃບຢັ້ງຢືນຂອງລູກຂ່າຍ ກົງກັບຊື່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ (Username) ທີ່ໃຊ້ເຂົ້າລະບົບ."

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_openvpn_server.php:1136
msgid "This is the IPv4 virtual network used for private communications between this server and client hosts expressed using CIDR notation (e.g. 10.0.8.0/24). The first usable address in the network will be assigned to the server virtual interface. The remaining usable addresses will be assigned to connecting clients."
msgstr "ນີ້ແມ່ນເຄືອຂ່າຍສະເໝືອນ IPv4 ທີ່ໃຊ້ສຳລັບການສື່ສານສ່ວນຕົວລະຫວ່າງເຊີເວີນີ້ ແລະ ລູກຂ່າຍ ໂດຍລະບຸໃນຮູບແບບ CIDR (ເຊັ່ນ 10.0.8.0/24). ທີ່ຢູ່ທຳອິດທີ່ໃຊ້ໄດ້ໃນເຄືອຂ່າຍຈະຖືກກຳນົດໃຫ້ກັບອິນເຕີເຟສສະເໝືອນຂອງເຊີເວີ. ສ່ວນທີ່ຢູ່ອື່ນໆທີ່ເຫຼືອຈະຖືກກຳນົດໃຫ້ກັບລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ເຂົ້າມາ."

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_openvpn_server.php:1146
msgid "This is the IPv6 virtual network used for private communications between this server and client hosts expressed using CIDR notation (e.g. fe80::/64). The ::1 address in the network will be assigned to the server virtual interface. The remaining addresses will be assigned to connecting clients."
msgstr "ນີ້ແມ່ນເຄືອຂ່າຍສະເໝືອນ IPv6 ທີ່ໃຊ້ສຳລັບການສື່ສານສ່ວນຕົວລະຫວ່າງເຊີເວີນີ້ ແລະ ລູກຂ່າຍ ໂດຍລະບຸໃນຮູບແບບ CIDR (ເຊັ່ນ fe80::/64). ທີ່ຢູ່ ::1 ຈະຖືກກຳນົດໃຫ້ກັບອິນເຕີເຟສສະເໝືອນຂອງເຊີເວີ. ສ່ວນທີ່ຢູ່ອື່ນໆທີ່ເຫຼືອຈະຖືກກຳນົດໃຫ້ກັບລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ເຂົ້າມາ."

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_openvpn_server.php:1153
msgid "Bridge DHCP"
msgstr "Bridge DHCP"

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_openvpn_server.php:1160
msgid "Bridge Interface"
msgstr "ອິນເຕີເຟສ Bridge"

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_openvpn_server.php:1163
msgid "The interface to which this TAP instance will be bridged. This is not done automatically. This interface must be assigned and the bridge created separately. This setting controls which existing IP address and subnet mask are used by OpenVPN for the bridge. Setting this to \"none\" will cause the Server Bridge DHCP settings below to be ignored."
msgstr "ອິນເຕີເຟສທີ່ TAP instance ນີ້ຈະໃຊ້ Bridge ຫາ. ຂັ້ນຕອນນີ້ບໍ່ໄດ້ເຮັດໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ. ທ່ານຕ້ອງກຳນົດອິນເຕີເຟສ ແລະ ສ້າງ bridge ແຍກຕ່າງຫາກ. ການຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້ຄວບຄຸມວ່າ OpenVPN ຈະໃຊ້ທີ່ຢູ່ IP ແລະ Subnet mask ໃດສຳລັບ bridge. ຫາກເລືອກເປັນ \"none\", ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ Server Bridge DHCP ຂ້າງລຸ່ມຈະຖືກລະເລີຍ."

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_openvpn_server.php:1169
msgid "Bridge Route Gateway"
msgstr "Bridge Route Gateway"

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_openvpn_server.php:1172
msgid "When omitting the <b>IPv4 Tunnel Network</b> for a bridge, connecting clients cannot automatically determine a server-side gateway for <b>IPv4 Local Network(s)</b> or <b>Redirect IPv4 Gateway</b> traffic. When enabled, this option sends the IPv4 address of the selected <b>Bridge Interface</b> to clients which they can then use as a gateway for routing traffic outside of the bridged subnet. OpenVPN does not currently support this mechanism for IPv6."
msgstr "ເມື່ອບໍ່ໄດ້ລະບຸ <b>IPv4 Tunnel Network</b> ສຳລັບ bridge, ລູກຂ່າຍທີ່ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ເຂົ້າມາຈະບໍ່ສາມາດກຳນົດເກດເວຝັ່ງເຊີເວີໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດສຳລັບ <b>IPv4 Local Network(s)</b> ຫຼື <b>Redirect IPv4 Gateway</b>. ເມື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ງານຕົວເລືອກນີ້, ລະບົບຈະສົ່ງທີ່ຢູ່ IPv4 ຂອງ <b>Bridge Interface</b> ທີ່ເລືອກໃຫ້ກັບລູກຂ່າຍ ເພື່ອໃຊ້ເປັນເກດເວໃນການກຳນົດເສັ້ນທາງນອກ subnet ຂອງ bridge. ປັດຈຸບັນ OpenVPN ຍັງບໍ່ຮອງຮັບກົນໄກນີ້ສຳລັບ IPv6."

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_openvpn_server.php:1178
msgid "Server Bridge DHCP Start"
msgstr "Server Bridge DHCP ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ"

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_openvpn_server.php:1181
msgid "When using TAP mode as a multi-point server, a DHCP range may optionally be supplied to use on the interface to which this TAP instance is bridged. If these settings are left blank, DHCP will be passed through to the LAN, and the interface setting above will be ignored."
msgstr "ເມື່ອໃຊ້ໂໝດ TAP ເປັນເຊີເວີແບບຫຼາຍຈຸດ, ສາມາດກຳນົດຊ່ວງ DHCP ເພື່ອໃຊ້ໃນອິນເຕີເຟສທີ່ TAP instance ນີ້ Bridge ຢູ່. ຫາກປ່ອຍວ່າງໄວ້, DHCP ຈະຖືກສົ່ງຜ່ານໄປຍັງ LAN ແລະ ການຕັ້ງຄ່າອິນເຕີເຟສຂ້າງເທິງຈະຖືກລະເລີຍ."

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_openvpn_server.php:1187
msgid "Server Bridge DHCP End"
msgstr "Server Bridge DHCP ສິ້ນສຸດ"

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_openvpn_server.php:1194
msgid "Redirect IPv4 Gateway"
msgstr "ປ່ຽນທິດທາງ IPv4 Gateway"

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_openvpn_server.php:1200
msgid "Redirect IPv6 Gateway"
msgstr "ປ່ຽນທິດທາງ IPv6 Gateway"

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_openvpn_server.php:1207
msgid "IPv4 Local network(s)"
msgstr "ເຄືອຂ່າຍພາຍໃນ IPv4"

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_openvpn_server.php:1210
msgid "IPv4 networks that will be accessible from the remote endpoint. Expressed as a comma-separated list of one or more CIDR ranges. This may be left blank if not adding a route to the local network through this tunnel on the remote machine. This is generally set to the LAN network."
msgstr "ເຄືອຂ່າຍ IPv4 ທີ່ຈະສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງໄດ້ຈາກປາຍທາງ. ລະບຸໃນຮູບແບບ CIDR ແຍກດ້ວຍຈຸດ. ສາມາດປ່ອຍວ່າງໄວ້ໄດ້ ຫາກບໍ່ຕ້ອງການເພີ່ມເສັ້ນທາງໄປຍັງເຄືອຂ່າຍພາຍໃນຜ່ານ tunnel ນີ້ໃນເຄື່ອງປາຍທາງ. ໂດຍທົ່ວໄປແລ້ວຈະກຳນົດເປັນເຄືອຂ່າຍ LAN."

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_openvpn_server.php:1217
msgid "IPv6 Local network(s)"
msgstr "ເຄືອຂ່າຍພາຍໃນ IPv6"

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_openvpn_server.php:1220
msgid "IPv6 networks that will be accessible from the remote endpoint. Expressed as a comma-separated list of one or more IP/PREFIX. This may be left blank if not adding a route to the local network through this tunnel on the remote machine. This is generally set to the LAN network."
msgstr "ເຄືອຂ່າຍ IPv6 ທີ່ຈະສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງໄດ້ຈາກປາຍທາງ. ລະບຸໃນຮູບແບບ IP/PREFIX ແຍກດ້ວຍຈຸດ. ສາມາດປ່ອຍວ່າງໄວ້ໄດ້ ຫາກບໍ່ຕ້ອງການເພີ່ມເສັ້ນທາງໄປຍັງເຄືອຂ່າຍພາຍໃນຜ່ານ tunnel ນີ້ໃນເຄື່ອງປາຍທາງ. ໂດຍທົ່ວໄປແລ້ວຈະກຳນົດເປັນເຄືອຂ່າຍ LAN."

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_openvpn_server.php:1244
msgid "Concurrent connections"
msgstr "ການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ພ້ອມກັນ"

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_openvpn_server.php:1247
msgid "Specify the maximum number of clients allowed to concurrently connect to this server."
msgstr "ລະບຸຈຳນວນລູກຂ່າຍສູງສຸດທີ່ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຫາເຊີເວີນີ້ພ້ອມກັນ."

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_openvpn_server.php:1275
msgid "Push Compression"
msgstr "ສົ່ງຄ່າການບີບອັດ (Push Compression)"

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_openvpn_server.php:1289
msgid "Inter-client communication"
msgstr "ການສື່ສານລະຫວ່າງລູກຂ່າຍ"

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_openvpn_server.php:1296
msgid "Duplicate Connection"
msgstr "ການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຊ້ຳຊ້ອນ"

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_openvpn_server.php:1299
#, php-format
msgid "When set, the same user may connect multiple times. When unset, a new connection from a user will disconnect the previous session. %1$s%1$sUsers are identified by their username or certificate properties, depending on the VPN configuration. This practice is discouraged security reasons, but may be necessary in some environments."
msgstr "ເມື່ອກຳນົດໄວ້, ຜູ້ໃຊ້ດຽວກັນສາມາດເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ໄດ້ຫຼາຍຄັ້ງ. ເມື່ອບໍ່ໄດ້ກຳນົດ, ການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ໃໝ່ຈາກຜູ້ໃຊ້ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ເຊດຊັນເກົ່າຖືກຕັດອອກ. %1$s%1$sຜູ້ໃຊ້ຈະຖືກລະບຸດ້ວຍຊື່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ ຫຼື ຄຸນສົມບັດຂອງໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ, ຂຶ້ນກັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າ VPN. ວິທີນີ້ບໍ່ແນະນຳຍ້ອນເຫດຜົນດ້ານຄວາມປອດໄພ ແຕ່ອາດຈະຈຳເປັນໃນບາງສະພາບແວດລ້ອມ."

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_openvpn_server.php:1311
msgid "Dynamic IP"
msgstr "IP ແບບໄດນາມິກ"

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_openvpn_server.php:1321
#, php-format
msgid "Specifies the method used to supply a virtual adapter IP address to clients when using TUN mode on IPv4.%1$sSome clients may require this be set to \"subnet\" even for IPv6, such as OpenVPN Connect (iOS/Android). Older versions of OpenVPN (before 2.0.9) or clients such as Yealink phones may require \"net30\"."
msgstr "ກຳນົດວິທີການໃຫ້ທີ່ຢູ່ IP ຂອງ virtual adapter ແກ່ລູກຂ່າຍເມື່ອໃຊ້ໂໝດ TUN ໃນ IPv4.%1$sລູກຂ່າຍບາງຊະນິດອາດຈະຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ຕັ້ງເປັນ \"subnet\" ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າຈະເປັນ IPv6 ເຊັ່ນ OpenVPN Connect (iOS/Android). ສ່ວນ OpenVPN ເວີຊັນເກົ່າ (ກ່ອນ 2.0.9) ຫຼື ລູກຂ່າຍເຊັ່ນ ໂທລະສັບ Yealink ອາດຈະຕ້ອງການ \"net30\"."

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_openvpn_server.php:1346
#, php-format
msgid "keepalive helper uses interval and timeout parameters to define ping and ping-restart values as follows:%1$sping = interval%1$sping-restart = timeout*2%1$spush ping = interval%1$spush ping-restart = timeout%1$s"
msgstr "ຕົວຊ່ວຍ keepalive ໃຊ້ພາຣາມິເຕີ interval ແລະ timeout ເພື່ອກຳນົດຄ່າ ping ແລະ ping-restart ດັ່ງນີ້:%1$sping = interval%1$sping-restart = timeout*2%1$spush ping = interval%1$spush ping-restart = timeout%1$s"

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_openvpn_server.php:1384
msgid "Push ping to client"
msgstr "ສົ່ງ ping ໃຫ້ລູກຂ່າຍ"

