msgstr "DNS Server 2"

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_openvpn_server.php:1455
msgid "DNS Server 3"
msgstr "DNS Server 3"

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_openvpn_server.php:1462
msgid "DNS Server 4"
msgstr "DNS Server 4"

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_openvpn_server.php:1469
msgid "Block Outside DNS"
msgstr "ບລັອກ DNS ພາຍນອກ"

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_openvpn_server.php:1472
msgid "Requires Windows 10 and OpenVPN 2.3.9 or later. Only Windows 10 is prone to DNS leakage in this way, other clients will ignore the option as they are not affected."
msgstr "ຕ້ອງການ Windows 10 ແລະ OpenVPN 2.3.9 ຫຼື ໃໝ່ກວ່າ. ມີພຽງ Windows 10 ເທົ່ານັ້ນທີ່ມີໂອກາດເກີດ DNS leakage ໃນຮູບແບບນີ້, ລູກຂ່າຍອື່ນໆຈະລະເລີຍຕົວເລືອກນີ້ເນື່ອງຈາກບໍ່ໄດ້ຮັບຜົນກະທົບ."

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_openvpn_server.php:1476
msgid "Force DNS cache update"
msgstr "ບັງຄັບອັບເດດ DNS cache"

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_openvpn_server.php:1479
msgid "This is known to kick Windows into recognizing pushed DNS servers."
msgstr "ຕົວເລືອກນີ້ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ Windows ຮັບຮູ້ DNS server ທີ່ສົ່ງໄປໃຫ້."

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_openvpn_server.php:1483
msgid "NTP Server enable"
msgstr "ເປີດໃຊ້ງານ NTP Server"

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_openvpn_server.php:1504
msgid "NetBIOS enable"
msgstr "ເປີດໃຊ້ງານ NetBIOS"

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_openvpn_server.php:1507
msgid "If this option is not set, all NetBIOS-over-TCP/IP options (including WINS) will be disabled."
msgstr "ຫາກບໍ່ໄດ້ກຳນົດຕົວເລືອກນີ້, ຕົວເລືອກ NetBIOS-over-TCP/IP ທັງໝົດ (ລວມທັງ WINS) ຈະຖືກປິດໃຊ້ງານ."

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_openvpn_server.php:1514
msgid "Possible options: b-node (broadcasts), p-node (point-to-point name queries to a WINS server), m-node (broadcast then query name server), and h-node (query name server, then broadcast)"
msgstr "ຕົວເລືອກທີ່ເປັນໄປໄດ້: b-node (broadcasts), p-node (point-to-point ສອບຖາມຊື່ໄປຍັງ WINS server), m-node (broadcast ແລ້ວຈຶ່ງສອບຖາມ name server), ແລະ h-node (ສອບຖາມ name server ແລ້ວຈຶ່ງ broadcast)"

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_openvpn_server.php:1519
msgid "Scope ID"
msgstr "Scope ID"

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_openvpn_server.php:1522
msgid "A NetBIOS Scope ID provides an extended naming service for NetBIOS over TCP/IP. The NetBIOS scope ID isolates NetBIOS traffic on a single network to only those nodes with the same NetBIOS scope ID"
msgstr "NetBIOS Scope ID ໃຫ້ບໍລິການຂະຫຍາຍການຕັ້ງຊື່ສຳລັບ NetBIOS ຜ່ານ TCP/IP. NetBIOS scope ID ຈະແຍກທຣາຟິກ NetBIOS ໃນເຄືອຂ່າຍດຽວ ໃຫ້ສະເພາະໂນດ (Node) ທີ່ມີ NetBIOS scope ID ດຽວກັນເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_openvpn_server.php:1528
msgid "WINS server enable"
msgstr "ເປີດໃຊ້ງານ WINS server"

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_openvpn_server.php:1535
msgid "WINS Server 1"
msgstr "WINS Server 1"

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_openvpn_server.php:1542
msgid "WINS Server 2"
msgstr "WINS Server 2"

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_openvpn_server.php:1559
#, php-format
msgid "Enter any additional options to add to the OpenVPN server configuration here, separated by semicolon.%1$sEXAMPLE: push \"route 10.0.0.0 255.255.255.0\""
msgstr "ປ້ອນຕົວເລືອກເພີ່ມເຕີມເພື່ອໃສ່ໃນການຕັ້ງຄ່າ OpenVPN server ທີ່ນີ້, ແຍກດ້ວຍ semicolon (ຈຸດຈ້ຳ).%1$sຕົວຢ່າງ: push \"route 10.0.0.0 255.255.255.0\""

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_openvpn_server.php:1564
msgid "Username as Common Name"
msgstr "ໃຊ້ຊື່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ເປັນ Common Name"

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_openvpn_server.php:1567
msgid "When a user authenticates, if this option is enabled then the username of the client will be used in place of the certificate common name for purposes such as determining Client Specific Overrides."
msgstr "ເມື່ອຜູ້ໃຊ້ຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນ, ຫາກເປີດໃຊ້ງານຕົວເລືອກນີ້ ຊື່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ຂອງລູກຂ່າຍຈະຖືກນຳມາໃຊ້ແທນ Common Name ຂອງໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ ເພື່ອຈຸດປະສົງຕ່າງໆ ເຊັ່ນ ການກຳນົດ Client Specific Overrides."

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_openvpn_server.php:1583
msgid "Send an explicit exit notification to connected clients/peers when restarting or shutting down, so they may immediately disconnect rather than waiting for a timeout. In SSL/TLS Server modes, clients may be directed to reconnect or use the next server. In Peer-to-Peer Shared Key or with a /30 Tunnel Network, this value controls how many times this instance will attempt to send the exit notification."
msgstr "ສົ່ງການແຈ້ງເຕືອນການອອກ (Exit notification) ທີ່ຊັດເຈນໄປຍັງລູກຂ່າຍ/ເພື່ອນຮ່ວມ (Peers) ທີ່ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຢູ່ ເມື່ອມີການ restart ຫຼື ປິດລະບົບ ເພື່ອໃຫ້ພວກເຂົາຕັດການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ໄດ້ທັນທີແທນທີ່ຈະລໍຖ້າໃຫ້ໝົດເວລາ (Timeout). ໃນໂໝດ SSL/TLS Server, ລູກຂ່າຍອາດຈະຖືກແນະນຳໃຫ້ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ໃໝ່ ຫຼື ໃຊ້ເຊີເວີຖັດໄປ. ໃນໂໝດ Peer-to-Peer Shared Key ຫຼື ກັບເຄືອຂ່າຍ Tunnel ແບບ /30, ຄ່ານີ້ຈະຄວບຄຸມຈຳນວນຄັ້ງທີ່ instance ນີ້ຈະພະຍາຍາມສົ່ງການແຈ້ງເຕືອນການອອກ."

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_openvpn_server.php:1624
msgid "If you assign a virtual interface to this OpenVPN server, this setting controls which gateway types will be created. The default setting is 'both'."
msgstr "ຫາກທ່ານກຳນົດອິນເຕີເຟສສະເໝືອນໃຫ້ກັບ OpenVPN server ນີ້, ການຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້ຈະຄວບຄຸມປະເພດຂອງເກດເວທີ່ຈະຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນ. ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນ 'both' (ທັງສອງ)."

