#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_ipsec_settings.php:374
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Whether a particular participant ID should be kept unique, with any new IKE_SA using an ID deemed to replace all old ones using that ID. Participant IDs normally are unique, so a new IKE_SA using the same ID is almost invariably intended to replace an old one. The difference between %1$sno%2$s and %1$snever%2$s is that the old IKE_SAs will be replaced when receiving an INITIAL_CONTACT notify if the option is no but will ignore these notifies if %1$snever%2$s is configured. The daemon also accepts the value %1$skeep%2$s to reject new IKE_SA setups and keep the "
"duplicate established earlier. Defaults to Yes."
msgstr "ກຳນົດວ່າ ID ຂອງຜູ້ເຂົ້າຮ່ວມຄວນຈະເປັນແບບສະເພາະ (Unique) ຫຼື ບໍ່, ໂດຍ IKE_SA ໃໝ່ທີ່ໃຊ້ ID ດຽວກັນຈະຖືກຖືວ່າເຂົ້າມາແທນທີ່ SA ເກົ່າທັງໝົດທີ່ໃຊ້ ID ນັ້ນ. ໂດຍປົກກະຕິແລ້ວ ID ຜູ້ເຂົ້າຮ່ວມຈະເປັນແບບສະເພາະ ດັ່ງນັ້ນ IKE_SA ໃໝ່ທີ່ໃຊ້ ID ເດີມຈຶ່ງມັກຈະມີໄວ້ເພື່ອແທນທີ່ອັນເກົ່າ. ຄວາມແຕກຕ່າງລະຫວ່າງ %1$sno%2$s ແລະ %1$snever%2$s ຄື: SA ເກົ່າຈະຖືກແທນທີ່ເມື່ອໄດ້ຮັບການແຈ້ງເຕືອນ INITIAL_CONTACT ຫາກຕັ້ງເປັນ no, ແຕ່ຈະລະເລີຍການແຈ້ງເຕືອນເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຫາກຕັ້ງເປັນ %1$snever%2$s. ນອກຈາກນີ້ daemon ຍັງຮອງຮັບຄ່າ %1$skeep%2$s ເພື່ອປະຕິເສດການສ້າງ IKE_SA ໃໝ່ ແລະ ຮັກສາອັນເກົ່າທີ່ຊ້ຳກັນໄວ້. ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນ Yes."

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_ipsec_settings.php:386
msgid "IPsec Filter Mode"
msgstr "ຮູບແບບການກອງ (Filter) ຂອງ IPsec"

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_ipsec_settings.php:390
#, php-format
msgid "Experimental. Controls how the firewall will filter IPsec traffic. By default, rules on the IPsec tab filter all IPsec traffic, including both tunnel mode and VTI mode. %3$sThis is limited in that it does not allow for filtering on assigned VTI interfaces, and it does not support features such as NAT rules and reply-to for return routing. When set to filter on assigned VTI interfaces, %1$sall tunnel mode traffic is blocked%2$s. Do not set this option unless %1$sall%2$s IPsec tunnels are using VTI."
msgstr "ຮູບແບບທົດລອງ. ຄວບຄຸມວິທີທີ່ໄຟວໍຈະກອງທຣາຟິກ IPsec. ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ກົດລະບຽບໃນແທັບ IPsec ຈະກອງທຣາຟິກ IPsec ທັງໝົດ, ລວມທັງ tunnel mode ແລະ VTI mode. %3$sຂໍ້ຈຳກັດຄືມັນບໍ່ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ກອງໃນອິນເຕີເຟສ VTI ທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້ ແລະ ບໍ່ຮອງຮັບຟີເຈີເຊັ່ນ ກົດລະບຽບ NAT ແລະ reply-to ສຳລັບການກຳນົດເສັ້ນທາງກັບ. ເມື່ອກຳນົດໃຫ້ກອງໃນອິນເຕີເຟສ VTI, %1$sທຣາຟິກ tunnel mode ທັງໝົດຈະຖືກບລັອກ%2$s. ຫ້າມຕັ້ງຄ່າຕົວເລືອກນີ້ ນອກຈາກວ່າ %1$sທຸກໆ%2$s IPsec tunnel ຈະໃຊ້ VTI ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_ipsec_settings.php:401
msgid "IP Compression"
msgstr "ການບີບອັດ IP (IP Compression)"

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_ipsec_settings.php:404
msgid "IPComp compression of content is proposed on the connection."
msgstr "ມີການສະເໜີໃຫ້ໃຊ້ການບີບອັດເນື້ອຫາແບບ IPComp ໃນການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່."

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_ipsec_settings.php:408 src/usr/local/www/services_dnsmasq.php:343
msgid "Strict interface binding"
msgstr "ການຜູກມັດອິນເຕີເຟສຢ່າງເຂັ້ມງວດ"

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_ipsec_settings.php:411
msgid "Enable strongSwan's interfaces_use option to bind specific interfaces only. This option is known to break IPsec with dynamic IP interfaces. This is not recommended at this time."
msgstr "ເປີດໃຊ້ງານຕົວເລືອກ interfaces_use ຂອງ strongSwan ເພື່ອຜູກມັດກັບອິນເຕີເຟສທີ່ລະບຸເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ຕົວເລືອກນີ້ອາດຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ IPsec ມີບັນຫາກັບອິນເຕີເຟສທີ່ເປັນ dynamic IP. ຍັງບໍ່ແນະນຳໃຫ້ໃຊ້ໃນເວລານີ້."

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_ipsec_settings.php:415
msgid "Unencrypted payloads in IKEv1 Main Mode"
msgstr "Payload ທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ເຂົ້າລະຫັດໃນ IKEv1 Main Mode"

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_ipsec_settings.php:419
msgid "Some implementations send the third Main Mode message unencrypted, probably to find the PSKs for the specified ID for authentication. This is very similar to Aggressive Mode, and has the same security implications: A passive attacker can sniff the negotiated Identity, and start brute forcing the PSK using the HASH payload. It is recommended to keep this option to no, unless the exact implications are known and compatibility is required for such devices (for example, some SonicWall boxes)."
msgstr "ບາງລະບົບອາດຈະສົ່ງຂໍ້ຄວາມ Main Mode ທີສາມໂດຍບໍ່ໄດ້ເຂົ້າລະຫັດ ເພື່ອຫາ PSK ສຳລັບ ID ທີ່ລະບຸໃນການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນ. ວິທີນີ້ຄ້າຍຄືກັບ Aggressive Mode ແລະ ມີຄວາມສ່ຽງດ້ານຄວາມປອດໄພຄືກັນ: ຜູ້ໂຈມຕີສາມາດດັກຈັບຂໍ້ມູນ Identity ແລະ ເລີ່ມເຮັດ brute force ເພື່ອຫາ PSK ໂດຍໃຊ້ HASH payload. ແນະນຳໃຫ້ຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້ເປັນ no ນອກຈາກວ່າທ່ານຈະຮູ້ຜົນກະທົບຢ່າງຊັດເຈນ ຫຼື ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງໃຊ້ເພື່ອໃຫ້ເຂົ້າກັບອຸປະກອນບາງຊະນິດ (ເຊັ່ນ ກ່ອງ SonicWall ບາງລຸ້ນ)."

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_ipsec_settings.php:427
msgid "Maximum IKEv1 Phase 2 Exchanges"
msgstr "ຈຳນວນສູງສຸດຂອງ IKEv1 Phase 2 Exchanges"

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_ipsec_settings.php:432
msgid "IKEv1 phase 2 rekeying for one VPN gateway can be initiated in parallel. By default only 3 parallel rekeys are allowed. Undersized values can break VPN connections with many phase 2 definitions. If unsure, set this value to match the largest number of phase 2 entries on any phase 1."
msgstr "ການເຮັດ rekeying ຂອງ IKEv1 phase 2 ສຳລັບເກດເວ VPN ດຽວກັນສາມາດເຮັດພ້ອມກັນໄດ້. ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ເຮັດພ້ອມກັນໄດ້ພຽງ 3 ລາຍການ. ຫາກກຳນົດຄ່າຕ່ຳເກີນໄປ ອາດຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ VPN ທີ່ມີການກຳນົດ phase 2 ຫຼາຍລາຍການມີບັນຫາ. ຫາກບໍ່ໝັ້ນໃຈ, ໃຫ້ຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້ໃຫ້ກົງກັບຈຳນວນ phase 2 ທີ່ຫຼາຍທີ່ສຸດໃນ phase 1 ໃດໜຶ່ງ."

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_ipsec_settings.php:439
msgid "Enable Maximum MSS"
msgstr "ເປີດໃຊ້ງານ Maximum MSS"

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_ipsec_settings.php:444 src/usr/local/www/vpn_ipsec_settings.php:453
msgid "Maximum MSS"
msgstr "Maximum MSS"

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_ipsec_settings.php:457
msgid "Enable MSS clamping on TCP flows over VPN. This helps overcome problems with PMTUD on IPsec VPN links. If left blank, the default value is 1400 bytes. "
msgstr "ເປີດໃຊ້ງານ MSS clamping ສຳລັບ TCP flows ຜ່ານ VPN. ສິ່ງນີ້ຊ່ວຍແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາ PMTUD ໃນການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ IPsec VPN. ຫາກປ່ອຍວ່າງໄວ້, ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນ 1400 ໄບຕ໌. "

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_ipsec_settings.php:465
msgid "Enable Cisco Extensions"
msgstr "ເປີດໃຊ້ງານ Cisco Extensions"

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_ipsec_settings.php:468
msgid "Enable Unity Plugin which provides Cisco Extension support such as Split-Include, Split-Exclude and Split-Dns."
msgstr "ເປີດໃຊ້ງານ Unity Plugin ເຊິ່ງຮອງຮັບ Cisco Extension ເຊັ່ນ Split-Include, Split-Exclude ແລະ Split-Dns."

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_ipsec_settings.php:472
msgid "Strict CRL Checking"
msgstr "ການກວດສອບ CRL ຢ່າງເຂັ້ມງວດ"

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_ipsec_settings.php:475
msgid "Check this to require availability of a fresh CRL for peer authentication based on certificate signatures to succeed."
msgstr "ເລືອກຕົວເລືອກນີ້ເພື່ອບັງຄັບໃຫ້ມີການກວດສອບ CRL ທີ່ເປັນປັດຈຸບັນ ເພື່ອໃຫ້ການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນຜ່ານລາຍເຊັນໃນໃບຢັ້ງຢືນສຳເລັດ."

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_ipsec_settings.php:479
msgid "Make before Break"
msgstr "ສ້າງກ່ອນຕັດ (Make before Break)"

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_ipsec_settings.php:482
msgid "Instead of a break-before-make scheme. Make-before-break uses overlapping IKE and CHILD_SA during reauthentication by first recreating all new SAs before deleting the old ones. This behavior can be beneficial to avoid connectivity gaps during reauthentication, but requires support for overlapping SAs by the peer."
msgstr "ແທນທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ຮູບແບບຕັດກ່ອນສ້າງ (break-before-make), Make-before-break ຈະໃຊ້ການຊ້ອນທັບຂອງ IKE ແລະ CHILD_SA ໃນລະຫວ່າງການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນໃໝ່ ໂດຍການສ້າງ SA ໃໝ່ທັງໝົດກ່ອນ ແລ້ວຈຶ່ງລຶບອັນເກົ່າອອກ. ວິທີນີ້ມີປະໂຫຍດໃນການຫຼີກລ່ຽງການຂາດຫາຍຂອງການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ໃນລະຫວ່າງການຢືນຢັນຕົວຕົນໃໝ່ ແຕ່ປາຍທາງຕ້ອງຮອງຮັບການຊ້ອນທັບຂອງ SA ດ້ວຍ."

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_ipsec_settings.php:488
msgid "Asynchronous Cryptography"
msgstr "ການເຂົ້າລະຫັດແບບອະຊິງໂຄຣນັດ (Asynchronous Cryptography)"

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_ipsec_settings.php:491
msgid "Allow crypto(9) jobs to be dispatched multi-threaded to increase performance. Jobs are handled in the order they are received so that packets will be reinjected in the correct order."
msgstr "ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ວຽກງານ crypto(9) ປະມວນຜົນແບບ multi-threaded ເພື່ອເພີ່ມປະສິດທິພາບ. ວຽກງານຈະຖືກຈັດການຕາມລຳດັບທີ່ໄດ້ຮັບ ເພື່ອໃຫ້ແພັກເກັດຖືກສົ່ງກັບເຂົ້າໄປໃນລຳດັບທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ."

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_ipsec_settings.php:494
msgid "Custom ports"
msgstr "ກຳນົດພອດເອງ"

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_ipsec_settings.php:497
msgid "IKE port"
msgstr "ພອດ IKE"

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_ipsec_settings.php:501
msgid "Local UDP port for IKE (Default: 500)"
msgstr "ພອດ UDP ພາຍໃນສຳລັບ IKE (ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ: 500)"

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_ipsec_settings.php:505
msgid "NAT-T port"
msgstr "ພອດ NAT-T"

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_ipsec_settings.php:509
msgid "Local UDP port for NAT-T (Default: 4500)"
msgstr "ພອດ UDP ພາຍໃນສຳລັບ NAT-T (ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ: 4500)"

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_ipsec_settings.php:514
msgid "Auto-exclude LAN address"
msgstr "ຍົກເວັ້ນທີ່ຢູ່ LAN ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ"

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_ipsec_settings.php:517
msgid "Exclude traffic from LAN subnet to LAN IP address from IPsec."
msgstr "ຍົກເວັ້ນທຣາຟິກຈາກ LAN subnet ໄປຍັງ LAN IP ບໍ່ໃຫ້ຜ່ານ IPsec."

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_ipsec_settings.php:521
msgid "Additional IPsec bypass"
msgstr "IPsec bypass ເພີ່ມເຕີມ"

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_ipsec_settings.php:524
msgid "Create extra rules to exclude specific traffic from IPsec."
msgstr "ສ້າງກົດລະບຽບເພີ່ມເຕີມເພື່ອຍົກເວັ້ນທຣາຟິກບາງຊະນິດບໍ່ໃຫ້ຜ່ານ IPsec."

#: src/usr/local/www/vpn_ipsec_settings.php:528
msgid "IPsec bypass rules"
msgstr "ກົດລະບຽບ IPsec bypass"

#: src/usr/local/www/graph_cpu.php:78
msgid "Cannot get CPU load"
msgstr "ບໍ່ສາມາດດຶງຂໍ້ມູນການໃຊ້ງານ CPU ໄດ້"

#: src/usr/local/www/status_logs_settings.php:88 src/usr/local/www/status_logs_settings.php:353
msgid "Reset Log Files"
msgstr "ລ້າງໄຟລ໌ບັນທຶກ (Reset Log)"

#: src/usr/local/www/status_logs_settings.php:90
msgid "The log files have been reset."
msgstr "ລ້າງໄຟລ໌ບັນທຶກແລ້ວ."

#: src/usr/local/www/status_logs_settings.php:97
msgid "A valid IP address/hostname or IP/hostname:port must be specified for remote syslog server #1."
msgstr "ຕ້ອງລະບຸທີ່ຢູ່ IP/ຊື່ໂຮສ ຫຼື IP/ຊື່ໂຮສ:ພອດ ທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງສຳລັບ remote syslog server #1."

#: src/usr/local/www/status_logs_settings.php:100
msgid "A valid IP address/hostname or IP/hostname:port must be specified for remote syslog server #2."
msgstr "ຕ້ອງລະບຸທີ່ຢູ່ IP/ຊື່ໂຮສ ຫຼື IP/ຊື່ໂຮສ:ພອດ ທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງສຳລັບ remote syslog server #2."

#: src/usr/local/www/status_logs_settings.php:103
msgid "A valid IP address/hostname or IP/hostname:port must be specified for remote syslog server #3."
msgstr "ຕ້ອງລະບຸທີ່ຢູ່ IP/ຊື່ໂຮສ ຫຼື IP/ຊື່ໂຮສ:ພອດ ທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງສຳລັບ remote syslog server #3."

#: src/usr/local/www/status_logs_settings.php:107
msgid "Number of log entries to show must be between 5 and 200000."
msgstr "ຈຳນວນລາຍການບັນທຶກທີ່ຈະສະແດງ ຕ້ອງຢູ່ລະຫວ່າງ 5 ຫາ 200000."

#: src/usr/local/www/status_logs_settings.php:126
msgid "Invalid Log Message Format."
msgstr "ຮູບແບບຂໍ້ຄວາມບັນທຶກບໍ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ."

#: src/usr/local/www/status_logs_settings.php:130
msgid "Invalid log compression type."
msgstr "ປະເພດການບີບອັດບັນທຶກບໍ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ."

#: src/usr/local/www/status_logs_settings.php:207
msgid "Changed system logging options."
msgstr "ປ່ຽນແປງຕົວເລືອກການບັນທຶກຂອງລະບົບແລ້ວ."

#: src/usr/local/www/status_logs_settings.php:235
#, php-format
msgid "This field controls the size at which logs will be rotated. By default this is %s per log file, and there are nearly 20 such log files."
msgstr "ຊ່ອງນີ້ຄວບຄຸມຂະໜາດຂອງໄຟລ໌ບັນທຶກທີ່ຈະມີການຜັດປ່ຽນ (Rotate). ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນ %s ຕໍ່ໄຟລ໌ ແລະ ມີໄຟລ໌ບັນທຶກດັ່ງກ່າວເກືອບ 20 ໄຟລ໌."

#: src/usr/local/www/status_logs_settings.php:237
msgid "NOTE: Increasing this value allows every log file to grow to the specified size, so disk usage may increase significantly."
msgstr "ໝາຍເຫດ: ການເພີ່ມຄ່ານີ້ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ໄຟລ໌ບັນທຶກທຸກໄຟລ໌ສາມາດຂະຫຍາຍໃຫຍ່ຂຶ້ນຕາມຂະໜາດທີ່ລະບຸ ເຊິ່ງອາດຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ການໃຊ້ພື້ນທີ່ດິດເພີ່ມຂຶ້ນຢ່າງຫຼວງຫຼາຍ."

#: src/usr/local/www/status_logs_settings.php:238
msgid "Log file sizes are checked once per minute to determine if rotation is necessary, so a very rapidly growing log file may exceed this value."
msgstr "ຂະໜາດໄຟລ໌ບັນທຶກຈະຖືກກວດສອບທຸກໆນາທີເພື່ອເບິ່ງວ່າຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງຜັດປ່ຽນໄຟລ໌ ຫຼື ບໍ່ ດັ່ງນັ້ນໄຟລ໌ທີ່ມີການບັນທຶກໄວຫຼາຍອາດຈະມີຂະໜາດເກີນຄ່ານີ້ໄດ້."

#: src/usr/local/www/status_logs_settings.php:239
msgid "Disk space currently used by log files is: "
msgstr "ພື້ນທີ່ດິດທີ່ໄຟລ໌ບັນທຶກໃຊ້ຢູ່ໃນປັດຈຸບັນແມ່ນ: "

#: src/usr/local/www/status_logs_settings.php:240
msgid " Remaining disk space for log files: "
msgstr " ພື້ນທີ່ດິດທີ່ເຫຼືອສຳລັບໄຟລ໌ບັນທຶກ: "

#: src/usr/local/www/status_logs_settings.php:242
msgid "This option will allow the logging daemon to bind to a single IP address, rather than all IP addresses."
msgstr "ຕົວເລືອກນີ້ຈະອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ logging daemon ຜູກມັດກັບທີ່ຢູ່ IP ດຽວ ແທນທີ່ຈະເປັນທີ່ຢູ່ IP ທັງໝົດ."

#: src/usr/local/www/status_logs_settings.php:243
msgid "If a single IP is picked, remote syslog servers must all be of that IP type. To mix IPv4 and IPv6 remote syslog servers, bind to all interfaces."
msgstr "ຫາກເລືອກທີ່ຢູ່ IP ດຽວ, remote syslog server ທັງໝົດຕ້ອງເປັນປະເພດ IP ນັ້ນ. ຫາກຕ້ອງການໃຊ້ທັງ IPv4 ແລະ IPv6 ໃຫ້ຜູກມັດກັບທຸກອິນເຕີເຟສ."

#: src/usr/local/www/status_logs_settings.php:245
msgid "NOTE: If an IP address cannot be located on the chosen interface, the daemon will bind to all addresses."
msgstr "ໝາຍເຫດ: ຫາກບໍ່ພົບທີ່ຢູ່ IP ໃນອິນເຕີເຟສທີ່ເລືອກ, daemon ຈະຜູກມັດກັບທຸກທີ່ຢູ່."

#: src/usr/local/www/status_logs_settings.php:263
msgid "General Logging Options"
msgstr "ຕົວເລືອກການບັນທຶກທົ່ວໄປ"

#: src/usr/local/www/status_logs_settings.php:267
msgid "Log Message Format"
msgstr "ຮູບແບບຂໍ້ຄວາມບັນທຶກ"

#: src/usr/local/www/status_logs_settings.php:270
#, php-format
msgid "The format of syslog messages written to disk locally and sent to remote syslog servers (if enabled).%sChanging this value will only affect new log messages."
msgstr "ຮູບແບບຂອງຂໍ້ຄວາມ syslog ທີ່ບັນທຶກລົງດິດພາຍໃນ ແລະ ສົ່ງໄປຍັງ remote syslog server (ຫາກເປີດໃຊ້ງານ).%sການປ່ຽນຄ່ານີ້ຈະມີຜົນສະເພາະກັບຂໍ້ຄວາມບັນທຶກໃໝ່ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

#: src/usr/local/www/status_logs_settings.php:287
msgid "This is only the number of log entries displayed in the GUI. It does not affect how many entries are contained in the actual log files."
msgstr "ນີ້ແມ່ນພຽງແຕ່ຈຳນວນລາຍການບັນທຶກທີ່ຈະສະແດງໃນ GUI ເທົ່ານັ້ນ. ມັນບໍ່ມີຜົນກັບຈຳນວນລາຍການທີ່ມີຢູ່ໃນໄຟລ໌ບັນທຶກແທ້ໆ."

#: src/usr/local/www/status_logs_settings.php:294
#, php-format
msgid "Log packets that are %1$sblocked%2$s by the implicit default block rule. - Per-rule logging options are still respected."
msgstr "ບັນທຶກແພັກເກັດທີ່ຖືກ %1$sບລັອກ%2$s ໂດຍກົດລະບຽບບລັອກເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ. - ຕົວເລືອກການບັນທຶກຂອງແຕ່ລະກົດລະບຽບຍັງຄົງມີຜົນຢູ່."

#: src/usr/local/www/status_logs_settings.php:301
#, php-format
msgid "Log packets that are %1$sallowed%2$s by the implicit default pass rule. - Per-rule logging options are still respected. "
msgstr "ບັນທຶກແພັກເກັດທີ່ຖືກ %1$sອະນຸຍາດ%2$s ໂດຍກົດລະບຽບອະນຸຍາດເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ. - ຕົວເລືອກການບັນທຶກຂອງແຕ່ລະກົດລະບຽບຍັງຄົງມີຜົນຢູ່. "

#: src/usr/local/www/status_logs_settings.php:322
msgid "If this is checked, errors from the web server process for the GUI or Captive Portal will appear in the main system log."
msgstr "ຫາກເລືອກຕົວເລືອກນີ້, ຂໍ້ຜິດພາດຈາກເວັບເຊີເວີຂອງ GUI ຫຼື Captive Portal ຈະປະກົດຢູ່ໃນບັນທຶກຫຼັກຂອງລະບົບ."

#: src/usr/local/www/status_logs_settings.php:326
msgid "Raw Logs"
msgstr "ບັນທຶກແບບດິບ (Raw Logs)"

#: src/usr/local/www/status_logs_settings.php:329
msgid "If this is checked, filter logs are shown as generated by the packet filter, without any formatting. This will reveal more detailed information, but it is more difficult to read."
msgstr "ຫາກເລືອກຕົວເລືອກນີ້, ບັນທຶກການກອງ (Filter) ຈະຖືກສະແດງຕາມທີ່ຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນໂດຍ packet filter ໂດຍບໍ່ມີການຈັດຮູບແບບ. ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະສະແດງຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ລະອຽດກວ່າ ແຕ່ຈະອ່ານຍາກກວ່າ."

#: src/usr/local/www/status_logs_settings.php:346
msgid "Local Logging"
msgstr "ການບັນທຶກພາຍໃນເຄື່ອງ (Local Logging)"

#: src/usr/local/www/status_logs_settings.php:356
msgid "Clears all local log files and reinitializes them as empty logs. This also restarts the DHCP daemon. Use the Save button first if any setting changes have been made."
msgstr "ລຶບບັນທຶກພາຍໃນທັງໝົດ ແລະ ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໃໝ່ເປັນໄຟລ໌ວ່າງ. ນອກຈາກນີ້ຍັງຈະ restart DHCP daemon. ກະລຸນາກົດປຸ່ມ Save ກ່ອນ ຫາກມີການປ່ຽນແປງການຕັ້ງຄ່າໃດໆ."

#: src/usr/local/www/status_logs_settings.php:359
msgid "Log Rotation Options"
msgstr "ຕົວເລືອກການຜັດປ່ຽນບັນທຶກ (Log Rotation)"

#: src/usr/local/www/status_logs_settings.php:371
msgid "Log Compression"
msgstr "ການບີບອັດບັນທຶກ"

#: src/usr/local/www/status_logs_settings.php:374
#, php-format
msgid "The type of compression to use when rotating log files. Compressing rotated log files saves disk space, and the compressed logs remain available for display and searching in the GUI.%s WARNING: Changing this value will remove previously rotated compressed log files!"
msgstr "ປະເພດການບີບອັດທີ່ຈະໃຊ້ເມື່ອມີການຜັດປ່ຽນໄຟລ໌ບັນທຶກ. ການບີບອັດໄຟລ໌ທີ່ຜັດປ່ຽນແລ້ວຈະຊ່ວຍປະຢັດພື້ນທີ່ດິດ ແລະ ບັນທຶກທີ່ຖືກບີບອັດຍັງສາມາດສະແດງຜົນ ແລະ ຄົ້ນຫາໄດ້ໃນ GUI.%s ຄຳເຕືອນ: ການປ່ຽນຄ່ານີ້ຈະລຶບໄຟລ໌ບັນທຶກທີ່ຖືກບີບອັດໄວ້ກ່ອນໜ້ານີ້!"

#: src/usr/local/www/status_logs_settings.php:387
msgid "Remote Logging Options"
msgstr "ຕົວເລືອກການບັນທຶກໄລຍະໄກ (Remote Logging)"

#: src/usr/local/www/status_logs_settings.php:392
