#: src/etc/inc/shaper.inc:4411 src/etc/inc/shaper.inc:4856
msgid "Destination addresses"
msgstr "ທີ່ຢູ່ປາຍທາງ"

#: src/etc/inc/shaper.inc:4409 src/etc/inc/shaper.inc:4854
msgid "Mask"
msgstr "ມາກ (Mask)"

#: src/etc/inc/shaper.inc:4412
msgid "If \"source\" or \"destination\" slots is chosen a dynamic pipe with the bandwidth, delay, packet loss and queue size given above will be created for each source/destination IP address encountered, respectively. This makes it possible to easily specify bandwidth limits per host or subnet."
msgstr "ຖ້າເລືອກຊ່ອງ \"ຕົ້ນທາງ\" (source) ຫຼື \"ປາຍທາງ\" (destination), ລະບົບຈະສ້າງທໍ່ສັນຍານ (pipe) ແບບໄດນາມິກ ທີ່ມີແບນວິດ, ດີເລ (delay), ການສູນເສຍແພັກເກັດ ແລະ ຂະໜາດຄິວຕາມທີ່ກຳນົດຂ້າງເທິງ ໃຫ້ກັບແຕ່ລະ IP ຕົ້ນທາງ/ປາຍທາງທີ່ກວດພົບ. ສິ່ງນີ້ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ສາມາດກຳນົດຂີດຈຳກັດແບນວິດຕໍ່ໂຮສ໌ ຫຼື ຕໍ່ເຄືອຂ່າຍຍ່ອຍໄດ້ງ່າຍຂຶ້ນ."

#: src/etc/inc/shaper.inc:4423 src/etc/inc/shaper.inc:4870
#, php-format
msgid "IPv4 mask bits%1$s%2$s"
msgstr "ບິດຕົວມາກ IPv4 %1$s%2$s"

#: src/etc/inc/shaper.inc:4430 src/etc/inc/shaper.inc:4877
#, php-format
msgid "IPv6 mask bits%1$s%2$s"
msgstr "ບິດຕົວມາກ IPv6 %1$s%2$s"

#: src/etc/inc/shaper.inc:4450 src/etc/inc/shaper.inc:4896
msgid "Queue Management Algorithm"
msgstr "ອັລກໍຣິດທຶມການຈັດການຄິວ"

#: src/etc/inc/shaper.inc:4455
msgid "Active queue management (AQM) is the intelligent drop of network packets inside the limiter, when it becomes full or gets close to becoming full, with the goal of reducing network congestion."
msgstr "Active queue management (AQM) ແມ່ນການຖິ້ມແພັກເກັດເຄືອຂ່າຍຢ່າງຊານສະຫຼາດພາຍໃນ limiter ເມື່ອມັນເຕັມ ຫຼື ໃກ້ຈະເຕັມ, ໂດຍມີເປົ້າໝາຍເພື່ອຫຼຸດຜ່ອນການແອອັດຂອງເຄືອຂ່າຍ."

#: src/etc/inc/shaper.inc:4462 src/etc/inc/shaper.inc:4908
msgid "Specifies the queue management algorithm parameters."
msgstr "ກຳນົດພາຣາມີເຕີຂອງອັລກໍຣິດທຶມການຈັດການຄິວ."

#: src/etc/inc/shaper.inc:4466
msgid "Scheduler"
msgstr "ຕົວຈັດຕາຕະລາງ"

#: src/etc/inc/shaper.inc:4471
msgid "The scheduler manages the sequence of network packets in the limiter's queue."
msgstr "ຕົວຈັດຕາຕະລາງຈະຈັດການລຳດັບຂອງແພັກເກັດເຄືອຂ່າຍໃນຄິວຂອງ limiter."

#: src/etc/inc/shaper.inc:4476
msgid "Specifies the scheduler parameters."
msgstr "ກຳນົດພາຣາມີເຕີຂອງຕົວຈັດຕາຕະລາງ."

#: src/etc/inc/shaper.inc:4480 src/etc/inc/shaper.inc:4912
msgid "Queue length"
msgstr "ຄວາມຍາວຄິວ"

#: src/etc/inc/shaper.inc:4483
msgid "Specifies the length of the limiter's queue, which the scheduler and AQM are responsible for. This field may be left empty."
msgstr "ກຳນົດຄວາມຍາວຂອງຄິວໃນ limiter ເຊິ່ງຕົວຈັດຕາຕະລາງ ແລະ AQM ຈະເປັນຜູ້ເບິ່ງແຍງ. ຊ່ອງນີ້ສາມາດປະວ່າງໄວ້ໄດ້."

#: src/etc/inc/shaper.inc:4488 src/etc/inc/shaper.inc:4919
msgid "ECN"
msgstr "ECN"

#: src/etc/inc/shaper.inc:4492 src/etc/inc/shaper.inc:4923
msgid "ECN sets a reserved TCP flag when the queue is nearing or exceeding capacity. Not all AQMs or schedulers support this."
msgstr "ECN ຈະຕັ້ງຄ່າ TCP flag ທີ່ສຳຮອງໄວ້ ເມື່ອຄິວໃກ້ຈະເຕັມ ຫຼື ເກີນຄວາມຈຸ. ບໍ່ແມ່ນ AQM ຫຼື ຕົວຈັດຕາຕະລາງທັງໝົດທີ່ຈະຮອງຮັບຟັງຊັນນີ້."

#: src/etc/inc/shaper.inc:4504
msgid "In most cases, zero (0) should specified here (or leave the field empty)."
msgstr "ໃນກໍລະນີສ່ວນໃຫຍ່, ຄວນກຳນົດເປັນສູນ (0) ຫຼື ປະຊ່ອງນີ້ໄວ້ວ່າງ."

#: src/etc/inc/shaper.inc:4508 src/etc/inc/shaper.inc:4941
msgid "Packet Loss Rate"
msgstr "ອັດຕາການສູນເສຍແພັກເກັດ"

#: src/etc/inc/shaper.inc:4512
msgid "In most cases, zero (0) should be specified here (or leave the field empty). A value of 0.001 means one packet in 1000 gets dropped."
msgstr "ໃນກໍລະນີສ່ວນໃຫຍ່, ຄວນກຳນົດເປັນສູນ (0) ຫຼື ປະຊ່ອງນີ້ໄວ້ວ່າງ. ຄ່າ 0.001 ໝາຍເຖິງ ແພັກເກັດ 1 ໃນ 1000 ຈະຖືກຖິ້ມ."

#: src/etc/inc/shaper.inc:4517 src/etc/inc/shaper.inc:4950
msgid "Bucket size (slots)"
msgstr "ຂະໜາດ Bucket (ຊ່ອງ)"

#: src/etc/inc/shaper.inc:4520
msgid "In most cases, this field should be left empty. It increases the hash size set."
msgstr "ໃນກໍລະນີສ່ວນໃຫຍ່, ຄວນປະຊ່ອງນີ້ໄວ້ວ່າງ. ມັນຈະຊ່ວຍເພີ່ມຂະໜາດ hash ທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້."

#: src/etc/inc/shaper.inc:4643
msgid "Explicit Congestion Notification is selected, but "
msgstr "ມີການເລືອກ Explicit Congestion Notification ແຕ່ "

#: src/etc/inc/shaper.inc:4649
msgid "Weight must be an integer between 1 and 100."
msgstr "ນ້ຳໜັກ (Weight) ຕ້ອງເປັນຕົວເລກຖ້ວນລະຫວ່າງ 1 ຫາ 100."

#: src/etc/inc/shaper.inc:4857
msgid "If \"source\" or \"destination\" slots is chosen a dynamic queue with the bandwidth, delay, packet loss and queue size given above will be created for each source/destination IP address encountered, respectively. This makes it possible to easily specify bandwidth limits per host or subnet, usually capped by the bandwidth of the parent limiter."
msgstr "ຖ້າເລືອກຊ່ອງ \"ຕົ້ນທາງ\" ຫຼື \"ປາຍທາງ\", ລະບົບຈະສ້າງຄິວແບບໄດນາມິກ ທີ່ມີແບນວິດ, ດີເລ, ການສູນເສຍແພັກເກັດ ແລະ ຂະໜາດຄິວຕາມທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້ ໃຫ້ກັບແຕ່ລະ IP ຕົ້ນທາງ/ປາຍທາງ. ສິ່ງນີ້ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ກຳນົດຂີດຈຳກັດແບນວິດຕໍ່ໂຮສ໌ ຫຼື ເຄືອຂ່າຍຍ່ອຍໄດ້ງ່າຍ, ເຊິ່ງປົກກະຕິແລ້ວຈະຖືກຈຳກັດໂດຍແບນວິດຂອງ limiter ຫຼັກ."

#: src/etc/inc/shaper.inc:4901
msgid "Active queue management (AQM) is the intelligent drop of network packets inside this limiter's queue, when it becomes full or gets close to becoming full, with the goal of reducing network congestion."
msgstr "Active queue management (AQM) ແມ່ນການຖິ້ມແພັກເກັດເຄືອຂ່າຍຢ່າງຊານສະຫຼາດພາຍໃນຄິວຂອງ limiter ນີ້ ເມື່ອມັນເຕັມ ຫຼື ໃກ້ຈະເຕັມ, ເພື່ອຫຼຸດຜ່ອນການແອອັດຂອງເຄືອຂ່າຍ."

#: src/etc/inc/shaper.inc:4915
msgid "Specifies the length of this queue, which the AQM is responsible for.  This field may be left empty."
msgstr "ກຳນົດຄວາມຍາວຂອງຄິວນີ້ ເຊິ່ງ AQM ຈະເປັນຜູ້ເບິ່ງແຍງ. ຊ່ອງນີ້ສາມາດປະວ່າງໄວ້ໄດ້."

#: src/etc/inc/shaper.inc:4936
msgid "For queues under the same parent this specifies the share that a queue gets(values range from 1 to 100), it can be left blank otherwise."
msgstr "ສຳລັບຄິວທີ່ຢູ່ພາຍໃຕ້ parent ດຽວກັນ, ສ່ວນນີ້ກຳນົດສ່ວນແບ່ງທີ່ຄິວຈະໄດ້ຮັບ (ຄ່າລະຫວ່າງ 1 ຫາ 100), ຖ້າບໍ່ດັ່ງນັ້ນສາມາດປະວ່າງໄວ້ໄດ້."

#: src/etc/inc/shaper.inc:4945
msgid "In most cases, zero (0) should be specified here (or leave the field empty). A value of 0.001 means one packet in 1000 gets dropped"
msgstr "ໃນກໍລະນີສ່ວນໃຫຍ່, ຄວນກຳນົດເປັນສູນ (0) ຫຼື ປະຊ່ອງນີ້ໄວ້ວ່າງ. ຄ່າ 0.001 ໝາຍເຖິງ ແພັກເກັດ 1 ໃນ 1000 ຈະຖືກຖິ້ມ"

#: src/etc/inc/shaper.inc:4953
msgid "In most cases, this field should be left empty. It increases the hash size set"
msgstr "ໃນກໍລະນີສ່ວນໃຫຍ່, ຄວນປະຊ່ອງນີ້ໄວ້ວ່າງ. ມັນຈະຊ່ວຍເພີ່ມຂະໜາດ hash ທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້"

#: src/etc/inc/shaper.inc:5357
msgid "Clone Shaper to this Interface"
msgstr "ຄັດລອກ (Clone) Shaper ໄປຍັງອິນເຕີເຟສນີ້"

