#: src/etc/inc/priv/user.priv.inc:61
msgid "User - System: Copy files to home directory (chrooted scp)"
msgstr "ຜູ້ໃຊ້ - ລະບົບ: ການຄັດລອກໄຟລ໌ໄປຍັງໂຟນເດີຫຼັກ (chrooted scp)"

#: src/etc/inc/priv/user.priv.inc:62
msgid "Indicates whether this user is allowed to copy files to the home directory via SCP/SFTP.Note: User - System - Copy files (scp) conflicts with this privilege.Warning: Manual chroot setup required, see /usr/local/etc/rc.d/scponlyc."
msgstr "ລະບຸວ່າຜູ້ໃຊ້ນີ້ຖືກອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ຄັດລອກໄຟລ໌ໄປຍັງໂຟນເດີຫຼັກ (home) ຜ່ານ SCP/SFTP ຫຼືບໍ່. ໝາຍເຫດ: ສິດ 'User - System - Copy files (scp)' ຈະຂັດແຍ້ງກັບສິດນີ້. ຄຳເຕືອນ: ຕ້ອງມີການຕັ້ງຄ່າ chroot ດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ, ເບິ່ງ /usr/local/etc/rc.d/scponlyc."

#: src/etc/inc/priv/user.priv.inc:67
msgid "User - System: SSH tunneling"
msgstr "ຜູ້ໃຊ້ - ລະບົບ: ການສ້າງທໍ່ SSH (SSH tunneling)"

#: src/etc/inc/priv/user.priv.inc:68
msgid "Indicates whether the user is able to login for tunneling via SSH when they have no shell access. Note: User - System - Copy files (scp) and System: Copy files to home directory (chrooted scp) conflict with this privilege."
msgstr "ລະບຸວ່າຜູ້ໃຊ້ສາມາດເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບເພື່ອສ້າງທໍ່ SSH ໄດ້ຫຼືບໍ່ ໃນກໍລະນີທີ່ບໍ່ມີສິດເຂົ້າເຖິງ shell. ໝາຍເຫດ: ສິດ Copy files (scp) ແລະ Chrooted scp ຈະຂັດແຍ້ງກັບສິດນີ້."

#: src/etc/inc/priv/user.priv.inc:75
msgid "User - VPN: IPsec xauth Dialin"
msgstr "ຜູ້ໃຊ້ - VPN: ການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຜ່ານ IPsec xauth"

